return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T14:49:50+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T14:49:50+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Sakin tushe na sabon Page Builder Sandwich: allon saituna da na Game da mu, tsarin fitarwa na gaba wanda ba ya barin sawun SEO, da kuma toshe ɗaya na samfurin abun ciki.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn Digital® answered, but not with a connection this plugin understands. Nothing was saved.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta ba da amsa, amma ba tare da haɗin da wannan manhajar ta fahimta ba. Ba a ajiye komai ba.','This site has forgotten its connection. Zinn Digital® could not be told just now, so support staff will see it as unused until it is removed on their side.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya manta haɗin sa. Ba a iya sanar da Zinn Digital® a yanzu ba, don haka ma\'aikatan tallafi za su gan shi a matsayin wanda ba a amfani da shi har sai an cire shi a ɓangarensu.','The Zinn Digital® address this site is set to use is not a secure (https) address, so nothing was sent.'=>'Adireshin Zinn Digital® da aka saita wannan rukunin yanar gizo ya yi amfani da shi ba amintaccen adireshi (https) ba ne, don haka ba a aika komai ba.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached from this site. Check that the site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Ba a iya samun Zinn Digital® daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Duba ko rukunin yanar gizon na 