 don sauri da kuma shafukan yanar gizo a cikin yaruka da yawa.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Duba sabis ɗin ɗaukar nauyin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Dauki kwararren WordPress a ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Kasuwar \'yan kwangila don zane, haɓakawa, fassarawa da ayyukan SEO na WordPress.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Ziyarci ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Karfafa shafuka da yawa da kuma karɓar baƙuncin PBN','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd dandali ne namu don karɓar baƙuncin shafuka da sarrafa shafuka da yawa a lokaci ɗaya.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Ziyarci PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Sami Page Builder Sandwich Pro da Tranzly Pro tare','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Kunshiyar tana da sauƙin kuɗi fiye da siyan duk manhajojin ƙari biyu daban-daban, a kan tsare-tsare da iyakar shafuka ɗaya.','See the bundle'=>'Duba kunshin','Get %s'=>'Sami %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Haɗin yana aiki: %1$s da %2$s suna aiki tare','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s yana aiki a kan wannan shafin, don haka duka kayan aikin biyu suna raba saiti guda na makullan mai ba da sabis na AI da allon saituna guda ɗaya dominsu.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Fassara wannan shafi tare da Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Gina shafuka a bayyane tare da Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, daga Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Buga kowane shafi a cikin yaruka da yawa, tare da fassarar adireshi, bayanan SEO da kuma mai canza yare. Yana aiki tare da shafukan da kuke ginawa a nan.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Kera shafuka kai tsaye a cikin edita tare da tubalan da ke da sauri kuma ba sa barin sawu. Duk abin da kuka gina yana fassara tare da Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s an yi shi ne daga ƙungiyar ɗaya kuma yana aiki tare da wannan plugin ɗin.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Da farko amince da haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Shigar da ingantaccen adireshin imel.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Ka amince da aika bayanin tallafi tukuna.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Rubuta jigo da saƙo.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel wanda masu ba da taimako za su iya ba da amsa zuwa gare shi.','AI providers'=>'Masu ba da sabis na AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu kera ChatGPT. Mai amfani ta kowane fanni.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu kera Claude. Sun kware a rubutu da zurfin tunani mai kyau.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfuran Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da araha.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Wani kamfanin AI na Turai mai samfuran masu sauri da araha.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfuran masu ƙarancin kuɗi waɗanda suka ƙware wajen rubutu da lissafin lamba.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Mabuɗi ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban da yawa.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar OpenAI API, gami da samfurin da ke aiki a kan kwamfutarku ko uwar garkenku.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi idan babu wani takamaiman abu da aka saita)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubutawa da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lambar sirri da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Kayi hakuri, ba ku da izinin shiga wannan shafin.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan ana raba su ne da kowane manhaja da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Makullin ku an rufa musu asiri a cikin rumbun adana bayanai na wannan rukunin yanar gizo kuma ana tura su ne kawai ga mai ba da sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa — ba za a taɓa tura mana ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 cikin 2: zaɓi mai bada sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo makullin kanku, saboda haka kuna biyan mai bada sabis kai tsaye bisa abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbaci? Kowanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki da kyau; za ku iya ƙara wasu daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 cikin 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku mai dacewa da OpenAI, wanda ke ƙarewa da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Bude %s kuma ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri asusu na kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin maɓallan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon mabuɗi sannan ka kwafi shi.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Manna shi a ƙasa sannan ka danna "Ajiye kuma gwada". Muna aika ƙaramar buƙata guda ɗaya don duba ko yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis suna buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'Ƙara kuɗi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zaɓi wani mai bada sabis na daban','Address'=>'Adireshi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Mabuɗin da aka ajiye yana ƙarewa da …%s — manna sabo domin maye gurbinsa','Key (optional)'=>'Mabuɗi (na zaɓi)','API key'=>'Maɓallin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma gwada','Providers'=>'Masu Ba da Sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Mabuɗi','Get a key'=>'Sami maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwajin','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Wani sabon sigar plugin ne ya ajiye: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma sake shigar da maɓallin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya sake buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba (maɓallan tsaro na rukunin yanar gizon sun canza). Sake shigar da shi.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa — gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara a %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin ƙarshe ya faskara: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane samfuri za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ tana nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da mabuɗinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis ɗin.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawararsa don mai ba da sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu bada sabis','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini don ƙirƙirar hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na mai bada sabis na farko da aka haɗa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Binciken shafi (shigarwa)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don gina ma\'ajiyar bincike ta rukunin yanar gizonku.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin sakawa na farkon mai bada sabis da aka haɗa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Sauya wannan zai sake gina ma\'ajiyar bincike ta kowane manhajar da ke amfani da shi.','best quality'=>'inganci mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi arha','fastest'=>'Mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfur da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Wani samfuri ya fito yau? Manna ainihin sunansa domin amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfuri','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfuri','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tantance jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna wata shawara ba. Sake shigar da manhajar kari (plugin), ko kunna sabuntawa ta kowace rana a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an buga shi a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar manhaja yana zuwa da sabo.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Kuma duba Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don sabon jerin.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kawai buƙatar saukewa ta yau da kullun ce ake aikawa: babu kowane maɓalli, babu adireshin shafi, babu wani abu game da abin da ke cikin shafinku. An sanya wa jerin hannu, kuma ana yin watsi da duk wani jeri da ya gaza wajen tantance sa hannun.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Duba na ƙarshe %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan duba yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jeri','already up to date'=>'an riga an sabunta shi','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'zazzagewar ta fadi gwajin sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da ita','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba a iya samun Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da aiki','turned off'=>'An kashe','Open'=>'Bude','Check their status page'=>'Duba shafinsu na matsayi','Open your billing page'=>'Bude shafinku na biyan kudi','Open your API keys page'=>'Bude shafinku na makullin API','Open the AI settings'=>'Bude saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Kayi hakuri, ba a ba ku izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mai ba da sabis da ba a sani ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku, misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafar sa, ba tare da sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Manna mabuɗin API ɗinka da farko.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An ajiye samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar da ainihin sunan samfurin, misali yadda takardun mai bayarwa suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An ƙara %s. Zaɓe shi a ƙarƙashin "Wane samfuri za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire ƙirar.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa ta yau da kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da manhajar plugin.','Checked: %s.'=>'An duba: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfura.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon juzu\'i na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinku ne ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinku. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya sake buɗe maɓallin AI ɗinku da aka ajiye ba (maɓallan tsaro na rukunin yanar gizon sun canza). Sake shigar da shi a saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara mabuɗi don mai ba da sabis na AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi wani samfuri don wannan aiki ba. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai bada sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa a wannan sigar ta manhajar ba.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu mai samar da AI da zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna da aka haɗa. Ƙara maɓallin OpenAI ko Google Gemini a cikin saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai bada sabis na AI ba zai iya yin hotuna ba. Zabi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Mabuɗin AI ɗinku ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin hoto ba. Bincika izinin mabuɗin tare da mai bayarwa, ko zaɓi wani mai bayarwa daban don hotuna.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu wani mai ba da sabis na AI da aka haɗa da zai iya gina fihirisar bincike. Ƙara maɓallin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Mabuɗin AI ɗinku ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin sakawa ba. Bincika izinin mabuɗin tare da mai bada sabis, ko zaɓi wani mai bada sabis daban don binciken shafi.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya gina ma\'ajiyar bincike ba. Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko sabis mai dacewa don binciken rukunin yanar gizo.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kasa tuntuɓar sabis ɗin AI ɗinku. Bincika ko yana aiki kuma ana iya samun adireshinsa daga sabar gidan yanar gizonku (ba za a iya samun sabis ɗin da ke kan kwamfutarku ta kanku daga rukunin yanar gizo mai masauki ba).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kasa isa ga %s. Bincika shafin matsayinsu; idan yana aiki, mai masaukin bakin ku na iya toshe haɗin waje, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai ba ne.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da sauran kiredit ko adadin da aka kayyade. Ƙara kiredit ko ɗaga iyakarka a cikin asusunka da ke wurinsu, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin ku ba. Yana iya yiwuwa an yi kuskuren rubutawa, an soke shi ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma liƙa shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan bukata ta mabudinku. Wataƙila maɓallin ba shi da damar amfani da wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusunku yana bukatar tantancewa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Samfurin "%1$s" ba ya samuwa daga %2$s don maɓallinku ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin daban a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarinku na %2$s ba ya haɗa da samfurin "%1$s". Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko kuma ku inganta tsarinku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s yana iyakance yadda maɓallinku zai iya aika buƙatu cikin sauri. Jira na minti ɗaya sannan ku sake gwadawa, ko ku ƙara iyakar ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s na fuskantar matsaloli a yanzu haka (katsewar aiki ko cunkoso a ɓangarensu). Babu wata matsala game da saitunanku. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Bukatar AI ta faskara saboda wani dalili da ba mu iya gano shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan na ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen tallafi tare da cikakkun bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a cikin wani tsari wanda wannan plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin daban ko tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Na musamman (mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Ajiye mabuɗi na wannan mai bada sabis ɗin tukunna.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Mabuɗinku yana aiki, amma mai bada sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu don shi ba. Ƙara samfuri da kanku a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya amsa ta hanyar amfani da %2$s. Abubuwan AI ɗinku sun shirya don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Matsayin mai amfani naku ba shi da izinin amfani da AI a wannan rukunin yanar gizo. Tuntubi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kai iyakar kashe kuɗin AI na kowane wata. Mai gudanarwa na iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizo ya kai iyakar buƙatun AI na kowane wata. Mai gudanarwa na iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da farashi','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Rajista, iyaka da kuma izinin matsayi suna aiki ne akan AI da aka yi amfani da ita ta hanyar: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudade kiyasin ne, an lissafa su ne daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da ba shi da sanannen farashi ana ɗaukarsa a matsayin sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan watan: buƙatun %1$s, kusan %2$s.','When'=>'Yaushe','Who'=>'Wane ne','Used for'=>'An yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfuri','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamomin shiga / fita','About'=>'Game da','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a riga an yi wani buƙatar AI ba tukunna.','Done'=>'An kammala','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakacin kashe kudi na wata-wata (dala na US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi a wofi idan babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kusan kuɗin da aka kashe ya kai shi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakacin buƙatun kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar a wofi idan ba iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wadanda za su iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Kada ka zabi ko daya don barin duk wanda zai iya amfani da fasalolin manhajar ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi a kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izinai','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An ajiye iyakoki da izinai.','The post or page ID.'=>'ID ɗin rubutu ko shafi.','Write or rewrite text with AI'=>'Rubuta ko sake rubuta rubutu tare da AI','Writes new text, or improves, shortens, expands, changes the tone of or fixes the grammar of a piece of text, with the site\'s own AI provider. Returns the new text; nothing on the site is changed.'=>'Yana rubuta sabon rubutu, ko inganta, gajarta, faɗaɗa, canza yanayin sauti ko gyara ƙa\'idojin nahawu na wani sashe na rubutu, tare da mai samar da AI na shafin kansa. Yana dawo da sabon rubutun; babu abin da aka canza a shafin.','Generate a section with AI'=>'Ƙirƙiri wani sashe da AI','Turns a one-sentence description into a ready-designed section (real, editable blocks in the site\'s brand style) with text written for it. Returns the block markup, and adds it to the start or end of a page when a post_id is given (a revision keeps what was there before).'=>'Yana mai da bayanin jimla ɗaya zuwa wani sashe da aka riga aka tsara (ainihin tubalan da za a iya gyarawa a cikin salon alamar rukunin yanar gizon) tare da rubutun da aka rubuta masa. Yana mayar da alamar tubalin, kuma yana ƙara shi a farkon ko ƙarshen shafi lokacin da aka ba da post_id (bita yana adana abin da ke wurin a baya).','Suggest an SEO title and description with AI'=>'Ba da shawarar taken SEO da bayani tare da AI','Reads a page and suggests a meta title (up to 60 characters) and meta description (up to 155), optionally around a focus keyword. Nothing is saved.'=>'Yana karanta shafi kuma yana ba da shawarar meta taken (har zuwa haruffa 60) da bayanin meta (har zuwa 155), na zaɓi dangane da maɓallin kalmar mayar da hankali. Ba a ajiye komai ba.','Save an SEO title and description'=>'Ajiye kanun labarai da bayanin SEO','Saves a meta title and description into the SEO plugin the site uses (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO) and says which ones were written.'=>'Yana adana kan labari da bayanin meta a cikin toshewar SEO da shafin ke amfani da shi (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress ko All in One SEO) kuma yana bayyana wadanda aka rubuta.','Write image alt text with AI'=>'Rubuta rubutun alt na hoto tare da AI','Looks at images and saves alt text for them: one image (attachment_id), or every image on a page that has none (post_id). At most 20 images per call; the answer says how many remain.'=>'Yana duba hotuna kuma yana adana rubutun alt dominsu: hoto ɗaya (attachment_id), ko kowane hoto a shafi wanda ba shi da shi (post_id). Aƙalla hotuna 20 ga kowane kira; amsar tana faɗin adadin da ya rage.','Undo an AI change'=>'Soke canjin AI','Puts a page back the way it was before an AI change, from the undo_revision that change returned.'=>'Yana mayar da shafi yadda yake kafin canjin AI, daga undo_revision ɗin da canjin ya dawo da shi.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'Ba a samun AI a wannan ginin ba.','The AI answered in a form the builder cannot read. Try again, or choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'AI ta ba da amsa a tsarin da magini ba zai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa, ko zaɓi wani samfurin daban a saitunan AI.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Bukatar AI ta gaza. Sake gwadawa.','The AI rewrote %1$d of %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was changed. Try again.'=>'AI ta sake rubuta guntu %1$d daga cikin guntayen rubutu %2$d, saboda haka babu abin da aka canza. Sake gwadawa.','The AI used blocks this site does not have (%s), so nothing was changed. Try again.'=>'AI ta yi amfani da tubalan da wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da su (%s), don haka ba a canza komai ba. Sake gwadawa.','The AI answer contained markup your account may not save, so nothing was changed.'=>'Amsar AI tana dauke da alamar da asusunka ba zai iya adanawa ba, don haka ba a canza komai ba.','There is no such post, or you may not edit it.'=>'Babu wannan rubutun, ko kuma ba ku da ikon gyara shi.','That change can no longer be undone: its saved copy is gone.'=>'Ba za a iya soke wannan canjin ba kuma: kwafinsa da aka ajiye ya ɓace.','The change could not be undone. Restore it from the post\'s revisions instead.'=>'Ba a iya soke canjin ba. Maimakon haka ka dawo da shi daga bita-bitar rubutun.','The page has too little text to write a description from. Add content first.'=>'Shafin yana da ɗan rubutu kaɗan da za a rubuta bayani daga gare shi. Fara da ƙara abun ciki.','No supported SEO plugin is active (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO), so there is nowhere to save the meta title and description.'=>'Babu wani abin da aka goyi bayan SEO da ke aiki (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress ko All in One SEO), don haka babu inda za a ajiye taken meta da bayanin meta.','That is not an image you may edit.'=>'Wannan ba hoton da kake iya gyarawa ba ne.','Only PNG, JPEG, GIF and WebP images can be described.'=>'Hotunan PNG, JPEG, GIF da WebP kawai za a iya siffanta.','The image is too large to send to the AI (4 MB at most).'=>'Hoton ya yi girma da yawa don a aika shi zuwa AI (mafi yawa 4 MB).','Unknown AI writing action.'=>'Aikin rubutu na AI da ba a sani ba.','There is no text to rewrite. Type some first, or ask AI to write it.'=>'Babu rubutun da za a sake rubutawa. Rubuta wani abu da farko, ko ka nemi AI ta rubuta shi.','Say what the text should be about.'=>'Faɗi abin da ya kamata rubutun ya kasance a kai.','Choose one of the offered tones.'=>'Zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin sautunan da aka bayar.','That is too much text for one AI request. Select a shorter part.'=>'Wannan rubutun ya yi yawa don buƙatar AI guda ɗaya. Zaɓi ɓangare mafi guntu.','The AI returned no text. Try again.'=>'AI ɗin bai dawo da wani rubutu ba. Sake gwadawa.','Describe the section in a sentence (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'Bayyana sashin a cikin jumla ɗaya (har zuwa haruffa 2,000).','There are no sections in the library to build from.'=>'Babu wasu sashe a cikin dakin karatu da za a gina daga ciki.','There is no section called "%s".'=>'Babu wani sashe mai suna "%s".','The AI did not choose a section from the library. Pick one yourself, or describe it differently.'=>'AI ba ta zaɓi wani sashe daga dakin karatu ba. Zaɓi ɗaya da kanka, ko kuma ka siffanta shi ta wata hanya.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Kuskuren tsaro, da fatan za a sake loda shafin kuma a sake gwadawa.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan wasiƙar labarai sun ɓace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan wasiƙar labarai ba daidai ba ne. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula.','Invalid email address.'=>'Adireshin imel mara inganci.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Da fatan za a duba akwatin don yarda kafin yin rajista.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'An yi yunƙuri da yawa. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wani abu ya sami matsala. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula.','Map'=>'Taswira','Background video'=>'Bidiyon bango','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: fayilolin rubutu %2$d da aka adana, salon shafi na %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Ba a ajiye wannan iyali ba.','Removed.'=>'An cire.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Wannan ba ingantaccen sunan dangin rubutu (font family) ba ne.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts ba ta dawo da wannan dangin ba. Bincika sunan sannan ku sake gwadawa.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya saukewa ko ajiye fayilolin rubutun ba. Bincika ko ana iya rubutu a babban fayil ɗin lodawa.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya adana takardar salon rubutu (stylesheet) ba. Bincika ko za a iya rubutawa a cikin babban fayil ɗin lodawa (uploads).','Dismiss this notice'=>'Kore wannan sanarwar','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗewa a sabon shafin)','Done:'=>'An kammala:','To do:'=>'Abubuwan yi:','Glossary index'=>'Fihirisar ƙamus','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'An ƙididdige %1$s daga cikin %2$s','Progress'=>'Ci gaba','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Kofa lambar','Copied'=>'An kwafa','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Wannan widget ɗin babu shi a wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Email'=>'Imel','Phone'=>'Waya','RSS feed'=>'Kogin labarai na RSS','Website'=>'Gidan yanar gizo','Link'=>'Mahada','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (yana buɗewa a sabon shafin)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'An ba da ƙimar %d cikin 5','(recommended)'=>'(wanda aka ba da shawara)','Included'=>'An haɗa','Not included'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Comparison table'=>'Teburin kwatantawa','Call %s'=>'Kira %s','Email %s'=>'Imel %s','Text %s'=>'Rubutu %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Yi taɗi a WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Tuntube mu','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Yi hira da mu a WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Wannan fom ba ya samuwa a yanzu.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'Ba za a iya nuna wannan fom ɗin ba saboda %s ba ya aiki.','Map: %s'=>'Taswira: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Nuna taswirar yana ɗauko ta daga OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Nuna taswirar','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Bude taswirar a OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Kalandar yin ajiyar wuri daga %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Nuna kalandar yin ajiyar wuri yana lodawa ne daga %s.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Nuna kalandar yin ajiyar wuri','Book on %s'=>'Yi ajiyar wuri a %s','QR code for %s'=>'Lambar QR don %s','Design'=>'Tsari','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Media'=>'Kafofin watsa labarai','Marketing'=>'Talla','Site'=>'Shafi','Data'=>'Bayanai','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Haɗin gwiwa da iGaming','Related posts'=>'Rubuce-rubuce masu dangantaka','Post details'=>'Bayanin rubutu','By'=>'Daga','Published'=>'An buga','Updated'=>'An sabunta','In'=>'A Cikin','Tagged'=>'An yi wa alama','%d minute read'=>'Karanta cikin minti %d' . "\0" . 'Karatun minti %d','No comments yet'=>'Babu tsokaci tukunna','%d comment'=>'Sharhi %d' . "\0" . 'Sharhi %d','Sitemap'=>'Taswirar shafi','(no title)'=>'(babu take)','All posts by %s'=>'Duk rubuce-rubuce daga %s','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Wannan abun ciki yana da kariya. Shigar da kalmar sirri don ganin sa.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Wannan kalmar sirri ba daidai ba ce. Sake gwadawa.','Password'=>'Kalmar sirri','Show the content'=>'Nuna abun ciki','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe wannan shafi ba.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Yunkuri ya yi yawa. Dakata na ƴan mintuna sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Dole ne kalmar sirri ta kasance tsakanin haruffa 4 zuwa 200 a tsayi.','More'=>'Ƙari','Close'=>'Rufe','Tab %d'=>'Shafi na %d','Contents'=>'Abubuwan ciki','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Rubutun allon gudanarwa sun ɓace daga wannan kwafin na manhajar ƙari. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Harsuna','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Abokin cinikin karɓar baƙuncin yanar gizo ne? Sami rangwamen %1$d%% a kan %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'A matsayin abokin cinikin karɓar baƙuncin gidan yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®, kuna samun lambar sirri ta musamman don samun rangwamen %d%% a biyan kuɗin ku na farko. Sabuntawa yana kan farashin yau da kullun.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Sami lambar rangwame na %d%% kuma je zuwa biya','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Wannan rangwamen na abokan ciniki ne masu tsarin karɓar baƙuncin yanar gizo da aka biya kuma yake cikin kyakkyawan yanayi. Gwaje-gwaje kyauta ba su cancanta ba.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da rangwamen abokin cinikin karɓar baƙuncin gidan yanar gizo don wannan plugin ɗin.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya samun lambar ku ba a yanzu. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintuna.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne prefix ɗin ya kasance haruffa ƙanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, ya fara da harafi, kuma kada ya sanya sunan plugin ɗin.','The kit could not be read. Try again later.'=>'Ba a iya karanta kayan aikin ba. Sake gwadawa anjima.','This kit comes with Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Wannan kayan aiki yana zuwa tare da Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','The kit library could not be reached. Check this site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Ba a iya samun damar shiga dakin karatun kit ba. Duba ko wannan rukunin yanar gizon na iya yin hanyoyin haɗin waje, sannan sake gwadawa.','The kit library refused the request.'=>'Dakin karatu na kit ya ki amincewa da bukatar.','Page Builder Sandwich sections'=>'Sassan Page Builder Sandwich','Ready-made sections from Page Builder Sandwich.'=>'Gundumomin da aka riga aka shirya daga Page Builder Sandwich.','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Casino Guide'=>'Jagoran Gidan Caca','This month\'s top-rated casinos'=>'Gidajen caca mafiya daraja na wannan watan','Scores come from our own tests. Bonuses change often, so always read the terms on the casino\'s site.'=>'Maki sun fito ne daga gwaje-gwajenmu na kanmu. Kyaututtukan kari kan canza akai-akai, don haka ko da yaushe ku karanta sharudda a dandalin gidan caca.','Top-rated casinos compared'=>'Kwatancen gidajen caca mafi daraja','Royal Harbour'=>'Tashar Jirgin Ruwa ta Sarauta','Lucky Meadow'=>'Ciyawar Sa\'a','Star Lantern'=>'Fitilar Tauraro','Our score'=>'Kimaninmu','9.4 / 10'=>'9.4 / 10','9.1 / 10'=>'9.1 / 10','8.8 / 10'=>'8.8 / 10','Welcome offer'=>'Kayan maraba','100% up to 200'=>'Kashi 100% har zuwa 200','50 free spins'=>'Juyi 50 kyauta','150% up to 100'=>'Kashi 150% har zuwa 100','Fast withdrawals'=>'Cire kudi cikin sauri','Live dealer games'=>'Wasannin dillali na kai tsaye','Deposit limits'=>'Iyakokin ajiya','18+ only. Offers are subject to the operator\'s terms and your country\'s rules.'=>'Masu shekaru 18+ kawai. Tayi suna ƙarƙashin sharuɗɗan mai aiki da ƙa\'idodin ƙasarku.','Questions and answers'=>'Tambayoyi da amsoshi','Common questions'=>'Tambayoyi da aka saba yi','Are online casinos legal where I live?'=>'Shin gidajen caca na intanet na da ƙa\'ida a inda nake zama?','It depends on your country and sometimes your region. Only play at casinos licensed for your location, and check the local rules first.'=>'Ya dogara da ƙasarku kuma a wasu lokutan yankinku. Kawai ku yi wasa a gidajen caca masu lasisi don wurinku, kuma ku bincika dokokin gida da farko.','How do you make money?'=>'Ta yaya kuke samun kuɗi?','Through affiliate commissions when readers sign up through our links. Rankings are decided by our tests before any commercial discussion.'=>'Ta hanyar kwamishononin haɗin gwiwa lokacin da masu karatu suka yi rajista ta hanyar hanyoyin haɗinmu. Ana yanke shawarar matsayi ne ta hanyar gwaje-gwajenmu kafin kowace tattaunawa ta kasuwanci.','What is a wagering requirement?'=>'Menene ƙa\'idar yin fare?','The number of times you must bet a bonus before you can withdraw winnings from it. Lower is better.'=>'Adadin sau da dole ne ku yi caca da kyautar kudi kafin ku iya cire kudaden da kuka ci daga ciki. Kadan ya fi kyau.','Features'=>'Siffofi','How we review a casino'=>'Yadda muke duba gidan caca','Every review follows the same checklist, so scores can be compared fairly.'=>'Kowane bita yana bin jerin abubuwan dubawa iri ɗaya, domin a iya kwatanta maki cikin adalci.','Licence and safety'=>'Laasisi da tsaro','We confirm the licence with the regulator and check how player funds are protected.'=>'Muna tabbatar da lasisi tare da hukumar kula kuma muna duba yadda ake kare kudaden \'yan wasa.','Payouts'=>'Biya-biya','We deposit and withdraw with real money and time how long each payout takes.'=>'Muna sanyawa da cire kudi na gaske sannan mu auna tsawon lokacin da kowane biyan kudi ke dauka.','Bonus terms'=>'Sharuɗɗan kari','We read the wagering rules, caps and time limits so you do not have to.'=>'Mun karanta ƙa\'idojin yin caca, iyakokin kuɗi da iyakokin lokaci don kada ku sha wahalar yi.','Games'=>'Wasanni','We look at the game studios, live tables and published return-to-player figures.'=>'Muna duba ɗakunan shirya wasanni, teburan kai tsaye da kuma ƙididdigar ribar da ake mayar wa ɗan wasa da aka buga.','Support'=>'Taimako','We contact support by chat and email and rate the speed and the answers.'=>'Muna tuntuɓar sashen tallafi ta hanyar taɗi da imel kuma muna kimanta saurin da kuma amsoshin.','Responsible play'=>'Wasa mai ma\'ana','We check for deposit limits, reality checks, cool-off periods and self-exclusion.'=>'Muna bincika iyakokin ajiya, tunatarwar gaskiya, lokutan hutawa da kuma cire kai da kanka.','Call to action'=>'Kiran ɗaukar mataki','Charity'=>'Aikin agaji','Help a child go to school'=>'Taimaka wa yaro ya tafi makaranta','Give once or give monthly.'=>'Ba da gudummawa sau ɗaya ko kowane wata.','Donate now'=>'Ba da gudummawa yanzu','Hero'=>'Gwarzo','Registered charity'=>'Ƙungiyar agaji mai rijista','Every child deserves a safe place to learn'=>'Kowane yaro ya cancanci amintaccen wuri don koyo','We build classrooms, train teachers and provide school meals in communities that need them most.'=>'Muna gina azuzuwa, horar da malamai da kuma samar da abincin makaranta a cikin al\'ummomin da suka fi bukatarsu.','Our impact'=>'Tasirinmu','Steps'=>'Matakai','How it works'=>'Yadda yake aiki','You give'=>'Kuna bayarwa','Online, by phone or by post.'=>'Ta intanot, ta wayar tarho ko ta wasika.','We fund projects'=>'Muna ba da tallafin kuɗi ga ayyuka','Chosen with our local partners.'=>'An zaɓa tare da abokan hulɗarmu na gida.','You see the impact'=>'Kuna ganin tasirin','Updates and stories from the field.'=>'Labarai da labarun da suka fito daga fage.','Dental Clinic'=>'Asibitin Hakori','Frequently asked questions'=>'Tambayoyin da aka fi yi','Are you taking new patients?'=>'Kuna karɓar sabbin marasa lafiya?','Yes. You can book your first visit online.'=>'Ee. Za ku iya yin ajiyar ziyararku ta farko a kan layi.','Do you offer payment plans?'=>'Kuna bayar da tsare-tsaren biyan kuɗi?','Yes, interest-free plans are available for larger treatments.'=>'Ee, akwai tsare-tsaren biyan kuɗi marasa ruwa don manyan jiyya.','What if I am nervous?'=>'Idan ina jin fargaba fa?','Tell us when you book. We will take things at your pace.'=>'Ku sanar da mu lokacin da kuka yi ajiyar wuri. Za mu yi abubuwa a kan yanayin tafiyarku.','Accepting new patients'=>'Karɓar sababbin marasa lafiya','Gentle dental care for the whole family'=>'Kula da haƙori cikin sauƙi da tausayi ga dukan iyali','Check-ups, hygiene, whitening and implants in a calm, modern clinic. Nervous patients are always welcome.'=>'Binciken lafiya, tsafta, fari da dashen haƙora a cikin asibiti mai natsuwa da na zamani. Marasa lafiya masu tsoro ana maraba da su a kowane lokaci.','Book an appointment'=>'Yi alƙawari','Our treatments'=>'Jiyoyinmu','Visiting us'=>'Ziyartarmu','Evening and Saturday appointments'=>'Alƙawuran yamma da na Asabar','Clear prices before treatment'=>'Goge farashi kafin magani','Payment plans available'=>'Akwai tsare-tsaren biyan kuɗi','Emergency slots every day'=>'Gurbi na gaggawa a kowace rana','Book online'=>'Yi ajiyar waje ta intanet','Choose a time that suits you.'=>'Zaɓi lokacin da ya dace da kai.','Meet your dentist'=>'Haɗu da likitan haƙoranku','A full check-up and a chat about your goals.'=>'Cikakken bincike da kuma tattaunawa game da burin ku.','Your plan'=>'Tsarinku','A written plan with clear prices and options.'=>'Rubutaccen tsari tare da bayyanannun farashi da zaɓuɓɓuka.','Digital Agency'=>'Hukumar Dijital','Have a project in mind?'=>'Kuna da wani aiki a rai?','Tell us about it and we will reply within a day.'=>'Faɗa mana game da shi kuma za mu ba da amsa a cikin yini guda.','Start a project'=>'Fara aiki','Services'=>'Ayyuka','What we do'=>'Abin da muke yi','Brand identity'=>'Shaidar alama','Names, logos and visual systems that stand out.'=>'Sunaye, tambari da tsare-tsaren na gani da ke ficewa.','Web design and build'=>'Tsara da gina gidan yanar gizo','Fast, accessible websites built to convert.'=>'Shafukan intanet masu sauri, masu sauƙin shiga waɗanda aka gina don kawo sauyi.','E-commerce'=>'Kasuwancin intanet','Online stores that are easy to run and easy to buy from.'=>'Shagunan intanet masu sauƙin gudanarwa da kuma sauƙin siyayya daga gare su.','SEO and content'=>'SEO da abun ciki','Search strategy and content that earns traffic.'=>'Dabarar bincike da abun ciki da ke samar da zirga-zirga.','Paid media'=>'Kafofin watsa labarai da aka biya','Search and social campaigns measured by results.'=>'Yaƙin neman zaɓe na bincike da kafofin watsa labarun da aka auna ta hanyar sakamako.','Care plans'=>'Tsarukan kulawa','Updates, security and improvements every month.'=>'Sabuntawa, tsaro da gyare-gyare kowane wata.','Testimonials'=>'Shaidodi','What our clients say'=>'Abin da abokan cinikayyar mu ke cewa','They understood our business better than we did. Sales doubled in six months.'=>'Sun fahimci kasuwancinmu fiye da yadda muka fahimta. Ciniki ya ninka sau biyu a cikin watanni shida.','Chloe'=>'Chloe','Founder'=>'Wanda ya kafa','Brilliant to work with: fast, honest and very talented.'=>'Yana da kyau kwarai a yi aiki da shi: mai sauri, mai gaskiya kuma mai hazaka sosai.','Omar'=>'Omar','Marketing director'=>'Darakktan tallace-tallace','Fitness Gym'=>'Wurin Motsa Jiki','Open 5am to 11pm'=>'A buɗe daga 5am zuwa 11pm','Stronger every week'=>'Ƙara ƙarfi kowane mako','Coached classes, open gym and personal training for every level. Your first week is on us.'=>'Darussa masu koyarwa, buɗaɗɗiyar dakin motsa jiki, da horarwa ta kashin kai don kowane mataki. Makonku na farko kyauta ne daga gare mu.','Claim a free week'=>'Nemi mako kyauta','See classes'=>'Duba azuzuwa','Lost 12kg and gained a lot of confidence. The coaches are brilliant.'=>'Na rasa kilo 12 kuma na sami kwarin gwiwa sosai. Masu horarwar suna da ƙwarewa sosai.','Rachel'=>'Rachel','Member'=>'Mamba','First gym I have stuck with for more than a month.'=>'Wurin motsa jiki na farko da na ci gaba da zuwa fiye da wata guda.','Sam'=>'Sam','Law Firm'=>'Kamfanin Lauyoyi','Experienced, approachable lawyers'=>'Lauyoyi ƙwararru kuma masu sauƙin kai','We are an independent firm built on long-term relationships. Many of our clients have been with us for decades.'=>'Mu kamfani ne mai zaman kansa wanda aka gina a kan dangantaka ta dogon lokaci. Yawancin abokan cinikinmu sun kasance tare da mu tsawon shekaru da dama.','You will always know who is handling your case, what happens next and what it will cost.'=>'Kullum za ku san wanda ke kula da shari\'arku, abin da zai biyo baya da kuma abin da zai ci.','How we work'=>'Yadda muke aiki','Plain-language advice'=>'Shawarwari a bayyane','Fixed fees where possible'=>'Kafaffen kudade a duk inda zai yiwu','A named solicitor for your case'=>'Lauyan da aka keɓe musamman don shari\'arku','Replies within one working day'=>'Yana ba da amsa a cikin ranar aiki ɗaya','Talk to a solicitor'=>'Yi magana da lauya','Book a free 30-minute consultation.'=>'Yi ajiyar shawarwari ta minti 30 kyauta.','Request a consultation'=>'Nemi shawarwari','Practice areas'=>'Fannonin aiki','Business law'=>'Dokar kasuwanci','Contracts, disputes, shareholder agreements and company formation.'=>'Kwangiloli, rigingimu, yarjejeniyoyin masu hannun jari da kafa kamfani.','Property'=>'Kaddara','Buying, selling, leases and commercial property transactions.'=>'Sayarwa, saye, hayar kadarori da ma\'amalolin kadarorin kasuwanci.','Family law'=>'Dokar iyali','Divorce, children arrangements and financial settlements.'=>'Saki, tsare-tsaren yara da sasantawar kudi.','Employment'=>'Aiki','Advice for employers and employees, from contracts to tribunals.'=>'Shawarwari ga ma\'aikata da ma\'aikata, tun daga kwangiloli har zuwa kotunan sauraron ƙorafe-ƙorafe.','Wills and probate'=>'Wasiyoyi da rabon gado','Wills, lasting powers of attorney and estate administration.'=>'Wasiyyoyi, izinin wakilci na dindindin da kuma sarrafa gadon kadara.','Dispute resolution'=>'Kudurin sasanta rikici','Negotiation, mediation and litigation when it is needed.'=>'Tattaunawa, sulhu da kuma shigar da ƙara a kotu idan ya zama dole.','Local Plumber'=>'Maginin Famfo na Gida','Need a plumber today?'=>'Kuna buƙatar mai aikin famfo a yau?','Call now or book online. Emergency slots available around the clock.'=>'Kira yanzu ko ka yi rajista a yanar gizo. Akwai guraren gaggawa a kowane lokaci.','Book a visit'=>'Yi ajiyar ziyara','Do you charge a call-out fee?'=>'Kuna karɓar kuɗin zuwa aiki?','Our fixed price includes the visit. You will know the cost before we start.'=>'Kafaffen farashinmu ya haɗa da ziyarar. Za ku san kuɗin kafin mu fara.','Which areas do you cover?'=>'Wane yankuna kuke ɗauka?','The whole town and every village within 20 miles.'=>'Daukacin garin da kuma kowane kauye da ke tsakanin mil 20.','Are you insured?'=>'Kuna da inshora?','Yes, fully insured, and every job has a 12-month guarantee.'=>'Ee, an ba da cikakken inshora, kuma kowane aiki yana da garantin watanni 12.','24/7 emergency service'=>'Sabis na gaggawa na 24/7','Fast, friendly plumbing. Fixed right the first time.'=>'Ayyukan famfo cikin sauri da aminci. An gyara daidai tun a karon farko.','Leaks, blocked drains, boilers and bathrooms. Local, insured engineers with upfront prices and a 12-month guarantee on our work.'=>'Yoyon ruwa, toshewar magudanun ruwa, na\'urorin dumama ruwa da bandakuna. Kwararrun injiniyoyi na cikin gida, masu inshora tare da farashi a sarari da kuma garantin watanni 12 akan aikinmu.','Emergency call-out'=>'Kiran gaggawa','Why homeowners choose us'=>'Dalilin da ya sa masu gida suke zaɓar mu','Arrival slots you can plan around'=>'Lokutan isowa da za ku iya tsara abubuwa a kansu','Price agreed before we start'=>'Farashin da aka amince da shi kafin mu fara','Clean, tidy and insured'=>'Mai tsabta, tsararru kuma mai inshora','12-month workmanship guarantee'=>'Garantin aiki na watanni 12','What we fix'=>'Abin da muke gyarawa','From a dripping tap to a full bathroom, one call covers it.'=>'Daga famfon da ke ɗigowa har zuwa cikakken banɗaki, kira ɗaya ya wadatar.','Emergency repairs'=>'Gyare-gyaren gaggawa','Burst pipes, leaks and no water, day or night.'=>'Fasassun bututu, ɗigogi da rashin ruwa, dare ko rana.','Boilers and heating'=>'Tukunyar ruwan zafi da dumamawa','Servicing, repairs and new boiler installs.'=>'Gyara, gyare-gyare da kuma sabon aikin kafa na\'urar dumama ruwa.','Blocked drains'=>'Magudanan ruwa da suka toshe','Sinks, toilets and outside drains cleared fast.'=>'Wanke kwanuka, bandakuna da magudanan ruwa na waje ana share su cikin sauri.','Bathrooms'=>'Dakunan wanka','Design, fitting and tiling, managed start to finish.'=>'Tsari, sakawa da liƙa fale-fale, an tafiyar da su tun daga farko har ƙarshe.','Leak detection'=>'Gano ɓoyayyen yoyo','Hidden leaks found without tearing up the house.'=>'An gano ɓoyayyun ɗigogi ba tare da an ɓata gidan ba.','Landlord checks'=>'Binciken mai gida','Safety certificates and planned maintenance.'=>'Takardun shaida na tsaro da kuma tsarin gyare-gyare da aka tsara.','Came within the hour on a Sunday and fixed the leak. Brilliant.'=>'Sun zo a cikin sa\'a ɗaya a ranar Lahadi kuma sun gyara ɗigon. Madalla.','Helen M.'=>'Helen M.','Homeowner'=>'Mai gida','Fair price, explained everything, left the bathroom spotless.'=>'Farashi mai sauƙi, ya bayyana komai sarai, ya bar banɗakin da tsabta fes.','Tom R.'=>'Tom R.','We use them for all our rental properties. Always reliable.'=>'Muna amfani da su don duk kadarorinmu na haya. A koyaushe abin dogaro ne.','Aisha K.'=>'Aisha K.','Landlord'=>'Mai gida','Online Academy'=>'Kwalejin Kan Layi','Enrolment open'=>'An buɗe yin rajista','Learn new skills at your own pace'=>'Koyi sababbin ƙwarewa a kan saurin ku','Practical online courses taught by working professionals. Learn in short lessons, practise with real projects and earn a certificate.'=>'Kwasoshin intanet masu amfani waɗanda ƙwararru masu aiki ke koyarwa. Koya a cikin gajerun darussa, yi aiki a kan ayyuka na zahiri kuma sami takardar shaida.','Browse courses'=>'Bincika kwasa-kwasai','Every course includes'=>'Kowane kwas ya ƙunshi','Short video lessons'=>'Gajerun darussan bidiyo','Real-world projects'=>'Ayyukan zahiri','Mentor feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin mai ba da shawara','Certificate on completion'=>'Takardar shaida bayan kammalawa','Popular courses'=>'Shahararrun kwasa-kwasai','Web development'=>'Haɓaka yanar gizo','HTML, CSS and JavaScript from first principles to projects.'=>'HTML, CSS da JavaScript daga tushe na asali zuwa ayyukan aikace-aikace.','Digital marketing'=>'Tallan dijital','SEO, content, email and social campaigns that work.'=>'Kamfen ɗin SEO, abun ciki, imel, da na sada zumunta masu tasiri.','Data analysis'=>'Binciken bayanai','Spreadsheets, SQL and dashboards for better decisions.'=>'Shafukan lissafi, SQL da allunan bayanai don yanke shawara mafi kyau.','UX design'=>'Tsarin UX','Research, wireframes and prototypes users love.'=>'Bincike, tsare-tsaren shafi da samfuran farko da masu amfani ke so.','Project management'=>'Gudanar da aiki','Plan, deliver and lead projects with confidence.'=>'Kula, aiwatar, kuma jagoranci ayyuka tare da gaba gaɗi.','Business writing'=>'Rubutun kasuwanci','Clear emails, reports and proposals.'=>'Imeloli, rahotanni da shawarwari masu ma\'ana.','Niche Authority Site'=>'Shafin Hukuma Na Musamman','Start here'=>'Fara daga nan','The topics readers ask about most.'=>'Batutuwan da masu karatu suka fi tambaya a kansu.','Growing vegetables'=>'Nomar kayan lambu','Raised beds, soil, sowing calendars and harvests.'=>'Gadojin shuka da aka ɗaga, ƙasa, kalandar shuka da girbi.','Lawn care'=>'Kula da ciyawa','Feeding, mowing and fixing patchy grass.'=>'Ciyarwa, yankan ciyawa da gyara ciyawar da ta yi kaci-kaci.','Garden tools'=>'Kayan aikin lambu','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Abin da ya cancanci saya da kuma yadda za a kula da shi.','Small gardens'=>'Kananan lambuna','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Karafuna, barandodi da kwantena.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Jagororin aiki don noman gida','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Shawarwari bayyanannu game da noman kayan lambu, kula da ciyawa da zaɓar kayan aiki masu dacewa, waɗanda mutanen da ke aikin lambu a kowace ƙarshen mako suka rubuta.','Read the latest guides'=>'Karanta sababbin jagororin','About the author'=>'Game da marubucin','Estate Agency'=>'Hukumar Kula da Gidaje','What is your home worth?'=>'Nawa ne darajar gidanku?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Yi ajiyar kiyasin daraja kyauta ba tare da wani sharadi ba.','Book a valuation'=>'Yi ajiyar ƙimantawa','Free valuation'=>'Kimanin kuɗi kyauta','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Wani wakili yana ziyarta kuma yana kimanta farashin gidanku.','Launch'=>'Kaddamar','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Hotuna, taswirar bene da jerin za su kasance a raye a cikin kwanaki.','Sold'=>'Sayar','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Muna tattaunawa kuma muna gudanar da sayarwar har zuwa kammalawa.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'A buɗe daga Talata zuwa Lahadi','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Dahuwar yanayi, wadda aka yi don rabawa','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Kayan amfanin gona na gida, tanda mai amfani da itace da jerin ruwan inabi da mutanen da suke son shi suka zaɓa. Abincin rana da na dare, kwanaki shida a mako.','Book a table'=>'Yi ajiyar tebur','See the menu'=>'Duba mazaɓar','From our kitchen'=>'Daga ɗakin girkinmu','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Taƙaitaccen lissafin abinci wanda ke sauyawa da kowace kakar shekara. Tambaye mu game da rashin lafiyar jiki da abinci ke haifarwa (allergies): muna farin cikin daidaita muku shi.','Small plates'=>'Kananan farantai','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Gurasar da aka gasa, naman da aka shanya, da kuma kayan lambu don farawa.','From the fire'=>'Daga wuta','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'Kifin duka, gasasshen naman saniya da aka ajiye, da kuma kayan lambu da aka gasa a murhun itace.','Fresh pasta'=>'Danyen taliya','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'Ana yi da hannu a kowace safiya, ana ba da shi tare da miya na yanayi.','Desserts'=>'Kayan zaki','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Kekuna, kankara da allon cuku daga masu yin na gida.','Set lunch'=>'Ƙayyadadden abincin rana','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Kwas biyu ko uku a kan ƙayyadadden farashi, daga Talata zuwa Jumma\'a.','Private dining'=>'Cin abinci na sirri','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Wani ɗaki na musamman don baƙi har zuwa 18 tare da tsarin abinci na musamman.','SaaS Product'=>'Samfurin SaaS','Is there a free plan?'=>'Shin akwai tsarin kyauta?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Ee, kyauta ne ga ƙananan ƙungiyoyi, kuma kowane shiri na biyan kuɗi yana farawa ne da gwajin kwanaki 14.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Zan iya sokewa a kowane lokaci?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'I mana. Za a iya soke tsare-tsaren kowane wata a kowane lokaci.','Where is my data stored?'=>'Ina aka adana bayanaina?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'A cikin cibiyoyin adana bayanai masu aminci kuma rufaffu, tare da kwafin ajiya na kullum.','Everything your team needs'=>'Duk abin da ƙungiyar ku ke buƙata','Boards and timelines'=>'Alluna da jerin lokuta','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'Sauya tsakanin allunan kanban da jerin lokuta da dannawa ɗaya kacal.','Automations'=>'Ayyukan sarrafa kansa','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Matsar da ayyuka, sanya masu ɗaukar nauyi da kuma tura masu tunatarwa kai tsaye.','Shared files'=>'Fayilolin da aka raba','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Ajiye takardu kusa da aikin da suke da alaka da shi.','Reports'=>'Rahotanni','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Allon sarrafawa na kai-tsaye domin yawan aiki, ci gaba da kuma ƙayyadaddun lokuta.','Integrations'=>'Haɗe-haɗe','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Haɗa kayan aikin imel, hira da ma\'ajiya da kuke amfani da su a yanzu.','Security'=>'Tsaro','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Shiga ta hanya ɗaya, rajistar binciken ayyuka da bayanan da aka ɓoye.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'Gwajin kwanaki 14 kyauta, ba a buƙatar kati','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Kuma tsara ayyuka, ba maƙunsar bayanai ba','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Wurin aiki guda ɗaya don ayyuka, ƙayyadaddun kwanaki da fayiloli. Ƙungiyar ku tana ganin abin da ya fi muhimmanci a yau, kuma kuna ganin ci gaba ba tare da neman sabbin bayanai ba.','Start free trial'=>'Fara gwajin kyauta','See features'=>'Duba fasaloli','Up and running in minutes'=>'A shirye kuma yana aiki a cikin \'yan mintoci','Create a workspace'=>'Ƙirƙiri wajen aiki','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Yi rajista kuma ka gayyaci ƙungiyarka a cikin \'yan mintoci.','Import your work'=>'Shigar da aikinku','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Shigo da ayyuka daga maƙunsar bayanai ko wani kayan aiki daban.','Get moving'=>'Fara tafiya','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Samfura da aiyukan atomatik suna yin aiyukan yau da kullum.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan abu ba.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin yin wannan ba.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'An kashe yanayin kariya saboda bai dace da shigarku ba kuma. Sake loda shafin.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Mai gudanarwa kaɗai zai iya amfani da yanayin aminci.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Yanayin aminci yana buƙatar shiga ta al\'ada ta hanyar manhajar lilo.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Ba a iya saita yanayin tsaro ba.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Yanayin aminci na buƙatar damar rubutawa a babban fayil na wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Yanayin kariya (safe mode) ya kasa yin rubutu a babban fayil ɗin wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Wannan shafin babu shi, ko kuma an share shi.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio yana aiki tare da editan bulogi, kuma an kashe editan bulogi don wannan abu. Wani plugin kamar Classic Editor ne ke yin hakan: kunna editan bulogi don wannan abu a saitunansa (Saituna → Rubutu), sannan sake buɗe Sandwich Studio.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Kayi hakuri, ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan abu a cikin Sandwich Studio ba.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a gina Sandwich Studio ba. Sake shigar da manhajar.','Add title'=>'Ƙara launi','Type / to choose a block'=>'Rubuta / domin zabar wani tubali','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Ana loda Sandwich Studio…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio na buƙatar JavaScript. Yi amfani da edita na yau da kullun a maimakon haka.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara “%s” tare da Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara tare da Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Fannin zane maras komai','Skip to content'=>'Tsallake zuwa abun ciki','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Fadin kwamfutar hannu (tablet) dole ne ya zama cikakken lamba na pixel daga 480 zuwa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Faɗin wayar tafi-da-gidanka dole ne ya zama cikakken adadin pixels, aƙalla 240 kuma ƙasa da faɗin kwamfutar hannu.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane matsaya na musamman yana buƙatar id ɗin kansa: ƙananan haruffa ko lambobi 2 zuwa 12, wanda zai fara da harafi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Wurin tsayawa na musamman yana aiki ne ko dai har zuwa faɗi (pixels 200 zuwa 4000) ko kuma daga wani faɗi (pixels 200 zuwa 6000), ba duka biyun ba.','Tablet'=>'Kwamfutar hannu','Mobile'=>'Wayar hannu','Site design'=>'Tsarin shafi','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Launuka, haruffa da salon da kowane shafi na rukunin yanar gizon da kuma jigonku ke amfani da su tare.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Ba a iya buɗe salon duniya na rukunin yanar gizon ba.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Wannan rubutun ba ɗaya daga cikin rubutukan rukunin yanar gizon ba ne.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kowane launi yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi da alamun raba kalmomi.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Launi "%s" ba ingantaccen launin CSS ba ne.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kowane rubutu yana buƙatar suna na musamman wanda ya ƙunshi ƙananan haruffa, lambobi da alamun raba kalmomi.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Tarin rubutun na "%s" zai iya ƙunsar sunayen rubutu, alamun ƙauli, wakafi da sarari kawai.','Uploaded icons'=>'Gumakan da aka loda','Icon'=>'Gunkin alama','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba gunkin SVG ba ne da za mu iya amfani da shi. Yana iya yiwuwa ya lalace, ko kuma yana ɗauke ne kawai da abubuwan da aka cire don dalilan tsaro (rubutun scripts, hanyoyin haɗin yanar gizo, hotuna ko salon rubutu da aka saka a ciki).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Ba a iya share alamar ba.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'mabuɗin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Ba a riga an haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba tukuna, wanda hakan ya zama dole domin hana kunnawa ba tare da izini ba. Domin ba da lasisin ga mai amfanin ku, kun amince ku raba cikakken sunan mai amfani na WordPress ɗinku da adireshin imel.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusu','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Asusun yana jiran kunnawa. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku kuma ku danna mahaɗin don kunna asusunku, sannan ku sake ƙaddamar da fom ɗin haɗin gwiwa.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna son haɗa %1$s cikin %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunna Sigar Kyauta','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'Kuna iya kunna lasisi a nan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fatan za a shigar da maɓallin lasisi da kuka karɓa ta imel nan take bayan sayayya:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a kan dukkan shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwar.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunna lasisi a kan dukkan shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' An riga an shigar da sigar biya ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna ta don fara cin gajiyar fasalolin %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' An riga an shigar da sigar %1$s da ake biya. Da fatan za a kewaya zuwa %2$s domin kunna ta kuma fara cin gajiyar fasalolin %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunna fasalolin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An yi nasarar kunna asusunka tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yankin','Add-Ons'=>'Karin Abubuwa','Add Ons for %s'=>'Kari-kari don %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya loda jerin ƙarin abubuwan ba. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a sake dawowa bayan \'yan mintuna.','Add-On'=>'Kari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ƙari ne na musamman (premium). Dole ne ku fara siyan lasisi kafin kunna manhajar.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An yi nasarar siyan ƙarin %s.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An yi nasarar inganta tsarin ƙari na %s ɗinku.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An yi nasarar soke gwajin kyauta na %s. Tun da ƙarin aikin na kuɗi ne kawai, an kashe shi kai tsaye. Idan kuna son amfani da shi a nan gaba, dole ne ku sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ba zai iya aiki ba idan babu manhajar.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kawai muna sanar da ku cewa ana ɗauko bayanin ƙarin kayan aikin %s daga sabar waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Karin bayani na manhaja %s','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshi %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin Haɗin Gwiwa','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sakamakon keta sharuddan haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawarar dakatar da asusun haɗin gwiwarku na ɗan lokaci. Idan kuna da wata tambaya, tuntuɓi sashin tallafi.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusun haɗin gwiwarku na ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An karɓi buƙatarku ta haɗin gwiwa don %1$s! Shiga yankin haɗin gwiwarku a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Mun gode da kuka nemi shiga shirinmu na haɗin gwiwa, amma kash, a wannan lokacin mun yanke shawarar kin amincewa da buƙatarku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Mun gode da kuka nemi shiga shirinmu na haɗin gwiwa, za mu duba bayanan ku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntuɓe ku da ƙarin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kuki na bibiya bayan ziyarar farko domin ƙara yawan samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Haɗin gwiwa','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare har yanzu kuna iya amfani da sigar Kyauta amma ba za ku sami damar yin amfani da fasalullukan %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare ba za ku ƙara samun damar amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin kima.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Kuna iya ci gaba da amfani da duk fasalolin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na %2$s ba, kuma ba za ku sami tallafi ba.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Mun gode da haɓakawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan %1$s ɗinku na kyauta, ku biya ƙasa da %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yarda & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na Yarda - Sauya Mai Amfani','All Requests'=>'Duk Buƙatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'o\'i','allow'=>'Bada izini','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Kun riga kun amince da bin sawun amfani da muke yi, wanda ke taimaka mana ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin bin diddigin amfani da muke yi, wanda ke taimaka mana ci gaba da inganta su.','Amount'=>'Adadi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Na shekara','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kowace shekara','Anonymous feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin da ba a bayyana suna ba','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Aiwatar a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwar.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Aiwatar a kan duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Nemi zama abokin haɗin gwiwa','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Amince da Fara Gwaji','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Don Allah ku sanar da mu dalilin domin mu inganta.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi wajen haɓakawa a ƙasa kuma za mu sake tura muku maɓallin lasisin.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi lokacin saye kuma za mu sake aiko muku da maɓallin lasisin.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Haɗa tare da asusun mai lasisi.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Marubuci','Invalid module ID.'=>'ID ɗin manhaja mara inganci.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ba ku da ingantaccen lasisi don samun damar shiga nau\'in na musamman.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Shigarwa ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka amince.','Premium version already active.'=>'Tuni an kunna sigar musamman (Premium).','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar ƙari ta musamman.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Wannan plugin ɗin "Serviceware" ne, wanda ke nufin ba shi da sigar lambar sirri ta musamman (premium).','Automatic Installation'=>'Shigarwa ta atomatik','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashewa da kansa nan da:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Ƙima','Awesome'=>'Abin mamaki','based on %s'=>'bisa %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kudi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu fa, ko kun san cewa %1$s yana da shirin haɗin gwiwa na affiliate? Idan kuna son %2$s za ku iya zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Ɗaukaka daraja zuwa sigar Beta zai maye gurbin sigar %s ɗinku da aka girka da sabuwar sigar Beta da aka saki - yi amfani da hankali, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a rukunonin yanar gizo na gaske. An gargaɗe ku.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An caje %s','Billing'=>'Biyan Kuɗi','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biyan Kuɗi & Daftarin Kuɗi','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Tsayarwa','Blog ID'=>'ID na Bulog','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'I - duka adiresoshin nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Kunshi','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Haɗaka','Business name'=>'Sunan kasuwanci','Buy license'=>'Sayi lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi a yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ku da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin daban) - kuna son soke %2$s ɗin ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwajin zai toshe damar yin amfani da dukkan manyan fasaloli nan take. Ka tabbata?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Soke biyan kuɗi','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun maɓallin lasisinka ba?','Change License'=>'Sauya Lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An aika da imel ɗin tabbatarwa kwanan nan zuwa ga %s. Dole ne ku tabbatar da sabuntawar a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba ku iya samun imel ɗin ba, da fatan za a duba babban fayil ɗinku na saƙon takarce (spam).','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Yanzu an aike da imel ɗin tabbatarwa zuwa ga %s. Dole ne mai imel ɗin ya tabbatar da sabuntawar a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ne sabon mai asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mun gode da tabbatar da sauya mallakar. An aika da imel yanzu zuwa %s domin amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Sauya Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Sauya Tsari','Change User'=>'Canza Mai amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar canza mai amfani, kun yarda ku mika mallakar asusun zuwa ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Tarihin Canje-canje','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana sauya mai amfani, da fatan a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ku sami imel ɗin ba, gwada duba babban fayil ɗin saƙon takarce (spam) ko bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya da Fita','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zabi har zuwa shafi %s don kunna lasisi a kai.','City'=>'Gari','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Ma\'ajiyar API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Abubuwan Wucin Gadi na Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da manhajar ba tare da an san ko wanene ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna don ganin bita-da-kullin da suka ba da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s adireshin imel na abokin cinikina ne','Code'=>'Kodi','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s kwamishina a duk lokacin da abokin ciniki ya sayi sabon laisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yuwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka haura kwanaki 30 kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai dacewa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'Kammala shiga ciki','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Taya murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Kada ku taɓa rasa wani muhimmin sabuntawa','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Mun gode da ɗaukaka zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Zaɓi shiga domin samun sanarwar imel game da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayi na lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu bayanan yanayin WordPress na yau da kullun. Wannan zai taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku kuma ya fi yin abin da kuke buƙata.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Zaɓi shiga don karɓar sanarwar imel game da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayi na lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu bayanan yanayin WordPress na yau da kullun.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, babu matsala! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki lafiya kalau.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓin shiga ne don kada ku rasa sabuntawa mai mahimmanci kuma ku taimaka mana mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku da kuma yin abin da kuke buƙata da kyau.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna farin cikin gabatar da haɗin gwiwar matakin hanyar sadarwa na Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yayin aikin ɗaukaka daraja, mun gano shafin/shafukan %s a cikin hanyar sadarwar da har yanzu suke jiran kulawarku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafi/shafuka %d da har yanzu ke jiran kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kuna son amfani da %s a kan waɗannan rukunin yanar gizon, da fatan za a shigar da maɓallin lasisin ku a ƙasa kuma ku danna maɓallin kunnawa.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, za ku iya tsallake shi a yanzu kuma ku kunna lasisin daga baya, a shafin Asusun matakin hanyar sadarwa na %s ɗinku.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'An haɗa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar ka gama, kashe %s sannan ka sake kunna shi.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Da fatan za a sanar da mu idan kuna son mu tuntuɓe ku don sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da kuma tayi na lokaci-lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntubi Sashen Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Kuyi hakuri da rashin jin dadin kuma muna nan a shirye don taimaka muku idan kuka bamu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntube Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu tare da saƙo mai zuwa:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu Ba da Gudummawa','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Muna amfani da ɗakin karatu na PHP cURL don kiran API, wanda ɗakin karatu ne na kowa da kowa kuma yawanci ana shigar da shi kuma a kunna shi nan take. Abin takaici, ba a kunna cURL ba (ko an kashe shi) a uwar garkenku.','data'=>'Bayanai','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'An yi nasarar kunna yanayin tantance kuskure (Debug mode) kuma za a kashe shi da kansa bayan minti 60. Haka kuma kuna iya kashe shi da wuri ta danna mahadar "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Kwanan wata','Deactivate'=>'Kashe','Deactivate the free version'=>'Kashe sigar kyauta','Deactivate License'=>'Kashe Lasisi','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kashe lasisin ku zai toshe duk wasu abubuwan na musamman, amma zai ba da damar kunna lasisin a wani shafin. Kun tabbata kuna son ci gaba?','Deactivation'=>'Kashewa','Yes - %s'=>'Ee - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Aika & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kashe ko cire %s zai kashe lasisin kai tsaye, wanda za ku iya amfani da shi a wani shafin.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Idan kuna da ɗan lokaci, da fatan za a sanar da mu dalilin da ya sa kuke %s','Debug Log'=>'Rajistar Gyara Kuskure','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Gano kuskure','delegate'=>'Wakilta','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Idan ka danna shi, za a ba wa masu kula da shafukan ikon yanke wannan shawarar.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Wakilta ga Masu Gudanar da Shafin','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Ba Masu Gudanar da Shafin Iko & Ci gaba','Delegating, please wait'=>'Ana ba da izini, da fatan a jira','verbDelete'=>'Goge','Delete All Accounts'=>'Goge Duk Asusun','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Kuna da tabbacin kuna son share duk bayanan Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Bayanin','Details'=>'Cikakkun bayanai','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'Kamar mabuɗin da kuka shigar bai dace da bayananmu ba.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Bayanin Binciken Matsala','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Ana kashe yanayin farar alama','Disconnect'=>'Cire haɗin','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Shin kun tabbata kuna son ci gaba da cire haɗin?','If you wish to