,'Verify Email'=>'Tabbatar da Imel','product versionVersion'=>'Iri','Version %s was released.'=>'An fitar da sigar %s.','View details'=>'Duba cikakkun bayanai','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'Danna don duba cikakken girman hoton allo na %d','View paid features'=>'Duba fasaloli da aka biya','Warning'=>'Gargaɗi','What is your %s?'=>'Menene %s naku?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'W00t','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'Shafin Sauye-sauye na WordPress.org','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Kamar dai ɗaya daga cikin ma\'aunin tantancewar ba daidai ba ne. Sabunta Makullin Jama\'a (Public Key), Makullin Sirri (Secret Key) da ID ɗin Mai Amfani (User ID) naku, sannan ku sake gwadawa.','%s ago'=>'%s da suka wuce','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'ya rage %s','%s or higher'=>'%s ko sama da haka','%s\'s paid features'=>'Siffofin %s da ake biya','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'Tsarin %s','%s rating'=>'Kimanin %s','%s ratings'=>'%s kima-kima','%s sec'=>'%s dak','%s star'=>'Tauraro %s','%s stars'=>'%s taurari','%s time'=>'Lokacin %s','%s times'=>'Sau %s','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Kuna nasarar sabunta %s ɗinku.','as annual periodyear'=>'Shekara','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Ihu!','Yes'=>'I','You are all good!'=>'Kuna lafiya lau!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Kuna da sauran mataki ɗaya kacal - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Kamar kuna da sabon fitowar.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Ya kamata ku karɓi %3$s don %1$s zuwa akwatin saƙonku a %2$s a cikin mintuna 5 masu zuwa.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Lambar Akwatin Gidan Waya / Lambar Wasiƙa',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>' %1$s domin samun damar sabunta tsaro da siffofi na sigar %2$s, da tallafi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s sabuntawar tsaro da ta fasaloli ta atomatik da kuma ayyukan da aka biya kuɗi za su ci gaba da aiki ba tare da tsangwama ba har zuwa %2$s (ko kuma lokacin da lasisinku ya ƙare, duk wanda ya riga ya faru).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s domin samun damar sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na sigar %2$s, da kuma tallafi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a sani ba ya auku yayin ƙoƙarin saita yanayin beta na mai amfani.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a sani ba ya auku yayin ƙoƙarin sauya yanayin lakabin farin lasisin.','Annual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Ta danna "Fita", %s ba zai ƙara iya ganin sunan ku da imel ɗin ku ba.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Ta danna "Fita", ba za a ƙara aika bayanan binciken matsala zuwa ga %s ba.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Ta hanyar cire haɗin rukunin yanar gizon, bayanan binciken matsala da aka raba a baya game da %1$s za a goge su kuma ba za a sake ganin su ga %2$s ba.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ta hanyar ficewa daga raba wannan bayanin tare da uwar garken sabuntawa, dole ne ku riƙa duba sabbin fitarwa na %1$s da kanku sannan ku saukar tare da shigar da su da kanku. Baya ga zama wahala kawai, rashin samun sabuntawa na iya jefa rukunin yanar gizonku cikin haɗari tare da haifar da matsalolin dacewa da ba dole ba, don haka muna ba da shawarar sosai da a bar waɗannan mahimman izini a kunne.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Soke %1$s - Bana bukatar sabuntawar tsaro da ta sabbin fasaloli, ko goyon baya ga %2$s domin ba na shirin amfani da %3$s a kan wannan, ko wani shafin dabam.','Cancel %s?'=>'Soke %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Ana soke %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Ana soke %s...','Click here'=>'Danna nan','Deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Cire haɗin rukunin yanar gizon zai share %s dindindin daga asusun Dashboard ɗin Mai amfani da ku.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Don isar da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali ta atomatik, da sarrafa lasisi da kariya, %s yana buƙatar:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Don isar da sabuntawar tsaro da na fasali, da sarrafa lasisi, %s yana buƙatar','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius injin din lasisinmu ne da sabunta manhaja','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Idan wannan kwafi ne na dogon lokaci, don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa ta atomatik da ayyukan da aka biya bayan %1$s, da fatan za a %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Shin %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Shiga Tsarin Gwaji na Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Shiga shirin Beta','License'=>'Lasisi','License Key'=>'Mabuɗin Lasisi','License key'=>'Makullin laisin','Monthly'=>'Kowane wata','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Sunaye, gajerun adireshi, nau\'o\'i, da kuma ko yana aiki ko a\'a','New Version Available'=>'Akwai Sabon Sigar','Optional'=>'Na zaɓi','Plan'=>'Tsari','Products'=>'Kayan aiki','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanan binciken matsala na taimakawa wajen samar da ƙarin ayyuka masu dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku, guje wa rashin jituwar sigar WordPress ko PHP da ka iya lalata rukunin yanar gizon, da kuma gane harsuna & yankuna da ya kamata a fassara da kuma daidaita %s dominsu.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Don ku iya sake amfani da lasisin lokacin da %s ba ya aiki.','Subscription'=>'Biyan kuɗi','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s zai riƙa tura muhimman bayanan lasisi lokaci-lokaci zuwa %2$s don duba sabuntawar tsaro da ta sabbin fasalulluka, da kuma tabbatar da ingancin lasisin ku.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Akwai %1$s na %2$s da ake da shi.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Don tabbatar da dacewa da kuma guje wa rikici tare da manhajoji da jigogi da kuka shigar.','Trial'=>'Gwajin Gwaji','View %s State'=>'Duba Yanayin %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Bayanin %s na Asali','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'I, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s domin manufar gwaji, saiti, ko ci gaba.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kuna da lasisin %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Ya kamata ku karɓi imel ɗin tabbatarwa don %1$s a akwatin saƙonku a %2$s. Da fatan za a tabbatar kun danna maɓallin da ke cikin wannan imel ɗin don %3$s.','days'=>'kwanaki','deactivating'=>'yana kashewa','hour'=>'awa','hours'=>'Awanni','license'=>'lasisi','optional'=>'na zaɓi','products'=>'Kayan aiki','skip'=>'Tsallake','subscription'=>'biyan kuɗi','trial'=>'Gwajin','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Kayan aiki','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Lasisi','close a windowDismiss'=>'Yi watsi da shi','close windowDismiss'=>'Yi watsi da shi','like websitesSites'=>'Shafuka','nounPricing'=>'Farashi','trial periodTrial'=>'Gwaji','verbOpt In'=>'Shiga ciki','verbOpt Out'=>'Fita','verbSkip'=>'Tsallake','verbUpgrade'=>'Haɓaka','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s da ya gabata','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Ba a iya kammala aikin ba. Sake gwadawa, kuma idan ya ci gaba da faduwa, tuntuɓi mai kula da shafin.','Connect an AI app'=>'Haɗa ƙa\'idar AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Wannan buƙatar haɗin ta ƙare. Koma zuwa manhajar kuma sake fara haɗawa.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s yana neman ya yi amfani da %2$s a wannan rukunin yanar gizo a matsayin %3$s. Zai iya yin abin da aka ba asusunka na WordPress izinin yi ne kawai, kuma za ka iya cire haɗin sa a kowane lokaci daga saitunan wakilan AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ya bayyana kansa daga %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ya yi wa kansa rajista ta atomatik. Ci gaba kawai idan ka fara wannan daga %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Asusunka ba zai iya amfani da waɗannan kayan aikin a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Bayan ka amsa za ka koma zuwa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Bada izinin %s','Do not allow'=>'Kada a ba da izini','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Wani ƙima da ake buƙata ya ɓace ko kuma ba shi da tsari da ya dace. Bincika tsarin shigarwar damar (input schema).','The site refused the request.'=>'Shafin ya ƙi amincewa da buƙatar.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakilan AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Bada damar mataimaka na AI kamar Claude, Cursor ko VS Code su yi aiki a kan wannan shafi don ku ta hanyar MCP (Model Context Protocol). Suna shiga a matsayin mai amfani da WordPress (Claude da ChatGPT ta hanyar amincewa da su a nan, wasu kuma da kalmar sirri ta manhaja) kuma za su iya yin abin da aka ba wannan mai amfani izinin yi kawai.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakilan AI suna buƙatar WordPress 6.9 ko kuma na gaba. Sabunta WordPress don amfani da su.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Bada izinin wakilan AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'A kashe: kayan aikin da ke ƙasa da hanyoyin REST ɗinsu ba a yi musu rajista ba ko kaɗan.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adireshin haɗi (matsayar MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude da ChatGPT: shiga maimakon haka','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ƙara adireshin haɗin azaman mai haɗawa na musamman a cikin Claude, ko azaman manhaja a yanayin mai haɓakawa na ChatGPT. Suna buɗe wannan shafin domin ku amince da su; babu kalmar sirri da za a kwafa.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Manhajojin AI da aka haɗa da asusunka:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Sauran manhajojin AI: kalmar sirri ta manhaja','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ƙirƙiri kalmar sirri ta manhaja don mai amfani da ku','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ƙara wannan a cikin saitunan MCP na manhajar AI ɗinku, tare da sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri ɗin ku:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: sanya shigarwar iri ɗaya a ƙarƙashin "servers" a cikin .vscode/mcp.json, ba a ƙarƙashin "mcpServers" ba.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Kayan aikin da wakilin AI zai iya amfani da su a nan (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Jagoran mai amfani: Wakilan AI da MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Takardun masu haɓakawa: iyawa, REST da MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Gina kuma gyara shafukan wannan rukunin yanar gizo daga bangarorin Page Builder Sandwich da kayan aikin rukunin yanar gizo.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Shafuka, sassa da kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo.','List pages'=>'Jera shafuka','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Yana lissafa shafukan da za ku iya gyarawa, sababbi a gaba, tare da zaɓin bincike.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Kalmomin da za a bincika a cikin take da abun ciki.','Read a page'=>'Karanta shafi','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Yana dawo da kanun shafi, matsayi, hanyoyin haɗi da abun ciki na bulogi, da kuma ɓangarori (bulogi na babban mataki) da aka gina shi da su.','Create a page'=>'Ƙirƙiri shafi','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar shafi daga ɓangarori (duba pbs/list-sections) da/ko ƙunshiyar tubali. Sabon shafi yana zama daftari sai dai idan an nemi wani matsayin na daban.','Update a page'=>'Sabunta shafi','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Yana canza kanun shafi, matsayi ko abun ciki na bulogi. Abun cikin da kuka aika yana maye gurbin abun cikin shafin.','List sections'=>'Jera ɓangarori','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Yana lissafa sassan da aka riga aka shirya (babban bangare, fasaloli, Tambayoyi da Amsoshi, shaidar ciniki, kiran daukar mataki da sauransu) wadanda za a iya karawa a shafi.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Kalmomin da za a dace da su a cikin sunan sashe ko mahimman kalmomi.','Add a section to a page'=>'Ƙara sashe a shafi','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Yana ƙara sashin da aka riga aka shirya a shafi: a farko, a ƙarshe, ko bayan sashin da ke a wani takamaiman matsayi.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'Sunan sashe daga pbs/list-sections.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'Tare da matsayi "after": matsayin sashen da za a saka a bayansa wanda ya fara daga 0.','List website kits'=>'Jera katin gidan yanar gizo','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Yana lissafa kudin gidan yanar gizo (tarin shafukan da aka riga aka shirya don wani nau\'in kasuwanci) da wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya shigo da su.','Import a website kit'=>'Shigo da kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Yana shigo da shafukan kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo (dukansu, ko waɗanda aka ambata), tare da zaɓin buga su, saita babban shafi da ƙara su zuwa menu. Sake shigo da su yana sabunta shafukan guda ɗaya.','List the builder blocks'=>'Jera tubalan gini','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Yana lissafa kowane block na Page Builder Sandwich da wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya amfani da shi (harda Pro blocks lokacin da Pro ke aiki): suna, take, rukuni da kuma bayani. Yi amfani da pbs/get-block don saitunan block, sannan ka sanya block ɗin a cikin abun cikin shafi.','Describe a builder block'=>'Bayyana wani block na magini','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Yana mayar da saitunan kowane bulo (siffofi tare da nau\'o\'insu, zaɓuɓɓuka da abubuwan asali), abin da yake goyan baya, waɗanne buloli zai iya ƙunsa, da kuma misali da aka shirya don amfani a cikin alamar bulo.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Inda toshe yake: matsayinsa a tsakanin bangarorin shafin, sannan a tsakanin toshe-toshe na cikin wancan toshen, da sauran su (farawa daga 0), kamar yadda pbs/get-page ke jera su.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Sauya saitunan wani shinge','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Yana canza saitunan (halaye) na toshe guda ɗaya a cikin shafi, wanda aka samo ta hanyar hanyarsa; halayen da kuka aiko ana haɗa su a kan na yanzu. Yana aiki akan tubalan da rukunin yanar gizon ke nunawa daga saitunansu; don toshe wanda aka ajiye HTML ɗinsa a cikin shafin, aika sabon markup tare da pbs/update-page.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Cire wani shinge daga shafi','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Yana cire shinge ɗaya (cikakken sashe, ko wani shinge a cikin wani) daga shafi, wanda aka samo ta hanyar tafarkinsa. Sigar shafin da ta gabata tana nan a cikin gyare-gyarensa.','Move a section'=>'Matsar da sashe','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Yana matsar da wani sashe na shafi daga wani matsayi zuwa wani (bisa tushen 0, kamar yadda pbs/get-page ke lissafa su).','Duplicate a page'=>'Kwafi shafi','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Yana kwafe shafi (taken sa, abun ciki da samfurinsa) zuwa cikin sabon daftarin aiki.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Matsar da shafi zuwa kwandon shara','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Yana matsar da shafi zuwa kwandon shara. Za a iya dawo da shi daga Shafuka, Kwandon Shara har tsawon kwanaki 30.','Build a landing page'=>'Gina shafin saukarwa','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Tsarin aiki mai jagora: wakilin yana zaɓar ɓangarorin da suka dace da kasuwancinku, yana gina shafin a matsayin daftari kuma yana rubuta bayanan cikinsa.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Kasuwancin, abin da yake bayarwa da kuma masu sauraron sa.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Shafi na iya zama daftari, mai jiran bita, wanda aka buga ko na sirri.','Give the page a title.'=>'Ba shafin take.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s yana adana HTML dinsa a cikin shafin, saboda haka ba za a iya canza saitunansa daban ba. Aika sabon markup na shafin tare da pbs/update-page.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (kofi)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Ba a iya tura shafin zuwa kwandon shara ba.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Gina shafin saukarwa a wannan rukunin yanar gizo na WordPress don: %s. Matakai: 1) kira pbs-list-sections sannan ka zabi sassa 4 zuwa 6 cikin tsari mai ma\'ana (na farko ya zama hero, na karshe ya zama call to action); 2) kira pbs-create-page tare da take da wadancan sassan, a matsayin daftarin aiki (draft); 3) kira pbs-get-page sannan ka sake rubuta kowane rubutun wuri (placeholder text) domin wannan kasuwanci ta hanyar pbs-update-page (bar kowane bayanin toshewa da alama kamar yadda suke); 4) idan pbs-generate-page yana nan, za ka iya amfani da shi maimakon matakai na 1 zuwa 3; 5) bayar da mahadar gyara shafin kuma kada ka buga shi ba tare da tambaya ba.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Babu wani kankara a wannan matsayin. Karanta shafin tare da pbs/get-page da farko.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'Babu wani bulo mai suna "%s". Duba pbs/list-blocks.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Shafin ba shi da wani sashe a wannan matsayin.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Wannan ba sunan kit ba ne. Duba pbs/list-kits.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'Babu wani sashe mai suna "%s". Duba pbs/list-sections.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Sunayen sashe daga pbs/list-sections, bisa tsarin shafi. Suna zuwa kafin kowane abun ciki da aka bayar.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Tsarin rubutun bulogi (tsarin da editan bulogi ke ajiyewa).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Babu wani shafi mai wannan ID ɗin.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin yin hakan a wannan shafin ba.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Haɗa Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Yana haɗa aikin gidan yanar gizo na Adobe Fonts (Typekit) ta hanyar kit id ɗinsa, domin rubutunsa su bayyana a wuraren zaɓin rubutu.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Sauya kayan tambari (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Yana adana kayan aikin alama: suna, tambari, launuka, rubutun kan labari da na jiki, da kuma sautin alama da rubutun basirar kirkira ke amfani da shi.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Aiwatar da kayan tambari (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Yana amfani da launuka da rubutun kayan aikin alama da aka ajiye zuwa ga ƙirar rukunin yanar gizon.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Karanta matakan daidaita girman allo','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Yana mayar da faɗin kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka (tablet) da na wayar hannu (da kuma rabe-raben da aka keɓance a cikin Pro) waɗanda abubuwan sarrafawa masu dacewa suke amfani da su.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Canza matakan daidaita girman allo','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Yana canza faɗin kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka da ta wayar hannu a cikin pixels; tare da Pro, ƙarin wuraren canji na musamman.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri aji na duniya (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar rukunin salon duniya wanda za a iya sake amfani da shi: lakabi, slug da salon (s)sa.','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Goge aji na duniya (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Yana goge ajin duniya gaba ɗaya. Abubuwan da suka yi amfani da shi za su riƙe abin da ke cikinsu amma za su rasa salon sa.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Canza ajin duniya (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Yana canza lakabi, slug ko salo na aji na duniya; kowane sinadari da ke amfani da shi yana sabuntawa.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Kwafi ajin duniya (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Yana kwafi aji na duniya ƙarƙashin sabuwar id.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Kunna rubutun da aka loda (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Yana sa haruffan da aka loda na musamman (fayil ɗin rubutu a ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai, ta hanyar id) ya kasance a cikin masu zaɓin haruffa.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Kashe font ɗin da aka loda (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Yana cire kalar rubutu ta musamman (ta hanyar slug) daga masu zaɓen kalar rubutu.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Sauya yanayin duhu (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Yana saita yanayin duhu (yanayi: a kashe, kai tsaye ko canzawa) da launukansa.','Read the site design'=>'Karanta tsarin shafin','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Yana dawo da launuka da rubutun gaba ɗaya na rukunin yanar gizo (kanun labarai da babban jiki) waɗanda kowane boko ke amfani da su, kamar yadda allon zane na Rukunin yanar gizo ke nuna su.','Change the site design'=>'Sauya tsarin shafin','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Yana canza launukan duka shafin (colors), haruffa (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Kowane shafi yana karɓar canjin; ana kiyaye theme.json na jigon ya kasance daidai.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Karanta tsarin zane (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Yana mayar da tsarin ƙira na Pro: azuzuwan duniya, masu canji, alamun ƙira, yanayin duhu, kayan aikin alama da rubutun da aka saba.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Sauya alamomin zane (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Yana canza sikelin tazarar fili, radius da inuwa (space, radius, shadow), ko kuma ya maido da su yadda suke (reset).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'Canza masu canjin CSS (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Yana maye gurbin sauye-sauyen zane na shafin (sauye-sauye: jerin suna da kima).','List the dynamic content sources (Pro)'=>'Lissafa hanyoyin samar da abun ciki mai canzawa (Pro)','Returns what a block can be filled from (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) with each source\'s fields, the field plugins on this site (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) and a post type\'s fields (postType). Bind a block with pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.'=>'Yana mayar da abin da za a iya cika shinge da shi (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) tare da filayen kowace madogara, da abubuwan kari na fili a wannan rukunin yanar gizo (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) da filayen nau\'in rubutu (postType). Daure shinge da pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.','Preview a dynamic value (Pro)'=>'Duba darajar da ke canzawa (Pro)','Returns what a binding shows on one post (post, source, and field or provider + key, as text|url), to check a binding before or after adding it.'=>'Yana mayar da abin da ɗaurawa ke nunawa a kan rubutu ɗaya (rubutu, tushe, da fili ko mai bayarwa + maɓalli, a matsayin rubutu|url), domin bincika ɗaurawa kafin ko bayan ƙara shi.','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Cire rubutun da kanka ke ɗaukar nauyinsa','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'Yana goge fayilolin dangin rubutun da aka karɓi bakuncinsu da kanka.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Jera rubutun da aka karɓi bakuncinsu da kanka','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Yana lissafa rubutun Google da wannan rukunin yanar gizon yake ɗauka da kansa (an sauke sau ɗaya, ana bayarwa daga rukunin yanar gizon, babu buƙatar tuntuɓar Google).','Self-host a font'=>'Kula da rubutun kanka','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Yana sauke rukunin rubutun Google (rukuni, kauri, karkatacce) sannan ya samar da shi daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','List forms'=>'Jera fom-fom','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Yana lissafa fom-fom ɗin da aka gina tare da toshewar Form da kuma plugins na fom ɗin da zai iya sakawa.','List uploaded icons'=>'Jera gumakan da aka loda','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Yana lissafa gumakan SVG da aka loda zuwa ɗakin karatun gumaka, sabbi a gaba.','Upload an icon'=>'Loda alama','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'Yana ƙara alamar SVG (suna, alamar svg) zuwa ɗakin karatu na alama; ana fara tsarkake SVG ɗin da farko.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Goge alamar da aka loda','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Yana cire gunkin da aka loda; tubalan da suka yi amfani da shi za su ajiye kwafin kansu.','Read the licence'=>'Karanta lasisin','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Yana dawo da tsarin Page Builder Sandwich na wannan rukunin yanar gizo, halin lasisi, ranar sabuntawa, da kuma abin da tsarin ya ƙunsa.','Disconnect from support'=>'Cire haɗin kai daga sashen taimako','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Yana cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizo daga tallafi.','Read the support connection'=>'Karanta haɗin tallafi','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Yana nuna ko wannan rukunin yanar gizo yana haɗe da tallafin Zinn Digital®, da kuma a matsayin wane.','Connect to support'=>'Haɗa da tallafi','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Yana haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizo da tallafin Zinn Digital® (suna, imel, yarda).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Yarda da binciken tallafi','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Yana rikodin yardar mai gudanarwa don aika bayanan binciken matsala tare da tikitin tallafi.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Karanta binciken shafin','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Yana dawo da bayanan binciken da tikitin taimako zai ƙunsa: nau\'o\'i, manhajojin ƙari (plugins) masu aiki, iyaka da kuma kura-kuran kwanan nan.','Open a support ticket'=>'Bude tikitin tallafi','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Yana shigar da tikitin tallafi (jigo, saƙo, nau\'i, imel), tare da bayanan binciken wannan rukunin yanar gizon idan mai gudanarwa ya amince. Ba ya ƙirƙirar bayanan shiga ko aikawa da ɗaya ko kaɗan.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Fara gwajin Pro na kyauta','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Yana fara gwajin kwanaki 14 na Page Builder Sandwich Pro don wannan rukunin yanar gizon (babu buƙatar biyan kuɗi).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Karanta asusun ɗakin karatu na gajimare (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Yana mayar da bayanan amfani da ma\'ajiyar ɗakin karatu na gajimare, kason tsari da kuma bayanan ƙungiya.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Jera zane-zanen ɗakin karatu na gajimare (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Yana lissafa tsare-tsaren da aka ajiye a ma\'ajiyar gajimare (nau\'i: sashe, shafi ko samfuri; ƙungiya: ma\'ajiyar ƙungiya).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Ajiye zane a rumbun adana bayanai na gajimare (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Yana adana alamar shingen (take, nau\'i, alama, salo, alamomi) zuwa ɗakin karatu na gajimare na ku ko na ƙungiya; ana haɗa hotuna tare da shi.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Goge tsarin ɗakin karatu na girgije (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Yana goge zane daga ɗakin karatu na gajimare.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Sami ƙirar dakin karatu na gajimare (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Yana dawo da tsari guda ɗaya da aka ajiye, a shirye don sakawa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon (an shigar da hotunansa cikin ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Fita daga ƙungiya (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Yana barin ɗakin karatu na ƙungiyar da wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya shiga.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Shiga ƙungiya (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Yana shiga ɗakin karatu na ƙungiya tare da lambar gayyata.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'Daina amfani da ma\'ajiyar kanku (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Yana cire saitunan kawo-naka-ajiya; ana sake amfani da ajiyar tsarin.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'Karanta saitunan ajiya na kanka (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'Yana dawo da saitunan ma\'ajiyar R2/S3 ta kanku (ba a taɓa dawo da sirrin ba).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'Yi amfani da ma\'ajiyar kanku (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'Yana adana ma\'ajiyar kawo-taka: mai ba da sabis (r2 ko s3), bucket, yanki, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, an kunna.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'Gwada ma\'ajiyar kanku (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'Yana rubutawa, karantawa da kuma goge abin gwaji a cikin ma\'ajiyar ku tare da bayar da rahoton kowane mataki.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Jera ƙungiyoyin ɗakin karatu (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Yana lissafa ƙungiyoyin da wannan rukunin yanar gizo yake ciki ko yake mallaka.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Ƙirƙiri ƙungiyar ɗakin karatu (Hukuma)','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar ɗakin karatu na ƙungiya (suna) wanda sauran shafuka za su iya shiga tare da lambar gayyata.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Goge ƙungiyar ɗakin karatu (Hukuma)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Yana goge ƙungiya da kowane zane da ke cikin ɗakin karatunta.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Gayyaci shafi zuwa ƙungiya (Hukuma)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar lambar gayyata ta amfani ɗaya (matsayi: karantawa ko rubutawa; lakabi; kwanakin aiki). Ana nuna lambar sau ɗaya kacal.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Jera mambobin ƙungiya (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Yana lissafa rukunonin yanar gizo da ke cikin ƙungiya da damar samun damar shiga su.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Cire memban ƙungiya (Hukuma)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Yana cire shafi daga ƙungiya.','Add a query loop (Pro)'=>'Ƙara madaukin tambaya (Pro)','Adds a query loop with a ready-made card, on a new page (pageTitle, status) or at the end of a post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (product for a shop grid), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, and live filters [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].'=>'Yana ƙara da\'irar tambaya (query loop) tare da katin da aka riga aka shirya, a sabon shafi (pageTitle, status) ko a ƙarshen rubutu (post): tushen posts|users|terms|field, postType (product don grid na shago), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, da matatun kai tsaye [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Jera raye-rayen Lottie (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Yana lissafa raye-rayen Lottie da aka loda.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Loda raye-rayen Lottie (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Yana tabbatar da daftarin Lottie JSON (json, name) kuma yana buga shi a matsayin fayil mai tsayayye domin Lottie block.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'Lissafa gwaje-gwajen A/B da sakamakonsu (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Yana lissafa gwaje-gwajen A/B tare da maziyartan kowane nau\'i da sauye-sauye, da kuma wanda ke yin nasara.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri gwajin A/B (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Yana ƙara gwajin nau\'ikan sashe guda biyu zuwa ƙarshen rubutu (rubutu, suna, a, b; raba da manufa na zaɓi ne).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'Sake saita sakamakon gwajin A/B (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Yana share ƙididdigar gwaji kuma yana sake kunna shi (gwaji).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Jera hanyoyin haɗin jerin aika saƙonni (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Yana lissafa ayyukan jerin aika saƙo (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) da waɗanda aka haɗa. Ba a taɓa dawo da maɓallan ba.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Haɗa sabis ɗin lissafin aika saƙo (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Yana haɗa sabis ɗin jerin aika saƙonni tare da maɓallin API ɗin sa (sabis, maɓalli; asusu inda sabis ɗin ke buƙatar ɗaya), ko cire haɗin sa da maɓalli maras komai.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Jera jerin wasikun sabis (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Yana lissafa masu sauraro ko jerin sunayen sabis ɗin jerin aika saƙon da aka haɗa, domin aikin biyan kuɗi na fom.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Karanta tutar yarda da kuki (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Yana dawo da banner ɗin yarda: ko yana kunne, rubutunsa da ƙirarsa, rukunoni, da kuma inda yake aiki.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Sauya allon amincewa da kuki (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Yana canza banner ɗin amincewa. Lokacin da yake kunne, rubutun bin sawu suna jiran amincewar mai ziyara.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri samfurin tutar kuki ta mafari (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar ƙirar banner na yarda wanda aka shirya don farawa daga ciki.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Lissafa fom-fom ɗin maginin fom (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Yana lissafa kowane fom da aka yi da mai gina fom: shafin da yake kai, filayensa da abin da ke faruwa idan aka aika shi.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri fom (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar fom (tuntuɓa, ƙididdigar farashi, rajista ko matakai masu yawa: filaye, matakai, saituna da ayyuka kamar imel, adanawa, webhook ko jerin aika saƙonni), a sabon shafi ko a ƙarshen rubutun da ke akwai (rubutu).','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Sauya fom (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Yana canza fom ɗaya (post, fom): saituna da ayyuka suna haɗuwa da abin da ke wurin; filaye (da matakai) suna maye gurbin filayen.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Jera saitunan motsi da ma\'amala (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Yana mayar da kowane saitin motsi (shigar motsi, tsawonsa da jinkirinsa, tasirin gungurawa, tasirin shawagi, ci gaba da kasancewa a gani, parallax, bin manuni) tare da zaɓuɓɓukansa ko kewayonsa, da wuraren raba allon rukunin yanar gizon.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Sanya motsi a shinge (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Yana saitawa ko cire (null) saitunan motsi a kan wani shinge ɗaya na shafi, wanda aka nemo ta hanyar turbarsa, a wani matakin tsayawa (tsoho shine base). Yana aiki a kan kowane shinge, gami da ainihin shingayen da aka ajiye HTML ɗinsu a cikin shafin. Masu ziyara da suka nemi rage motsi ba za su taɓa ganin motsin ba.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Jera abubuwan buɗewa masu tasowa (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Yana lissafa kundayen sanarwa masu tashi, masu zamewa ciki, da sandunan sanarwa tare da abubuwan da ke kunna su, ƙa\'idojin yawan fitarsu, da inda suke bayyana.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri fop-op (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar popup, slide-in ko bar: abin da ke ciki, mai tayarwa (manufar fita, gungurawa, lokaci, dannawa), yawan aukuwa da kuma shafukan da yake nunawa a kai.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Sauya wani popup (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'Yana canza popup, slide-in ko mashaya (id): abun ciki, abin tayarwa, sau nawa yake nunawa ko inda yake nunawa.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Karanta bayanan fom da aka aiko (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Yana lissafa abin da baƙi suka aiko ta hanyar fom ɗin da ke adana bayanan da aka ƙaddamar (fom ɗin yana taƙaita shi), shafi ɗaya a lokaci guda.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Karanta bin sawun jujjuyawa (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Yana mayar da saitunan Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager da Meta Pixel da kuma koke-koke da shigarwar fom da ake aikawa.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Sauya bibiyar sauye-sauye (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Yana canza saitunan Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager da Meta Pixel da kuma abubuwan da ake aikawa.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Karanta ƙaurawar da ta gabata','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'Yana dawo da ci gaban jujjuyawar abun ciki na 5.x da rahotonsa.','Convert legacy content'=>'Mayar da tsohon abun ciki','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Yana fara (ko sake fara) canza kowane shafi na 5.x zuwa tubalan rubutu; ana fara ajiye kowane rubutu tukuna.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Soke ƙaura ta dā','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Yana dawo da kowane rubutu da aka sauya daga ma\'ajiyar ajiyarsa.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Karanta haɗin wasiƙar labarai (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Yana nuna ko an ajiye mabuɗin Mailchimp (ba za a taɓa dawo da ainihin mabuɗin ba).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Haɗa Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Yana adana (ko, idan babu komai a ciki, yana share) maɓallin API na Mailchimp wanda bulogin wasiƙar labarai yake amfani da shi.','Convert one legacy page'=>'Maida shafi na da ɗaya','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'Yana canza shafi ɗaya na 5.x zuwa tubalan rubutu (tare da ajiye kwafi tukuna).','Undo one conversion'=>'Soke musayar guda ɗaya','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Yana dawo da shafi ɗaya da aka canza daga ma\'ajiyar ajiyarsa.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Karanta tushen bita (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Yana dawo da tushen Google da Trustpilot waɗanda block ɗin Reviews ke nunawa.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Sauya hanyoyin samun bita (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Yana saita wurin Google da kasuwancin Trustpilot da toshewar Reviews ke karantawa.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Sabunta sake dubawa yanzu (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Yana ɗauko sabbin bita na Trustpilot yanzu maimakon jira har sai an sabunta na yau da kullum.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Karanta saitunan manhajar kari','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Yana mayar da prefix na ajin gaba-gaba (front-end), matsayin sabuntawar beta da kuma ko an ba wa wakilan AI (MCP) izini.','Change the plugin settings'=>'Sauya saitunan manhaja','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Yana canza prefix na aji na gaba (haruffa ƙanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, yana farawa da harafi) da/ko kunna ko kashe wakilan AI (MCP) (mcp: false yana cire kowace iyawa da mashigin MCP).','Add a product block or mini cart (Pro)'=>'Ƙara shingen kaya ko ƙaramar kwandon sayayya (Pro)','Adds a WooCommerce block at the end of a post: a product element (part: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, or 0 for the product being viewed) or a mini cart (label).'=>'Yana ƙara shingen WooCommerce a ƙarshen rubutu: wani ɓangaren samfuri (sashe: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, ko 0 don samfurin da ake kallo a yanzu) ko ƙaramin kwando (label).','Read the theme builder\'s choices (Pro)'=>'Karanta zaɓuɓɓukan mai gina jigo (Pro)','Returns the template types, the display-condition kinds (page, post type, term, archive, search, 404, logged in, role, device, date, time, URL parameter, referrer, language, cart) with their choices on this site (roles, languages, post types, taxonomies), and the block attribute (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) that shows or hides any block — set it with pbs/update-block.'=>'Yana mayar da nau\'ikan samfuri, nau\'ikan sharaɗin nunawa (shafi, nau\'in rubutu, kalma, rumbun adana bayanai, bincike, 404, an shiga ciki, matsayi, na\'ura, kwanan wata, lokaci, ma\'aunin URL, mai ba da shawara, harshe, keken sayayya) tare da zaɓin su a wannan rukunin yanar gizon (matsayoyi, harsuna, nau\'ikan rubutu, rabe-rabe), da siffar shinge (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) wanda ke nuna ko ɓoye kowane shinge — saita shi da pbs/update-block.','List the theme templates (Pro)'=>'Jera samfuran jigo (Pro)','Lists the theme builder\'s templates (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 and, with WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you and My Account): each one\'s type, where it shows (include/exclude rules), priority, status and blocks.'=>'Yana lissafa samfuran maginin jigo (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 da kuma, tare da WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you da My Account): nau\'in kowannensu, inda yake nunawa (ƙa\'idodin haɗawa/cirewa), fifiko, matsayi da tubalan.','Create a theme template (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri samfurin jigo (Pro)','Creates a template (title, type) that replaces that part of every matching page, on classic and block themes. Without content it starts from a ready-made design for its type. include/exclude are display-condition rules ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; see pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority breaks ties; status publish (live) or draft.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar samfuri (title, type) wanda ke maye gurbin waccan ɓangare na kowane shafi mai dacewa, a kan jigogin gargajiya da na block. Idan babu abun ciki yana farawa ne daga tsari da aka riga aka shirya don nau\'insa. include/exclude ƙa\'idoji ne na sharaɗin nunawa ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; duba pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority tana raba daidaito; status publish (kai tsaye) ko draft.','Delete a theme template (Pro)'=>'Goge samfurin jigo (Pro)','Moves one template (id) to the trash; the theme\'s own design shows again where it applied. Restorable from the trash.'=>'Yana matsar da samfuri ɗaya (id) zuwa kwandon shara; ainihin tsarin jigon zai sake bayyana a inda aka yi amfani da shi. Za a iya dawo da shi daga kwandon shara.','Change a theme template (Pro)'=>'Sauya samfurin jigo (Pro)','Changes one template (id): any of title, type, content (block markup), include, exclude, priority, status. Only what you send changes.'=>'Yana canza samfuri guda ɗaya (id): kowane ɗaya daga cikin take, nau\'i, abun ciki (alamar block), haɗawa, cirewa, fifiko, matsayi. Abin da kuka aika ne kawai zai canza.','Export designs and settings'=>'Fitar da zane-zane da saituna','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Yana fitar da zaɓaɓɓun samfura da ƙirarru (ids) da kuma, bisa zaɓi, saituna a matsayin kunshin guda ɗaya don wani shafin.','Import designs and settings'=>'Shigo da zane-zane da saituna','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'Yana shigo da kunshin da aka yi da pbs/export-designs (fara da dryRun don ganin abin da zai canza; yanayi: skip ko replace; media; saituna).','List what can be exported'=>'Lissafa abin da za a iya fitarwa','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Yana lissafa samfura, tsare-tsare da saitunan da za a iya fitarwa zuwa wani rukunin yanar gizon.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Karanta yanayin gyarawa (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'Yana mayar da yanayin gyara / mai zuwa nan ba da jimawa ba: yanayi, shafi, sake gwadawa-bayan da kuma matsayan da har yanzu suke ganin rukunin yanar gizon.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Sauya yanayin gyarawa (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Yana kunna ko kashe yanayin gyarawa (503) ko yana nan tafe (mode), tare da shafin da za a nuna (page_id), retry_after da kuma matsayan da ke tsallake shi.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Lissafa ayyukan nema-da-sauyawa (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Yana lissafa ayyukan bincike-da-sauyawa na duka shafin da kuma halin da suke ciki.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Nemo kuma musanya a duk fadin rukunin yanar gizo (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Yana fara nemowa-da-sauyawa wanda yake mai aminci ga tubali (nemo, sauya, nau\'i: rubutu, mahaɗi ko launi; match_case; nau\'o\'i). Babu abin da zai canza har sai pbs/apply-replace.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Duba canjin nema-da-sauyawa (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Yana mayar da dacewar aiki, shafi bayan shafi, don dubawa kafin aiwatarwa.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Aiwatar da bincika-da-sauya (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Yana amfani da aikin da aka rigaya aka duba. Kowane rubutu da aka canza yana adana kwafin ajiya don pbs/undo-replace.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Soke bincika-da-sauya (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Yana dawo da rubuce-rubucen da wani aiki ya canza (rubutun da aka gyara tun daga lokacin zai ci gaba da riƙe gyaransa).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Karanta izinin magini (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Yana mayar da matsayan da za su iya amfani da magini, ƙira, lamba da samfura (yanayin abokin ciniki).','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Canza izinin magini (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'Yana saita abin da magini ke ba da izini ga kowace rawa (matsayi), misali, matsayin abokin ciniki na abun ciki kawai.','Read white label (Agency)'=>'Karanta lakabin farin tambari (Hukuma)','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'Yana mayar da saitunan lakabin sirri: kunna ko kashe, sunan da aka nuna da kuma masu amfani da har yanzu suke ganin na asali.','Change white label (Agency)'=>'Canza alamar sirri (Hukuma)','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'Yana kunna ko kashe alamar sirri (white label) sannan yana saita sunan da abokan ciniki za su gani (enabled, name, agency_users).','Build several pages'=>'Gina shafuka da yawa','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar shafuka har guda 50 a kira ɗaya, kowanne daga ɓangarori da/ko abun cikin tubali. Ana duba kowane shafi kuma a ƙirƙira shi daban; amsar tana lissafa kowane shafin da aka yi da kuma kowane wanda aka ƙi, tare da dalili.','Write a page with AI'=>'Rubuta shafi tare da AI','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Yana gina shafi daga sassa (waɗanda aka bayar, ko AI ta zaɓa daga rukunin sassa) kuma yana sa AI ta sake rubuta duk rubutunsa don bayanin ku, tare da riƙe ƙirar. Yana amfani da mai ba da sabis na AI da aka saita a cikin saitunan AI na manhajar ƙari. Shafin daftari ne sai dai idan an nemi wani matsayin na daban.','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'Abin da shafin yake dominsa: kasuwancin, tayin, masu sauraro da kuma salon magana.','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'Aika shafuka tsakanin 1 zuwa %d.','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'Bayyana shafin aƙalla da jimla ɗaya.','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI ba ta zaɓi wani sashe daga ɗakin karatu ba. Ka sanya wa sassan suna da kanka, ko ka gwada taƙaitaccen bayani mai ƙarin bayani.','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'AI ta sake rubuta guda %1$d daga cikin guntayen rubutu %2$d na shafin, don haka babu abin da aka ajiye. Sake gwadawa.','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Wani matakin ƙaura yana gudana a yanzu haka. Sake gwadawa bayan minti ɗaya.','Say what to change (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'Faɗi abin da za a canza (har zuwa haruffa 2,000).','That block is not on the page.'=>'Wannan block ɗin ba ya kan shafin.','No text was given.'=>'Ba a bayar da wani rubutu ba.','Only a block without blocks inside it holds text of its own.'=>'Kuma bulogin da ba shi da wasu bulog a cikinsa ne kawai yake ɗauke da rubutunsa na kansa.','No settings were given.'=>'Ba a ba da saituna ba.','%2$s has no setting called "%1$s".'=>'%2$s ba shi da saiti mai suna "%1$s".','The place to put it is not on the page.'=>'Wurin da za a sanya shi ba a kan shafin yake ba.','A block cannot be moved inside itself.'=>'Ba za a iya matsar da bulogi zuwa cikin kansa ba.','This block saves its design in the page\'s HTML, so its settings can be changed only in the editor.'=>'Wannan tubali yana adana tsarinsa a cikin HTML na shafin, don haka za a iya canza saitunansa kawai a cikin edita.','Unknown operation.'=>'Aikin da ba a sani ba.','The text of this block can be changed only in the editor.'=>'Za a iya canza rubutun wannan shingen ne kawai a cikin edita.','Edit a page with the AI assistant'=>'Gyara shafi tare da mataimakin AI','Changes a page as asked in plain words ("make the hero text shorter", "add an FAQ about delivery after the pricing", "translate the page into German"). AI answers with edit operations that are checked against the page\'s blocks and their settings before anything is applied; refused operations are listed with the reason. A revision is saved first and its id returned as undo_revision.'=>'Yana canza shafi yadda aka nema a sauƙaƙan kalmomi ("gajarta rubutun hero", "ƙara FAQ game da bayarwa bayan farashi", "fassara shafin zuwa Jamusanci"). AI tana ba da amsa tare da ayyukan gyara waɗanda aka duba da tubalan shafin da saitunansu kafin a yi amfani da wani abu; an jera ayyukan da aka ƙi tare da dalili. Ana fara ajiye bita kuma a dawo da id ɗinta azaman undo_revision.','Plan a website with AI'=>'Tsara gidan yanar gizo tare da AI','From a description of the business, lists the pages a website needs (home first, contact last), each with a title and a brief for that page. Nothing is created; each page can then be built from its brief.'=>'Daga bayanin kasuwancin, yana jera shafukan da gidan yanar gizo ke buƙata (shafin gida da farko, shafin tuntuɓar ƙarshe), kowannensu yana da laƙabi da taƙaitaccen bayani na wannan shafin. Ba a ƙirƙiri komai ba; ana iya gina kowane shafi daga taƙaitaccen bayaninsa.','Create a custom block with AI'=>'Ƙirƙiri shingen da aka keɓance da AI','Designs a reusable component from a description (a pricing card, a team card, a banner) and saves it as a synced pattern in the editor\'s "My patterns", with each text overridable per placement. Returns its id and the block that places it.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar wani ɓangare da za a iya sake amfani da shi daga bayani (katin farashi, katin ƙungiya, tutar talla) kuma yana adana shi azaman samfurin da aka daidaita a cikin "Samfurorina" na edita, tare da kowane rubutu da za a iya canzawa a kowane wuri. Yana dawo da id ɗin sa da kuma block ɗin da ke sanya shi.','Design a page from a screenshot or a link with AI'=>'Tsara shafi daga hoton allo ko hanyar haɗi tare da AI','Recreates the layout of a screenshot (an image in the media library) or of a public web page (its address) as editable blocks in a new draft page: the same sections, columns, headings, text, lists and buttons. Logos and images are not copied.'=>'Yana sake fasalta tsarin hoton allo (hoto a cikin ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai) ko na shafin yanar gizo na jama\'a (adireshinsa) a matsayin ɓangarorin da za a iya gyarawa a cikin sabon shafin daftari: sassa iri ɗaya, ginshiƙai, lakabi, rubutu, lissafi da maɓallai. Ba a kwafin tambari da hotuna.','Generate an image with AI'=>'Ƙirƙiri hoto tare da AI','Creates an image from a description with the site\'s image model (OpenAI or Google) and saves it to the media library with alt text. Returns its id and address.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar hoto daga bayanin ta amfani da samfurin hoton shafin (OpenAI ko Google) sannan yana adana shi a ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai tare da rubutun alt. Yana dawo da id da adireshinsa.','Explain, write or fix CSS with AI'=>'Yi bayani, rubuta ko gyara CSS tare da AI','Explains, writes or fixes the custom CSS of one element, where `selector` stands for the element. Returns the CSS and an explanation; nothing is saved.'=>'Yana bayani, rubutawa ko gyara CSS na musamman na wani abu guda ɗaya, inda `selector` ke wakiltar abun. Yana dawo da CSS da bayani; babu abin da aka adana.','Check a page\'s accessibility'=>'Duba sauƙin amfani da shafi','Lists a page\'s accessibility problems: images without alt text, headings that skip a level, links whose text says nothing on its own, and links with no text. Each says whether it can be fixed automatically.'=>'Yana lissafa matsalolin samun dama na shafi: hotuna marasa rubutun alt, kanun labarai da suka tsallake mataki, hanyoyin haɗi waɗanda rubutunsu ba ya faɗin komai da kansu, da hanyoyin haɗi marasa rubutu. Kowane ɗaya yana nuna ko za a iya gyara shi ta atomatik.','Fix a page\'s accessibility with AI'=>'Gyara damar shiga shafi tare da AI','Fixes the accessibility problems that can be fixed (all, or the listed issue ids): alt text written by looking at each image, heading levels corrected, vague link texts rewritten. A revision is saved first and its id returned as undo_revision.'=>'Yana gyara matsalolin sauƙin amfani da za a iya gyarawa (duka, ko jerin id na matsala): rubutun alt da aka rubuta ta hanyar duba kowane hoto, matakan kanun labarai da aka gyara, rubutun hanyar haɗi maras tabbas da aka sake rubutawa. Ana adana bita da farko kuma ana dawo da id ɗin ta a matsayin undo_revision.','Describe the business in at least a sentence (up to 4,000 characters).'=>'Bayyana kasuwancin aƙalla a cikin jumla ɗaya (har zuwa haruffa 4,000).','The AI did not plan any page. Try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI ba ta tsara kowane shafi ba. Gwada tare da bayani mai cikakkun bayanai.','Describe the block in a sentence (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'Bayyana block ɗin a cikin jimla ɗaya (har zuwa haruffa 2,000).','Heading'=>'Kansara','Text'=>'Rubutu','New design'=>'Sabuwar ƙira','That is not an image you may use.'=>'Wannan ba hoton da za ku iya amfani da shi ba ne.','Use a PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP screenshot.'=>'Yi amfani da hoton allo na PNG, JPEG, GIF ko WebP.','The screenshot is too large (5 MB at most).'=>'Hoton allon ya yi girma da yawa (mafi yawa 5 MB).','Give a full web address starting with https://, or choose a screenshot.'=>'Shigar da cikakken adireshin yanar gizo da ke farawa da https://, ko zaɓi hoton allo.','That page could not be read. Check the address, or use a screenshot instead.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan shafin ba. Bincika adireshin, ko kuma a yi amfani da hoton allo.','That page has no readable text (it may be built in the browser). Use a screenshot instead.'=>'Wannan shafin ba shi da rubutun da za a iya karantawa (watakila an gina shi ne a cikin burauza). Yi amfani da hoton allo a maimakon haka.','Unknown CSS helper action.'=>'Ba a san aikin mataimakin CSS ba.','There is no CSS to explain or fix yet.'=>'Babu CSS da za a bayyana ko a gyara ba tukuna.','Say what the CSS should do.'=>'Faɗi abin da CSS ya kamata ya yi.','That is too much CSS for one request.'=>'Wannan ya yi yawa na CSS ga buƙata ɗaya.','The AI wrote CSS the builder refuses to use (it could break out of the style sheet or load something). Try again.'=>'AI ta rubuta CSS ɗin da maginin ya ƙi amfani da shi (zai iya fita daga maƙallin salo ko loda wani abu). Sake gwadawa.','Describe the image in a sentence (up to 4,000 characters).'=>'Bayyana hoton a cikin jimla ɗaya (har zuwa haruffa 4,000).','The AI did not return an image. Try again, or choose another image model in the AI settings.'=>'AI ba ta dawo da hoto ba. Sake gwadawa, ko zaɓi wani samfurin hoton daban a cikin saitunan AI.','The AI planned an empty layout. Try again, or describe it in more detail.'=>'AI ta tsara fasalin da babu komai a ciki. Sake gwadawa, ko kuma bayyana shi dalla-dalla.','Rated %s out of 5'=>'An ba da maki %s cikin 5','Adults only: %d and over'=>'Manya kaɗai: %d da sama','Pros'=>'Fa\'idodi','Cons'=>'Fasali marasa kyau','%1$s out of %2$s'=>'%1$s daga cikin %2$s','Claim offer'=>'Karɓi tayin','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply.'=>'Sababbin abokan ciniki ne kawai. Sharuɗɗa da ƙa\'idoji suna aiki.','Rank'=>'Matsayi','Operator'=>'Mai aiki','Bonus'=>'Kari','Rating'=>'Ƙima','Highlights'=>'Abubuwan Muhimmanci','Visit'=>'Ziyarta','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply. Please gamble responsibly.'=>'Sabbin kwastomomi kawai. Sharuɗɗa da ƙa\'idoji suna aiki. Da fatan za a yi caca cikin haƙƙi.','%s in 24 hours'=>'%s a cikin awanni 24','Prices will appear here shortly.'=>'Farashin zai bayyana a nan ba da daɗewa ba.','Prices from CoinGecko, updated %s'=>'Farashin daga CoinGecko, an sabunta %s','Cryptocurrency prices'=>'Farashin kuɗaɗen intanet','%1$s: %2$s, up %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$s, ya ƙaru da %3$s%% a cikin kwana %4$d' . "\0" . '%1$s: %2$s, ya ƙaru da %3$s%% a cikin kwanaki %4$d','%1$s: %2$s, down %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$s, ƙasa da %3$s%% a cikin kwana %4$d' . "\0" . '%1$s: %2$s, ya ragu da %3$s%% a cikin kwanaki %4$d','Lowest'=>'Mafi ƙanƙanta','Highest'=>'Mafi girma','Latest'=>'Na baya-bayan nan','Are you %d or older?'=>'Kuna da shekara %d ko fiye da haka?','This website is for adults only. Please confirm your age to continue.'=>'Wannan gidan yanar gizon na manya ne kawai. Da fatan za a tabbatar da shekarunku don ci gaba.','Sorry, you must be %d or older to visit this website.'=>'Kayi hakuri, dole ne ka kasance kana da shekaru %d ko sama da haka domin ziyartar wannan gidan yanar gizon.','Sorry, this website is not available in your country.'=>'Kayi hakuri, wannan rukunin yanar gizo babu shi a ƙasarku.','Your date of birth'=>'Ranar haihuwarka','Day'=>'Rana','Month'=>'Wata','Year'=>'Shekara','Enter'=>'Shiga','Yes, I am %d or older'=>'Ee, shekaruna sun kai %d ko fiye','Gambling can be addictive. Please play responsibly.'=>'Caca na iya zama jaraba. Da fatan za a yi wasa cikin hankali.','Get help'=>'Nemi taimako','Responsible gambling'=>'Caca mai alhaki','%d more items loaded.'=>'An ƙara loda wasu abubuwa %d.','Filter by category'=>'Tace ta fanni','All'=>'Duka','Load more'=>'Loda ƙari','Show more'=>'Nuna ƙari','Show less'=>'Nuna ƙasa da haka','Choose what to show'=>'Zaɓi abin da za a nuna','Option %d'=>'Zaɓi %d','More pages'=>'Karin shafuka','Page %d'=>'Shafi %d','Short links'=>'Gajerun hanyoyin haɗi','Short link'=>'Gajeren mahaɗi','Add short link'=>'Ƙara gajeren mahada','Edit short link'=>'Gyara gajeriyar hanyar haɗi','Search short links'=>'Nemo gajerun hanyoyin haɗi','No short links yet.'=>'Babu gajerun hanyoyin haɗi tukuna.','No short links in the bin.'=>'Babu gajerun hanyoyin haɗi a cikin kwandon shara.','Destination'=>'Wurin da za a tura','Where the link goes (the offer’s own address, with your affiliate code)'=>'Inda mahadar ke kaiwa (adireshin tayin kansa, tare da lambar haɗin gwiwarku)','Short link:'=>'Gajeren mahaɗi:','The short link is made from the title. Visitors are sent on to the destination and each visit is counted; search engines are asked not to follow it.'=>'Ana yin gajeren hanyar haɗin ne daga taken. Ana tura baƙi zuwa inda aka nufa kuma ana ƙidaya kowace ziyara; ana buƙatar injunan bincike da kada su bi ta.','Clicks'=>'Danna-danna','The animation could not be saved to the uploads folder.'=>'Ba a iya adana motsin rai a cikin babban fayil na lodawa ba.','The animation file is larger than 1 MB.'=>'Fayil ɗin motsin ya fi 1 MB girma.','This is not a Lottie animation (a JSON file exported with Bodymovin or LottieFiles).'=>'Wannan ba raye-rayen Lottie ba ne (fayil ɗin JSON da aka fitar da Bodymovin ko LottieFiles).','The animation has no usable size.'=>'Motsin ba shi da girman da za a iya amfani da shi.','The animation uses images that are not embedded in the file. Export it with "Include in JSON" (embedded images) and upload it again.'=>'Motsin yana amfani da hotunan da ba a saka su a cikin fayil ɗin ba. Fitar da shi tare da "Include in JSON" (hotuna da aka saka) sannan ku sake loda shi.','That is not a Mailchimp API key (it looks like 32 letters and digits, a dash, then something like us21).'=>'Wannan ba maɓallin Mailchimp API ba ne (yana kama da haruffa da lambobi 32, da ɗan layi, sannan wani abu kamar us21).','Show my first name and town in the "recent purchases" notices on this site.'=>'Nuna sunana na farko da garina a cikin sanarwoyin "sayayya na kwanan nan" a wannan rukunin yanar gizo.','Billing period'=>'Lokacin biyan kuɗi','Yearly'=>'Na shekara-shekara','/ month'=>'/ wata','/ year'=>'/ shekara','Not included:'=>'Ba a haɗa ba:','This offer ends %s hour after your first visit.'=>'Wannan tayin zai ƙare bayan sa\'a %s daga ziyararku ta farko.' . "\0" . 'Wannan tayin yana ƙarewa sa\'o\'i %s bayan ziyararku ta farko.','Ends on %s.'=>'Yana ƙarewa a %s.','Days'=>'Kwanaki','Hours'=>'Awanni','Minutes'=>'Minti','Seconds'=>'Daƙiƙoƙi','This offer has ended.'=>'Wannan tayin ya ƙare.','Turn the card over'=>'Juya katin','Before'=>'Kafin','After'=>'Bayan','Compare: how much of "%1$s" to show over "%2$s"'=>'Kwatanta: yawan "%1$s" da za a nuna a kan "%2$s"','%1$s on %2$s'=>'%1$s a kan %2$s','Website of %s'=>'Gidan yanar gizon %s','list separator, '=>', ','Pause the changing word'=>'Dakata da kalmar da ke canzawa','Animation'=>'Motsi','Pause the animation'=>'Dakata da motsin','Announcement'=>'Sanarwa','Close the announcement'=>'Rufe sanarwar','Code copied.'=>'An kwafi lambar.','The code could not be copied. Select it and copy it yourself.'=>'Ba a iya kwafin lambar ba. Zaɓe ta sannan ku kwafa da kanku.','Show and copy the code'=>'Nuna kuma kwafi lambar','Expires: %s'=>'Yana karewa: %s','%1$s from %2$s bought %3$s'=>'%1$s daga %2$s ya sayi %3$s','%1$s bought %2$s'=>'%1$s ya sayi %2$s','%1$s from %2$s just placed an order'=>'%1$s daga %2$s ya gama yin oda a yanzu','%s just placed an order'=>'%s ya gama yin oda yanzu','Recent purchases'=>'Sayayya ta kwanan nan','Hide recent purchases for this visit'=>'Ɓoye sayayyakin kwanan nan na wannan ziyarar','Logos'=>'Alamomi','Pause the scrolling logos'=>'Dakata da tamburan da ke gungurawa','Share this on X'=>'Raba wannan a X','Link copied.'=>'An kwafi hanyar haɗin yanar gizo.','The link could not be copied.'=>'Ba a iya kwafin hanyar haɗin ba.','Share by email'=>'Raba ta imel','Share on %s'=>'Raba a %s','Copy the link to this page'=>'Kofi hanyar haɗin wannan shafi','More ways to share'=>'Karin hanyoyin raba','Share this page'=>'Raba wannan shafi','Thank you! Please check your inbox to confirm.'=>'Mun gode! Da fatan za a duba akwatin saƙonku don tabbatarwa.','The signup could not be sent. Check your connection and try again.'=>'Ba a iya tura rajistar ba. Duba haɗin intanet ɗinka sannan ka sake gwadawa.','Subscribe'=>'Yi rajista','I agree to receive emails and know I can unsubscribe at any time.'=>'Na yarda in riƙa karɓar imel kuma na san zan iya cire kaina a kowane lokaci.','Image viewer'=>'Mai duba hoto','Previous image'=>'Hoton da ya gabata','Next image'=>'Hoto na gaba','Playlist'=>'Jerin waƙoƙi','Playback speed'=>'Gudun kunnawa','