ever count toward your site limit.'=>'Kofi na staging, gwaji da kuma localhost na shafi kyauta ne kuma ba sa taɓa shiga cikin adadin iyakar shafukanku.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Tsarinku ya ƙunshi fifikon samun tallafi.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Sarrafa lasisinku da biyan kuɗi','Get more with Pro'=>'Sami ƙari tare da Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Fara gwajin kyauta na kwanaki %d, ba a buƙatar kati' . "\0" . 'Fara gwajin kyauta na kwanaki %d, ba a buƙatar katin kuɗi','See plans and prices'=>'Duba tsare-tsare da farashin','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Kuna son amfani da Tranzly da Page Builder Sandwich tare? Kunshin ya haɗa da duka manhajojin Pro biyu a kan farashi mai rahusa.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Lasasinku ya ƙare. Sabunta shi domin ci gaba da samun sabuntawa da kuma fasalolin Pro.','Renew now'=>'Sabunta yanzu','Compare the plans'=>'Kwatanta tsare-tsaren','Search features'=>'Bincika fasaloli','Area'=>'Yanki','Included in'=>'Ciki har da','No feature matches.'=>'Babu siffar da ta dace.','Features by plan'=>'Siffofi bisa tsari','Hide'=>'Ɓoye','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Kuna iya kunna shi a shafin Plugins','Install it'=>'Shigar da shi','Overview'=>'Bayanin martaba','Setup'=>'Saitawa','Plans and licence'=>'Tsarurruka da laisanci','Add-ons'=>'Karin abubuwa','Feedback'=>'Ra\'ayi','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana zaɓinku ba.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya ajiye yanayin saitin ba.','Match my computer'=>'Daidaita da kwamfutata','Light'=>'Haske','Dark'=>'Duhu','Colour scheme'=>'Tsarin launi','Help'=>'Taimako','Guide to this screen'=>'Jagora zuwa wannan allon','Take the tour'=>'Fara yawon shakatawa','Get help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ba da rahoton matsala','Plugin screens'=>'Fuskorin manhaja','That could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana wannan ba.','Before you contact support'=>'Kafin ku tuntuɓi sashen tallafi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Ana aika buƙatarku daga wannan rukunin yanar gizo zuwa %s, wanda ya kera wannan manhaja. Muna aika:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adireshin imel ɗinku da sunanku, domin mu iya ba da amsa;','the subject and message you write;'=>'batun da saƙon da kuke rubutawa;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID ɗin lasisinku, domin abokan ciniki masu biya su sami fifiko;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kawai idan ka danna shi: bayanan shafi (nau\'o\'in WordPress da PHP, jigo, kayan aiki, wani ɓangare na bayanan kuskure wanda aka cire kalmomin sirri da adiresoshin imel), waɗanda za ka iya karantawa kafin aikawa;','I agree, continue'=>'Na yarda, ci gaba','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ba a iya duba haɗin ba.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Wannan bai yi aiki ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taimakon Zinn Digital® ya cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Sashen tallafi na Zinn Digital® ba ya sake gane wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Kun cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizo.','Connect this site to support'=>'Haɗa wannan shafi da tallafi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'An haɗa. Amsoshi za su je zuwa ga %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ba a haɗa ba. Har yanzu za ku iya aiko da buƙata tare da adireshin imel ɗinku a ƙasa; haɗawa yana kiyaye rubuta shi a kowane lokaci.','E-mail address'=>'Adireshin imel','Your name (optional)'=>'Sunanki/Sunanka (na zaɓi)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Na yarda in haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizo da tallafin Zinn Digital®. Yana aika adireshin wannan rukunin yanar gizo, sigar WordPress da ta PHP da kuma sigar manhajar ƙari, kuma ana iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga nan ko ta hanyar Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Haɗa','I need help'=>'Ina buƙatar taimako','Report a bug'=>'Ba da rahoton matsala','Send feedback'=>'Aika da ra\'ayi','Request a feature'=>'Nemi wani fasali','The site details could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta bayanan shafin ba.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya aika buƙatarku ba. Sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintuna.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Ra\'ayoyi da buƙatun fasali','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'An aika. Lambar nuni ku ita ce %s, kuma amsanmu za ta zo ta imel.','What is it about?'=>'Game da me yake?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Amsa zuwa ga (imel)','Subject'=>'Maudu\'i','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Me kuka yi, me kuka yi tsammani, kuma me ya faru a maimakon haka?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Haɗa da bayanan shafi (nau\'o\'i, jigo, manhajoji, tsakuron rajistar kuskure)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Duba ainihin abin da aka aiko','Loading…'=>'Ana lodawa…','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Mataki na %1$d cikin %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Rufe rangadin','Everything in one place'=>'Komai a wuri ɗaya','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Wadannan shafukan suna kaiwa zuwa kowane allon manhajar: saitawa, saituna, lasisinku, taimako da ƙari.','Help on every screen'=>'Taimako a kowane shafi','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Bude wannan mazaɓar don jagorar allon da kuke kai, wannan rangadin, ko don neman taimako daga gare mu.','Light or dark'=>'Haske ko duhu','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Zaɓi mai haske, mai duhu, ko daidai da na kwamfutarka. Zaɓinka ana adana shi don kai kaɗai.','Welcome'=>'Barka da zuwa','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Wannan ɗan gajeren rangadin yana nuna inda abubuwa suke. Za ku iya fita daga ciki a kowane lokaci ta hanyar amfani da Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Shafinku a taƙaice','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ci gaban saiti da tsarin ku ana nuna su a nan, tare da abu na gaba da ya kamata a yi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Tsarinku, adadin rukunonin yanar gizo da ya ƙunsa, da kuma ko wannan kwafin rukunin yanar gizon yana ƙirguwa a cikin wannan iyaka.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gwada Pro ko haɓaka','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Fara gwaji na kyauta ba tare da katin banki ba, haɓaka, ko sabuntawa, duk daga nan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kowane fasali da tsarin da ya ƙunsa. Nemo fasali ko nuna yanki ɗaya a lokaci guda.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Ƙari daga Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Kari-karan da ke aiki tare da wannan, da kuma ayyuka daga ƙungiya ɗaya. Katinan da kuka ɓoye a wasu allunan za a iya sake nuna su a nan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Haɗa domin samun taimako da sauri','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Haɗawa na zaɓi ne. Yana ba ku damar aika buƙatu ba tare da buga imel ɗinku a kowane lokaci ba, kuma kuna iya cire haɗin a duk lokacin da kuke so.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ba da rahoton kuskure','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Bayanin abin da ya faru. Kuna zaɓar ko za a haɗa bayanin shafin yanar gizo, kuma za ku iya ganin ainihin abin da ya ƙunsa tukuna.','Tell us what to build'=>'Faɗa mana abin da za mu gina','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Aika shawara, buƙatar sabon fasali ko kowane irin ra\'ayi. Yana tafiya kai tsaye zuwa ga ƙungiyar.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Wannan yana ɗaukar \'yan mintoci kuma yana saita %s domin ya yi aiki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon nan da nan. Kuna iya canza komai daga baya.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Kuna a shirye. Idan wani abu bai yi aiki kamar yadda ake tsammani ba, muna nan kusa da ku da dannawa ɗaya kacal.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Mataki na %1$d cikin %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Kammala','Skip setup'=>'Tsallake saitawa','Import “%s”'=>'Shigar da “%s”','%d page imported.'=>'An shigo da shafi %d.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da shafuka %d.','edit'=>'Gyara','Pages to import'=>'Shafukan da za a shigo da su','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Buga shafukan a yanzu (in ba haka ba za a ajiye su a matsayin zayyana)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'Yi amfani da babban shafin kayan aiki a matsayin babban shafin rukunin yanar gizon','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Ƙirƙiri menu tare da shafukan da aka shigo da su','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Shigarwa ba zai taɓa canza shafukanku na yanzu ba. Shigar da wannan kayan aikin kuma zai sabunta shafukan da ya ƙirƙira a baya.','Import'=>'Shigar da ciki','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Cikakkun rukunin yanar gizo da za ku iya shigarwa da dannawa ɗaya: shafuka, sassa da menu, a shirye don kalmomin ku da hotunanku. Kayan aikin sun fito ne daga Zinn Digital® kuma ana ƙara sababbi kowane wata.','Search kits'=>'Bincika kayan aiki','Category'=>'Rukuni','All categories'=>'Duk rukunoni','Free and Pro'=>'Kyauta da Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'Haɓaka zuwa Pro don shigowa da shi','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Babu kayan aikin da ya dace da waɗannan matatun.','My library'=>'Dakin karatu na','Team'=>'Tawagar aiki','Storage'=>'Wurin ajiya','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Ana ajiye ɗakin karatu naku a cikin ma\'ajiyar ku ta kanku, don haka babu wani adadin ƙa\'ida na Zinn Digital® da ya shafi wannan.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%1$s daga cikin %2$s an yi amfani da shi (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d daga cikin ƙira %2$d · har zuwa %3$s ga kowace ƙira · ana sake girman hotuna zuwa px 2560 kuma a ajiye su sau ɗaya','Deleted from your library.'=>'An goge daga ɗakin karatunku.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Ajiye kowane sashe ko shafi daga edita: bude menu na ⋮ na toshe sannan ka zabi "Ajiye a dakin karatu na gajimare". Saka zane-zanen da aka ajiye daga allon dakin karatu na Cloud a cikin edita, a kowane shafukanka.','Show'=>'Nuna','Everything'=>'Kome','Sections'=>'Bangarori','Styles'=>'Salo-salo','Size'=>'Girma','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Ba a ajiye komai ba tukuna.','Delete'=>'Goge','Write a test file'=>'Rubuta fayil ɗin gwaji','Read it back'=>'Karanta shi kuma','Delete it'=>'Goge shi','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'A cikin dashboard ɗin Cloudflare ɗinku, buɗe R2 Object Storage kuma ƙirƙiri bucket (misali “my-pbs-library”). A bar shi a keɓe: kada ku haɗa yankin jama\'a (public domain).','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Bude "Manage API tokens" a cikin R2 sannan ka ƙirƙiri alamar API mai izinin "Object Read & Write", wacce ta takaita ga wannan rumbun ajiya guda ɗaya kawai.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Kwafi ID na Maɓallin Shiga da kuma Maɓallin Shiga na Sirri da yake nunawa (ana nuna sirrin sau ɗaya kawai).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Kwafi S3 endpoint ɗin asusunku. Yana kama da https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Yanki shi ne "auto".','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Manna ƙimomin da ke ƙasa, ajiye, sannan danna "Gwada haɗin". Canza ɗakin karatu zuwa ma\'ajiyarka kawai idan gwajin ya yi nasara.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Ƙirƙiri keɓaɓɓen bucket tare da mai ba da sabis ɗinku (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO ko kowane sabis mai jituwa da S3).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Ƙirƙiri maɓallin shiga wanda zai iya karantawa, rubutawa da goge abubuwa a cikin wannan ma\'ajiyar kaɗai.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Nemo wurin ƙarshe na S3 (don Amazon S3: %s) da yankin bucket ɗin.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 yana amfani da adiresoshin da aka karɓa ta hanyar kama-da-wane: kashe “Path-style addresses”. Mafi yawan sauran ayyuka suna amfani da salon-hanya.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Manna ƙimomin da ke ƙasa, ajiye, sannan danna “Test connection”.','Storage settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saitunan ma\'ajiya.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Ana adana ɗakin karatun gajimare ɗinku a cikin ma\'ajiyar Zinn Digital® tare da sararin da tsarinku ya ƙunsa. Za ku iya adana shi a cikin naku ma\'ajiyar Cloudflare R2 ko wacce ta dace da S3 maimakon haka: sannan babu ƙa\'idar iyaka ta Zinn Digital® da za ta yi aiki, kuma duk rukunin yanar gizon da kuka haɗa da ma\'ajiyar ɗaya zai raba ɗakin karatun. Ɗakunan karatu na ƙungiya a koyaushe suna amfani da ma\'ajiyar Zinn Digital®.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'Haɗa ma\'ajiyar ku: mataki-mataki','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Wani sabis ɗin da ya dace da S3','Read the full guide'=>'Karanta cikakken jagorar','S3 endpoint'=>'Tashar ƙarshe ta S3','Bucket'=>'Buga','Region'=>'Yanki','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: na atomatik.','Access key ID'=>'ID ɗin Maɓallin Shiga','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'An ajiye. Bar shi a fanko don ci gaba da riƙe shi.','Secret access key'=>'Mabuɗin shiga na sirri','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'An adana shi a ɓoye a wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma ba za a sake nuna shi ba. Bar shi a fanko don kiyaye shi.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An adana shi a ɓoye a wannan rukunin yanar gizo. Ba a taɓa aika shi zuwa Zinn Digital® ba.','Path-style addresses'=>'Adiresoshin salon hanya','Folder in the bucket'=>'Babban fayil a cikin bokiti','Save'=>'Ajiye','Test connection'=>'Gwada haɗin yanar gizo','Remove these settings'=>'Cire waɗannan saitunan','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Ajiye dakin karatu na a wannan ma\'ajiyar','The connection test passed.'=>'Gwajin haɗin ya yi nasara.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Fara gudanar da “Gwada haɗin gwiwa”.','Invite a site'=>'Gayyaci shafi','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Na wane ne? (na zaɓi)','Access'=>'Shiga','Use designs (read only)'=>'Yi amfani da zane-zane (karantawa kawai)','Use and save designs'=>'Yi amfani da zane-zane kuma adana su','Create invite code'=>'Ƙirƙiri lambar gayyata','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Ba wa mai shafin wannan lambar. Tana aiki sau ɗaya ne kawai, na tsawon kwanaki 7, kuma a yanzu kaɗai ake nuna ta:','Copy'=>'Kofa','Members'=>'Mambobi','No site has joined yet.'=>'Babu wani shafi da ya shiga tukuna.','use and save'=>'Yi amfani da ajiye','read only'=>'karatu kawai','Delete team'=>'Goge ƙungiya','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'A goge wannan ƙungiyar da kuma kowane zane da ke cikin ɗakin karatunta?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya shiga dakin karatun kungiyar.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizo yana amfani da ɗakin karatu na ƙungiya:','Leave'=>'Fita','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Shiga ƙungiya tare da lambar gayyata','Join'=>'Shiga','Your teams'=>'Ƙungiyoyinku','New team name'=>'Sabuwar sunan ƙungiya','Create team'=>'Ƙirƙiri ƙungiya','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Ƙirƙirar ɗakunan karatu na ƙungiya na zuwa ne tare da tsarin Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Ajiye sassa, shafuka da salo zuwa ɗakin karatun gajimarenku kuma sake amfani da su a duk rukunin yanar gizonku. Hukumomi za su iya raba ɗakin karatu tare da ƙungiyar su da abokan ciniki. Kuna iya ajiye ɗakin karatu a ma\'ajiyar Zinn Digital® ko a cikin Cloudflare R2 ko ma\'ajiyar da ta dace da S3 naku.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Sami Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo','Cloud library'=>'Dakin karatu na gajimare','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock, Shugaba na Zinn Digital® Ltd ne ya gina shi','Version %s'=>'Fasali %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Gidan yanar gizon Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Gidan yanar gizon Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saituna.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba tsare-tsaren Pro da farashi','Front-end output'=>'Fitarwa ta gaba','Class name prefix'=>'Gaba-gaban sunan aji','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane sunan aji (class name) da manhajar ke nunawa a shafukanku yana farawa ne da wannan harafin gaba, don haka shafukan ba za su bayyana manhajar da ta gina su ba. Ƙananan haruffa ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, yana farawa da harafi.','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizo yana karɓar nau\'ikan beta a matsayin sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizo yana karɓar ingantattun sigogi ne kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Sauya wannan a shafin Asusun','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana ba da nau\'ikan beta ga shigarwar Pro masu lasisi da ke da alaƙa da asusunsu. Da zarar an haɗa, za ku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'An ajiye wuraren tsayawa. Shafuka za su ɗauki sabbin faɗin a duba na gaba.','Breakpoints'=>'Wuraren katsalandan','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Salo-salan da aka saita don Tablet suna aiki har zuwa faɗin kwamfutar hannu (tablet), kuma salo-salan da aka saita don Mobile suna aiki har zuwa faɗin wayar hannu. Salo-salan Desktop suna aiki a duk sauran wurare.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Tablet: har zuwa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Waya: har zuwa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Ajiye wuraren tsayawa','Use the default widths'=>'Yi amfani da faɗin asali','Settings'=>'Saituna','Templates & kits'=>'Samfura da kayan aiki','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Bukatar mai da wannan rubutu ta tsaya kafin ta kammala, don haka aka tsallake rubutun. Bude shi don mayar da shi, ko kuma sake mayar da shi daga nan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Babu wani ajiyar wannan rubutu da za a iya mayarwa.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana abin da aka canza ba.','Unknown error.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a sani ba.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Ba a bincika wani tsohon abun ciki ba tukunna.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Ana maido da tsohon abun ciki: %1$d cikin %2$d na rubuce-rubuce.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Ana canza tsohon abun ciki: %1$d cikin %2$d na rubuce-rubuce.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'An gama soke aikin: an dawo da %1$d, %2$d sun faskara.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'An kammala canzawa: an canza %1$d, %2$d ba a canza ba, %3$d sun gaza.','Legacy content'=>'Tsohon abun ciki','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Shafukan da aka yi da nau\'ikan Page Builder Sandwich na baya ana canza su zuwa tubalan a bango. Ana ajiye kowane rubutu da farko, don haka za a iya soke kowane canji.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Wani rubutu %d har yanzu yana ɗauke da tsohon abun ciki.' . "\0" . 'Rubuce-rubuce %d har yanzu suna ɗauke da tsohon abun ciki.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Wurin rubutu %d yana da kwafin ajiya.' . "\0" . 'Rubuce-rubuce %d suna da kwafin ajiya.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Ba a iya sarrafa rubutu %d ba' . "\0" . 'Ba a iya sarrafa rubuce-rubuce %d ba','Post %d'=>'Rubutu %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara juyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; za ku iya barin wannan shafin.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Mayar da kowane rubutu da aka sauya zuwa asalin abin da ke ciki na dā? Canje-canjen da aka yi wa wadannan rubuce-rubucen tun bayan da aka sauya su za su bace.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara soke aikin. Yana ci gaba a bango; za ku iya barin wannan shafin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Soke dukkan canje-canje','Fix it'=>'Gyara shi','AI uses your own AI provider account. Connect one to start.'=>'AI yana amfani da asusun mai ba da sabis na AI naka. Haɗa ɗaya don farawa.','Set up AI'=>'Saita AI','AI'=>'AI','This block has no text of its own.'=>'Wannan tubali ba shi da nasa rubutun.','Assistant'=>'Mataimaki','Not done (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Ba a kammala ba (%1$s): %2$s','Undo this change'=>'Soke wannan canjin','What should change?'=>'Me ya kamata ya canza?','For example: "make the hero shorter and friendlier", "add an FAQ about delivery after the pricing", "translate this section into Spanish". Select a block first to point at it.'=>'Misali: "sanya babban sashin ya zama gajere kuma mai sauƙin fahimta", "ƙara tambayoyin da aka saba yi game da isarwa bayan farashi", "fassara wannan sashe zuwa harshen Ispaniyanci". Fara zaɓar wani block da farko domin nuna shi.','Ask'=>'Tambaya','Build a website'=>'Gina gidan yanar gizo','Describe the business'=>'Bayyana kasuwancin','Plan the pages'=>'Shirya shafukan','Build these pages as drafts'=>'Gina waɗannan shafuka a matsayin zayyana','Create with AI'=>'Ƙirƙira da AI','A custom block'=>'Wani shinge na musamman','Describe a component ("a team member card with photo, name, role and a short bio"). It is saved to My patterns, with its texts editable on every page that uses it.'=>'Bayyana wani bangare ("katin memba na ƙungiya mai ɗauke da hoto, suna, matsayi da ɗan takaitaccen bayani"). An adana shi a Tsare-tsarena, tare da rubutunsa da za a iya gyarawa a kowane shafi da ke amfani da shi.','Block created and added to the page.'=>'An ƙirƙiri shingen kuma an ƙara shi a shafin.','Edit the block'=>'Gyara shingen','Create block'=>'Ƙirƙiri shinge','Design a page from a screenshot or a website address: AI recreates its layout as editable blocks in a new draft.'=>'Tsara shafi daga hoton allon na\'ura ko adireshin gidan yanar gizo: AI yana sake ƙirƙirar tsarinsa a matsayin tubalan da za a iya gyarawa a cikin sabon daftarin aiki.','Draft page created.'=>'An ƙirƙiri shafin daftari.','Choose a screenshot'=>'Zaɓi hoton allo','Or a website address'=>'Ko adireshin gidan yanar gizo','Design from the address'=>'Zane daga adireshin','Generate an image'=>'Ƙirƙiri hoto','Describe the image'=>'Bayyana hoton','Shape'=>'Siffa','Landscape'=>'Gefen kwance','Square'=>'Kusurwa huɗu','Portrait'=>'Tsaye','Generate and add'=>'Ƙirƙira kuma ƙara','CSS helper'=>'Mataimakin CSS','Select a block to work on its custom CSS.'=>'Zaɓi wani bulo domin yin aiki a kan CSS ɗinsa na musamman.','What should the CSS do?'=>'Me ya kamata CSS ya yi?','Write'=>'Rubuta','Fix'=>'Gyara','Explain'=>'Yi bayani','Use this CSS'=>'Yi amfani da wannan CSS','Image without alt text'=>'Hoto mara rubutun alt','Heading skips a level'=>'Taken yana tsallake mataki','Link text says nothing on its own'=>'Rubutun mahaɗin ba ya bayyana komai da kansa','Link with no text (fill it in yourself)'=>'Mahada mara rubutu (cika shi da kanka)','Accessibility fixes'=>'Gyaran sauƙin shiga','Save the page first: the check reads the saved page.'=>'Ajiye shafin tukuna: binciken yana karanta shafin da aka ajiye.','Check this page'=>'Duba wannan shafi','No problems found.'=>'Ba a sami wata matsala ba.','Fix what can be fixed'=>'Gyara abin da za a iya gyarawa','%1$d fixed, %2$d left for you. The page was saved; its previous version is in the revisions.'=>'An gyara %1$d, an bar ma %2$d. An ajiye shafin; sigarsa ta baya tana cikin gyare-gyare.','Add a section'=>'Ƙara sashe','Describe the section'=>'Bayyana sashin','For example: "pricing with three plans for a dog-walking service". It is built from the section library in your brand style.'=>'Misali: "farashi tare da tsare-tsare uku don hidimar tafiyar da karnuka". An gina shi daga ɗakin karatu na sashe a cikin salon tambarin ku.','Generate section'=>'Samar da sashe','SEO and alt text'=>'SEO da rubutun alt','Install Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO to save a meta title and description.'=>'Shigar da Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress ko All in One SEO domin adana taken meta da bayani.','Focus keyword (optional)'=>'Mabudin kalmar mayar da hankali (na zaɓi)','Suggest title and description'=>'Ba da shawarar take da bayani','Meta title'=>'Taken meta','Meta description'=>'Bayanin meta','Saved to: %s'=>'An ajiye a: %s','Save to my SEO plugin'=>'Ajiye a manhajar SEO tawa','Alt text written for %d image(s).'=>'An rubuta rubutun alt don hoto/hotuna %d.','Write missing alt text'=>'Rubuta rubutun alt da ya ɓace','Images saved on this page appear here once the page is saved.'=>'Hotunan da aka ajiye a wannan shafin za su bayyana a nan da zarar an ajiye shafin.','Professional'=>'Kwarewa','Friendly'=>'Mai sauƙin amfani','Confident'=>'Mai gaba gaɗi','Playful'=>'Mai wasa','Formal'=>'Na hukuma','Simple'=>'Mai sauƙi','AI changed the text. Undo to go back.'=>'AI ta canza rubutun. Soke don komawa baya.','AI writing'=>'Rubutun AI','Improve'=>'Inganta','Make shorter'=>'Rage tsawo','Make longer'=>'Tsawaita','Fix spelling and grammar'=>'Gyara haruffa da ƙa\'idojin rubutu','Rewrite as I ask…'=>'Sake rubutawa kamar yadda na nema…','Write with AI…'=>'Rubuta da AI…','Change the tone'=>'Sauya sautin magana','Rewrite with AI'=>'Sake rubutawa da AI','Write with AI'=>'Rubuta tare da AI','What should it say?'=>'Me ya kamata ya faɗa?','Item'=>'Abu','Open when the page loads'=>'Bude lokacin da shafi ya loda','Title is a heading'=>'Take jigo ne','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Mayar da taken ya zama kanun labari idan abubuwan sassan shafi ne, domin maziyarta su iya tsallakawa a tsakaninsu.','Heading %d'=>'Kanta labari %d','Question or section title'=>'Tambaya ko kan magana na sashe','Accordion'=>'Akordiyon','Only one item open at a time'=>'Abu ɗaya kawai a buɗe a lokaci guda','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Yi alama a matsayin FAQ don injunan bincike','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Yana ƙara tsarin bayanan FAQ da aka gina daga kanun labarai (tambayoyi) da rubutunsu (amsoshi).','Alert'=>'Gargaɗi','Information'=>'Bayanai','Success'=>'Nasarar','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Ana sanar da gargaɗi da kurakurai ga masu amfani da mai karanta allo nan take; ana karanta sanarwar bayani da nasara idan sun gama abin da suke yi.','Show icon'=>'Nuna alama','Visitors can close it'=>'Masu ziyara za su iya rufe shi','Title (optional)'=>'Take (na zaɓi)','Write the message…'=>'Rubuta saƙon…','Centre'=>'Cibiya','Badge'=>'Lambar yabo','Colour'=>'Launi','Theme accent'=>'Kalar jigon aiki','Neutral'=>'Tsaka-tsaki','Position'=>'Matsayi','Label'=>'Alama','Booking calendar'=>'Kalandar yin ajiyar wuri','Service'=>'Sabis','Booking page address'=>'Adireshin shafin yin rajista','For example %s'=>'Misali %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Abin da kalandar take yi, wanda masu karanta allo ke karantawa kuma ake nunawa a ƙarƙashinta.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Wannan ba adireshin shafin yin ajiyar wuri na %s ba ne, don haka babu abin da zai fito a shafin.','Preview the calendar'=>'Duba kalandar kafin lokaci','Link address'=>'Adireshin mahaɗi','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Maballin yana bayyana ne kawai idan yana da lakabi da kuma adireshi.','Open in a new tab'=>'Buɗe a sabon shafi','Layout'=>'Tsari','Buttons below'=>'Maballan da ke ƙasa','Buttons beside the text'=>'Maballan kusa da rubutun','Alignment'=>'Daidaitawa','Main button'=>'Babban maɓalli','Second button'=>'Maballin na biyu','Heading…'=>'Kanta…','One sentence on why…'=>'Jumla ɗaya kan dalilin da ya sa…','Second button (optional)'=>'Maballin na biyu (na zaɓi)','Checklist'=>'Jerin dubawa','Tick colour'=>'Launin alamar shaidawa','Lines'=>'Layuka','Line %d'=>'Layi %d','Task…'=>'Aiki…','Add line'=>'Ƙara layi','Detect automatically'=>'Gano ta atomatik','No highlighting'=>'Babu fito-da-farko','File name'=>'Sunan fayil','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'An nuna shi a saman lambar, misali functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Lambar layuka','Copy button'=>'Maballin kwafa','Wrap long lines'=>'Nannade dogayen layuka','Write or paste code…'=>'Rubuta ko liƙa lissafin lamba…','Columns'=>'Rukunoni','Highlight %s'=>'Haskaka %s','Add column'=>'Ƙara shafi','Rows'=>'Layuka','Row %d'=>'Layi %d','Add row'=>'Ƙara layi','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Kashin magana (abin da ake kwatantawa)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Nau\'in kwayar halitta: %s. Canza','Phone call'=>'Kiran waya','Text message'=>'Sakon tes','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Maballai','Phone number, with country code'=>'Lambar waya, tare da lambar ƙasa','Button text'=>'Rubutun maɓalli','Remove this button'=>'Cire wannan maɓallin','Add a button'=>'Ƙara maballin','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Sakon WhatsApp na farawa da shi (na zaɓi)','Contact buttons'=>'Maballan tuntuɓa','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara lambar waya, adireshin imel ko lambar WhatsApp a cikin gefen shafi.','Dual heading'=>'Kanta biyu','Heading level'=>'Matakin kan magana','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Yi amfani da H1 sau ɗaya a kowane shafi, domin babban taken sa.','Second part look'=>'Kallon kashi na biyu','Accent colour'=>'Launin ƙarfafawa','Gradient'=>'Gradiyant','Outline'=>'Siffa','Underline'=>'Ja layi a ƙasa','Second part on its own line'=>'Kashi na biyu a layinsa na kansa','First part'=>'Sashe na farko','second part'=>'Kashi na biyu','Marker pen'=>'Alkalamin alama','Thick underline'=>'Karkashin layi mai kauri','Background'=>'Fage','Highlight'=>'Haskaka','Remove highlight'=>'Cire haskaka','Drop cap'=>'Babban harafin farko','Large first letter'=>'Babban harafi na farko','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Don harafin farko da ke cikin akwati, zaɓi salon "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Babban harafin farko a cikin akwati','Accent bar'=>'Kallon girmamawa','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Kalaman jaddadawa (layin jaddadawa)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Kalaman da aka ɗauko daga rubutun, an rubuta su da manyan haruffa kusa da layi mai launi don ɗaukar hankali.','quote'=>'Nakalto','Feature list'=>'Jerin fasaloli','On phones the features always stack.'=>'A wayoyi, siffofin koyaushe suna jeruwa a saman juna.','Feature %d'=>'Siffa %d','Own icon'=>'Gunkin kanka','Feature…'=>'Fito da shi…','Describe it…'=>'Kwatanta shi…','Add feature'=>'Ƙara siffa','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Shigar da kuma kunna Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms ko Fluent Forms, sannan zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin fom-fom ɗin sa a nan.','Form plugin'=>'Fulogin ɗin foom','Choose a form…'=>'Zaɓi fom…','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s ba shi da fom tukuna','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s ba ya aiki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, saboda haka ba za a iya nuna wannan fom ɗin ba.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda jerin fom ɗin ba.','Form style'=>'Salon fomu','Fields'=>'Fannoni','Outlined'=>'Mai shaci','Filled'=>'Cikakke','Underlined'=>'An ja layi a ƙasa','Button width'=>'Faɗin maɓalli','Fit the text'=>'Daidaita rubutun','Full width'=>'Cikakken faɗi','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Launuka, rubututtuka, tazarar tsakani da kusurwoyi suna fitowa ne daga tsarin rukunin yanar gizonku da saitunan tsari na wannan bulo.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Nuna fom daga manhajar fom ɗinku, wanda aka tsara shi don dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Kuna buƙatar plugin ɗin fom? Contact Form 7 kyauta ne.','Glossary'=>'Kamus','Sort A to Z'=>'Jera daga A zuwa Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Shafin yana nuna kalmomin bisa jerin haruffa; a nan suna kasancewa a tsarin da kuka rubuta su.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Nuna jerin A–Z','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Haɗa kalmomin da aka yi amfani da su a wani wuri a wannan shafi','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'A karon farko da kowane kalma ya bayyana a cikin rubutun shafin, yana haɗawa da ma\'anarsa. Ba a taɓa kanun labarai, maballai, lodi da kuma hanyoyin haɗin da ke akwai ba.','Terms'=>'Sharudda','Term %d'=>'Sharadi %d','Term'=>'Sharaɗi','What it means…'=>'Abin da yake nufi…','Add term'=>'Ƙara kalma','Icon list'=>'Jerin gumaka','One below the other'=>'Daya a karkashin daya','Side by side'=>'Kusada da juna','List item…'=>'Abin jeri…','Info box'=>'Akwatin bayani','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Ko zaɓi kowace alama daga ɗakin karatu:','Link text'=>'Rubutun mahada','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Faɗi inda mahadar ke kaiwa ("Duba farashinmu"), ba "Ƙara karantawa ba".','A sentence or two…'=>'Jumla ɗaya ko biyu…','section — a thematic section'=>'sashe — sashe mai jigo','div — no meaning'=>'div — ba ma\'ana','header — introductory content'=>'kan shafi — abun ciki na gabatarwa','footer — closing content'=>'ƙasan shafi — abun ciki na rufewa','article — self-contained content'=>'muƙala — ƙunshiyar mai zaman kanta','aside — related content'=>'gefe — abun da ke da alaƙa','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'babba — babban abun ciki (sau ɗaya a kowane shafi)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — hanyoyin kewaya shafi','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Tari (flexbox, ginshiƙi)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safi (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Gariji','Editing: %s'=>'Ana gyara: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Sanya ƙananan abubuwa a matsayin','Inherited (%s)'=>'Gāda (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Tullukan da aka jera a kan juna','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Ja a kan zane, ko rubuta','Content width'=>'Faɗin ƙunshiya','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'A cikin akwati (fadin abun cikin jigon)','Minimum height'=>'Mafi ƙarancin tsawo','HTML tag'=>'Tag ɗin HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Mayar da dukan toshe mahada zuwa','Link text for screen readers'=>'Bayanin mahada don masu karanta allo','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Abin da mahadar take yi, ga maziyartan da ba za su iya ganin toshewar ba.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Kada a saka hanyoyin haɗi ko maballai a cikin toshe mai ɗauke da hanyar haɗi: hanyar haɗi a cikin wata hanyar haɗin ba ta aiki a manhajojin bincike.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Jawo domin sake girman waɗannan rukunai','Drag to resize this row'=>'Jawo domin sake girman wannan layin','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Jawo a kan sel-sel don saita yawan ginshikai da layuka da wannan tubali zai mamaye','+ Column'=>'+ Rukunin layi','− Column'=>'− Rafi','+ Row'=>'+ Layi','− Row'=>'− Layi','Place'=>'Wuri','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Manna daidaitattun wurare ko hanyar haɗi ta OpenStreetMap','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'A kan openstreetmap.org, nemo wurin, sannan ka kwafi adireshin daga mashigin bincike na burawza, ko kuma danna dama a kan taswirar sannan ka zaɓi "Show address".','Latitude'=>'Gudun latitude','Longitude'=>'Tsawon wuri','Zoom'=>'Faɗaɗa','Name of the place'=>'Sunan wurin','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Ana nunawa a ƙarƙashin taswirar kuma masu karanta allo suna karantawa.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Manna daidaitattun wurare (misali 51.5074, -0.1278) ko hanyar haɗi ta OpenStreetMap.','Coordinates or link'=>'Mahaɗa ko hanyar haɗi','Preview the map'=>'Duba taswirar','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Duba %1$s, %2$s a kan OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Ranar da aka buga','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Kwanan watan sabuntawa (idan ya bambanta)','Tags'=>'Alamomi','Reading time'=>'Lokacin karantawa','Comment count'=>'Adadin sharhi','Details to show'=>'Bayanai da za a nuna','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla bayani guda ɗaya da za a nuna.','Progress bar'=>'Gangar ci gaba','Maximum'=>'Mafi yawa','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 don kashi ɗari; kowane lamba daban don ƙidaya, kamar 8 cikin 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Nuna kashi dari','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'An saita kalmar sirri. Masu ziyara za su ga fom ɗin kalmar sirri a maimakon wannan abun ciki har sai sun shigar da ita.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Ba a sa kalmar sirri ba tukuna, don haka maziyarta ba sa ganin komai a nan.','New password'=>'Sabuwar kalmar sirri','Set the password'=>'Saita kalmar sirri','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'An saita kalmar sirri. Ajiye shafin don amfani da ita; maziyartan da suka riga suka bude shi a baya za su bukaci sabuwar.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Idan har aka taɓa kashe Page Builder Sandwich, za a nuna wannan abun ciki ga kowa.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Saƙo a saman fom ɗin kalmar sirri (na zaɓi)','A/B test'=>'Gwajin A/B','Test name'=>'Sunan gwaji','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'Maziyarta da suka ga sigar B (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Manufa (na zaɓi)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Juyawa ita ce danna mahaɗi ko maɓalli, ko aika fom, a cikin wannan sigar. Don ƙidaya danna wani wuri a shafin maimakon haka, shigar da CSS selector ɗinsa, misali #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Duba sakamakon','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Gwajin A/B yana buƙatar nau\'ikan iri biyu daidai.','Button'=>'Maballin','Visit site'=>'Ziyarci shafi','Style'=>'Salo','Affiliate button'=>'Maballin haɗin gwiwa','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Ba maɓallin rubutunsa da kuma adireshin tayin a cikin gefen shafi.','Age check'=>'Duba shekaru','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Sanya wannan tubali a kowane shafi da yake buƙatarsa, ko a ɓangaren samfurin kanun shafinku don ya shafi dukan rukunin yanar gizon.','Minimum age'=>'Mafi ƙarancin shekaru','Ask for'=>'Nema','A yes or no answer'=>'Amsar eh ko a\'a','The date of birth'=>'Ranar haihuwa','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Tuna amsar na tsawon (kwanaki)','Texts'=>'Rubututtuka','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Bar rubutu a fanko don amfani da wanda aka saba amfani da shi. Ana maye gurbin {age} da ƙarancin shekaru.','Question'=>'Tambaya','When the visitor is too young'=>'Lokacin da baƙon ya yi ƙanƙanta da yawa','Countries'=>'Ƙasashe','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Wani ƙaramin shekarun daban na baƙi daga wata ƙasa, ko kuma 0 don rufe rukunin yanar gizon a gare ta. Ƙasar tana fitowa ne daga mai masaukin ku ko CDN (misali Cloudflare); inda ba a sani ba, mafi ƙarancin shekarun da ke sama yana aiki. Dole ne ma\'ajiyar shafi (cache) ta ajiye kwafi ɗaya a kowace ƙasa domin waɗannan ƙa\'idodin su yi aiki a kan shafukan da aka ajiye.','Add a country'=>'Ƙara ƙasa','Country code (two letters)'=>'Lambar ƙasa (haruffa biyu)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Misali US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Mafi ƙarancin shekaru (0: a rufe)','Age gate'=>'Kariyar shekaru','The age question shows here.'=>'Tambayar shekaru tana bayyana a nan.','Changing words'=>'Sauya kalmomi','Word'=>'Kalma','Add a word'=>'Ƙara kalma','Animated headline'=>'Taken labari mai motsi','Text before'=>'Rubutu na gaba','Text after'=>'Rubutu bayan','Effect'=>'Tasiri','Fade'=>'Dusashe','Slide up'=>'Zame zuwa sama','Typing'=>'Ana rubutawa','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Lokaci a kowace kalma (millisecond)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara kalmomin da ke canzawa a cikin saitunan bəlolin.','Typewriter'=>'Injin buga rubutu','Words fade in'=>'Kalmomi na bayyana a hankali','Words rise in'=>'Kalmomi suna ƙaruwa a','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Yana kunnawa sau ɗaya, lokacin da rubutun ya bayyana a yayin lilo. Maziyartan da suka buƙaci na\'urarsu ta rage motsi za su ga rubutun a tsaye.','Speed'=>'Gudun','Slow'=>'A hankali','Normal'=>'Na al\'ada','Fast'=>'Mai sauri','Write the text to animate…'=>'Rubuta rubutun da za a motsa…','Audio player'=>'Na\'urar kunna sauti','Show or album name'=>'Sunan shiri ko kundin waƙa','Replace artwork'=>'Sauya zane','Choose artwork'=>'Zaɓi zane','Add an episode'=>'Ƙara wani shiri','Choose audio file'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin sauti','Replace audio file'=>'Sauya fayil ɗin sauti','or its address'=>'ko adireshinsa','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara zangori a cikin labaran gefe.','Author box'=>'Akwatin marubuci','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Girmar hoto (pikisal)','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Hanyar haɗi zuwa rubutukan marubucin','Link to their website'=>'Haɗa zuwa shafinsu na yanar gizo','Name as'=>'Sanya suna a matsayin','Heading 2'=>'Kanni na 2','Heading 3'=>'Kanta 3','Heading 4'=>'Kanta 4','Paragraph'=>'Safi','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Marubucin rubutun yana nunawa a nan.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Masu karanta allon na karanta shi, kuma ana nunawa lokacin da "Nuna lakabi" ke kunne.','Show label'=>'Nuna lakabi','Corner'=>'Kusurwa','End (right in English)'=>'Karshe (dama a Turanci)','Start (left in English)'=>'Fara (an bar shi a Turanci)','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'Bayyana bayan gungurawa (pikisal)','Before: alternative text'=>'Kafin: madadin rubutu','Before: label'=>'Kafin: lakabi','After: alternative text'=>'Bayan: madadin rubutu','After: label'=>'Bayan: lakabi','Slider'=>'Silaida','Starting position (%)'=>'Matsayin farawa (%)','Before and after'=>'Kafin da bayan','Choose the two images in the block 