rst visit'=>'Awanni bayan ziyarar farko','Text above'=>'Rubutun da ke sama','Text once it has ended'=>'Rubutu da zarar ya ƙare','Show seconds'=>'Nuna daƙiƙoƙi','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'Zaɓi kwanan wata da lokacin da yake ƙidaya zuwa gare shi.','Counter'=>'Kanta','Count to'=>'Ƙidaya zuwa','Count from'=>'Ƙidaya daga','Decimal places'=>'Gidajen ƙididdiga','Before the number'=>'Kafin lambar','For example "$".'=>'Misali "$".','After the number'=>'Bayan lambar','For example "+" or "%".'=>'Misali "+" ko "%" ko.','Thousands separator'=>'Mai raba dubbai','Counting time (milliseconds)'=>'Lokacin ƙidaya (millisecond)','Set the number to count to.'=>'Saita lambar da za a ƙidaya zuwa gare ta.','Coupon code'=>'Lambar rangwame','Expires'=>'Yana ƙarewa','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'Kamar yadda kuke son a nuna shi, misali "31 Disamba".','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'Shigar da lambar a cikin saitunan shingen.','Prices'=>'Farashoshi','Show as'=>'Nuna a matsayin','Scrolling ticker'=>'Kasetin rubutu mai gungurawa','Cards'=>'Katunan','Price chart (one coin)'=>'Jadawalin farashi (tsabar kuɗi ɗaya)','Period'=>'Lokaci','24 hours'=>'Awanni 24','7 days'=>'Kwanaki 7','30 days'=>'Kwanaki 30','90 days'=>'Kwanaki 90','Currency'=>'Kudin kasa','Coins'=>'Tsabar kudi','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'Farashin yana fitowa daga CoinGecko kuma ana ajiye shi a dandalinku na ƴan mintuna, domin baƙi ba za su taɓa jira ba.','Crypto prices'=>'Farashin crypto','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'Zaɓi tsabar kudi a gefen shafi.','Cursor effect'=>'Tasirin kursor','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Zobe yana bin manuni','A soft spotlight'=>'Haske mai laushi','A trail of dots'=>'Layin ɗigo-ɗigo','Where'=>'Inda','Over this section'=>'A kan wannan sashe','Over the whole page'=>'A duk fadin shafin','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Ainihin manunin koyaushe yana nan. Tasirin yana a kashe a allon taɓawa da kuma ga baƙin da suka nemi na\'urarsu ta rage motsi.','Switch'=>'Sauya','Number'=>'Lamba','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Wannan ba shi da layuka a ƙarƙashin layinsa na farko. Ana amfani da layin farko don sunayen shafi.','Import a CSV file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin CSV','Or paste CSV'=>'Ko liƙa CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'An raba ta da waƙafi, semicolon ko shafin tab. Layi na farko yana ɗauke da sunayen ginshiƙai. Shigarwa yana maye gurbin teburin.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Shigar da CSV da aka manna','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'Yana bayyana abin da teburin ke nunawa. Masu karanta allon suna sanar da shi koda kuwa babu komai a kan allon.','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'Baƙi za su iya yin jeri bisa shafi','Show a search field'=>'Nuna filin bincike','First column names each row'=>'Rukunin farko yana sanya wa kowane layi suna','Sort “%s” as'=>'Jera “%s” a matsayin','Remove column'=>'Cire shafi','Import CSV'=>'Shigar da CSV','On a narrow screen'=>'A kan ƙaramin allo','Each row becomes a card'=>'Kowane jafi yana zama kati','The table scrolls sideways'=>'Teburin yana gungurawa a gefe','Striped rows'=>'Layuka masu ratsi','Import a spreadsheet as CSV, paste one, or start with an empty table.'=>'Shigar da maƙunsar bayanai a matsayin CSV, liƙa ɗaya, ko fara da tebur mara komai.','Start with an empty table'=>'Fara da tebur mara komai','Name of column %d'=>'Sunan shafi %d','Row %1$d, %2$s'=>'Layi %1$d, %2$s','Remove row %d'=>'Cire layin %d','Events'=>'Abubuwan da suka faru','Add an event'=>'Ƙara wani al\'amari','Starts'=>'Yana Farawa','In the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'A yankin lokaci na shafin (Saituna › Na kowa).','Ends (optional)'=>'Yana ƙarewa (na zaɓi)','Web address (optional)'=>'Adireshin yanar gizo (na zaɓi)','Tickets or details. The title links to it.'=>'Tikiti ko cikakkun bayanai. Taken yana haɗi zuwa gare shi.','All day'=>'Duk yini','A list'=>'Jeri','A month calendar'=>'Kalandar wata','Keep past events'=>'Ajiye abubuwan da suka gabata','Off: an event leaves the page once it has ended.'=>'A kashe: taron yana barin shafin da zarar ya ƙare.','Add the first event in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara taron farko a gefen shafi.','Front'=>'Gaba','Button link'=>'Mahadar maballin','Flip box'=>'Akwatin juyawa','Flip'=>'Juya','Write the front and the back in the block settings.'=>'Rubuta gaba da baya a cikin saitunan shingen.','Loading lists…'=>'Ana loda jerori…','Choose a list'=>'Zaɓi jeri','Your name'=>'Sunanka','Form name'=>'Sunan fom','Shown in the email subject and the submissions list.'=>'Ana nunawa a cikin batun imel da jerin abubuwan da aka ƙaddamar.','Message after sending'=>'Sakon bayan aikawa','Go to this page after sending (optional)'=>'Je zuwa wannan shafi bayan aikawa (na zaɓi)','Conversion event (optional)'=>'Lamarin canji (na zaɓi)','Sent to Google Analytics, Tag Manager and the Meta Pixel when the form is sent. Leave empty for the default (generate_lead).'=>'Ana aikawa zuwa Google Analytics, Tag Manager da kuma Meta Pixel lokacin da aka aika fom ɗin. Bar shi a sarari don tsohuwar ƙimar (generate_lead).','After sending'=>'Bayan aikawa','Email the submission'=>'Aika da ƙaddamarwar ta imel','Send to'=>'Aika zuwa','One or more addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site administrator.'=>'Adireshi ɗaya ko fiye, an raba su da waƙafi. Idan babu komai: mai gudanar da rukunin yanar gizo.','Save submissions on this site'=>'Ajiye abubuwan da aka ƙaddamar a wannan rukunin yanar gizo','Listed under Page Builder Sandwich → Form submissions, with a CSV export.'=>'An jera a ƙarƙashin Page Builder Sandwich → Form submissions, tare da fitarwa ta CSV.','Send each submission to a webhook address'=>'Aika kowace gabatarwa zuwa adireshin webhook','Webhook address (https)'=>'Adireshin Webhook (https)','Add to a mailing list'=>'Ƙara zuwa jerin aika saƙo','Connect Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit or ActiveCampaign first.'=>'Haɗa Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit ko ActiveCampaign da farko.','Marketing settings'=>'Saitunan tallatawa','Choose a service'=>'Zaɓi sabis','The visitor is added with the first email field of the form (and a field named "name", if there is one).'=>'Ana ƙara maziyarsin tare da filin imel na farko na fom ɗin (da kuma filin da ake kira "name", idan akwai ɗaya).','Form id: %s'=>'ID na fomu: %s','Web address'=>'Adireshin yanar gizo','Message (several lines)'=>'Sako (layuka da yawa)','Drop-down'=>'Zaɓe mai faɗo ƙasa','Choose one'=>'Zaɓi ɗaya','Choose several'=>'Zaɓi da yawa','Consent tick box'=>'Akwatin alamar yarda','File upload'=>'Loda fayil','Hidden value'=>'Ƙimar da ke ɓoye','is'=>'ne','is not'=>'ba haka ba ne','contains'=>'ya ƙunshi','is filled in'=>'an cika','is empty'=>'babu komai','Hidden:'=>'Boyayye:','Field'=>'Filin bayani','Field name'=>'Sunan fili','Used in emails, exports and webhooks. Letters, digits and underscores.'=>'Ana amfani da shi a cikin imel, fitarwa da kuma webhooks. Haruffa, lambobi da alamun ƙasa.','Help text'=>'Rubutun taimako','Width'=>'Fadi','Half width'=>'Rabin faɗi','Placeholder'=>'Wurin ajiye rubutu','Choices'=>'Zaɓuɓɓuka','One per line.'=>'Daya a kowane layi.','Default value'=>'Ƙimar asali','Accepted files'=>'Fayilolin da aka karɓa','Largest file (MB)'=>'Fayil mafi girma (MB)','Show this field only if…'=>'Nuna wannan filin kawai idan…','Another field'=>'Wani filin','Always show'=>'Nuna ko da yaushe','Condition'=>'Sharadi','Choose an option'=>'Zaɓi wani zaɓi','Choose any'=>'Zaɓi kowane','I agree to the privacy policy'=>'Na yarda da manufar sirri','Attachment'=>'Gididdiba','Source'=>'Tushe','Option 1'=>'Zaɓi na 1','Option 2'=>'Zaɓi na 2','Step title'=>'Taken mataki','Gallery'=>'Rumbun hotuna','Masonry'=>'Ginin bulo','Justified rows'=>'Layin da aka dai