 ɗin motsi','— Choose —'=>'— Zaɓa —','Upload a Lottie file (.json)'=>'Loda fayil ɗin Lottie (.json)','Playback'=>'Kunnawa','What the animation shows, for people who cannot see it.'=>'Abin da raye-rayen ke nunawa, ga mutanen da ba za su iya ganinsa ba.','Play'=>'Kunna','When it scrolls into view'=>'Lokacin da ya shigo cikin gani yayin lilo','As soon as the page loads'=>'Da zaran shafin ya gama lodawa','While the pointer is over it'=>'Yayin da alamar take kanta','Loop'=>'Zagaye','Marquee'=>'Rubutun Gungurawa','Moves'=>'Motsawa','Towards the start of a line'=>'Zuwa farkon layi','Towards the end of a line'=>'Kusa da ƙarshen layi','Between items'=>'Tsakanin abubuwa','Nothing'=>'Ba komai','Name read out by screen readers'=>'Sunan da mai karanta allon kwamfuta zai karanta','Visitors get a pause button, and it stops while they point at it. It stays still for visitors who ask for less motion.'=>'Masu ziyara suna samun maɓallin tsayawa na ɗan lokaci, kuma yana tsayawa yayin da suke nuna shi. Yana tsayawa cak ga masu ziyara waɗanda suka buƙaci rage motsi.','Item %d'=>'Abu na %d','Remove item %d'=>'Cire abu na %d','Add item'=>'Ƙara abu','Mega menu'=>'Babban menu','Show under'=>'Nuna a ƙarƙashin','The top-level menu item that opens this panel.'=>'Abun menu na babban mataki wanda ke buɗe wannan shafi.','Choose an item…'=>'Zaɓi wani abu…','As wide as its content'=>'Kamar faɗin abun cikinsa','As wide as the menu bar'=>'Kamar faɗin mashigin menu','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Babban menu don "%s"','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Mega menu: zaɓi abin menu nasa a gefen mashaya.','Mini cart'=>'Ƙaramin kwando','Activate WooCommerce to show the cart.'=>'Kunna WooCommerce don nuna kwandon sayayya.','Phones'=>'Wayoyi','Accordion on phones'=>'Akordiyon a wayoyin salula','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'A kan ƙananan fuska kowace shafin yanar gizo na zama wani yanki da ke buɗewa da rufewa da kansa.','3D model'=>'Samfurin 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Zaɓi samfuri (GLB ko glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Bayanin martaba (wajibi ne)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Abin da samfurin yake nunawa: abin da mai karanta allon yake sanarwa ne.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Hoton fasta da ake nunawa yayin da yake lodawa','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Juya a hankali da kansa','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Bayar da zaɓin "duba a sararinka" (AR) a wayoyin hannu','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Zaɓi samfurin 3D a cikin labarun gefe.','Choose a menu…'=>'Zaɓi menu…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Mutanen da za su iya gyara mazaɓun shafin ne kaɗai za su iya zaɓar ɗaya a nan.','Navigation menu'=>'Kayan kewayawa','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Zaɓi menu na WordPress ɗin da za a nuna.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da wani menu tukuna. Ƙirƙiri ɗaya, sannan zaɓe shi a nan.','Edit menus'=>'Gyara menus','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Yana gaya wa masu amfani da mai karanta allo ko wane menu ne wannan, misali "Babba" ko "Kasan shafi".','Direction'=>'Hanya','In a row'=>'A jere','In a column'=>'A cikin shafi','Mobile menu button'=>'Maballin mazaɓar wayar hannu','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'Ƙasa da wannan faɗi, menu ɗin yana naɗewa ya zama maɓallin da ke buɗe shi a saman shafin.','On phones'=>'A wayoyi','On phones and tablets'=>'A wayoyi da kwamfutocin hannu','Always'=>'Koyaushe','Never'=>'Kada','Open submenus'=>'Bude ƙananan menyu','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Idan aka danna kibiyar','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'Idan an matsa linzamin kwamfuta a kai, ko idan an danna kibiyar','Mega menus'=>'Kundayyuka masu faɗi','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'Wani mega menu yana nuna kowane tubalan a ƙarƙashin babban abu, maimakon ƙaramin menu nasa. Ƙara wani panel a ƙarƙashin menu kuma zaɓi abunsa.','“%s” has a mega menu.'=>'"%s" yana da babban mazaɓi (mega menu).','Add a mega menu panel'=>'Ƙara rukunin babban mazaɓi','Saved.'=>'An ajiye.','Mailchimp API key'=>'Makullin API na Mailchimp','A key ending in %s is saved for the whole site.'=>'Wani kī da ke ƙarewa da %s an ajiye shi don dukan rukunin yanar gizon.','No key is saved yet: the form will not appear on the page until one is.'=>'Ba a ajiye wani mabuɗi ba tukuna: fom ɗin ba zai bayyana a shafin ba har sai an ajiye ɗaya.','New key'=>'Sabuwar kisa','Save key'=>'Ajiye makulli','Remove key'=>'Cire kewayi','Only an administrator can change it.'=>'Mai gudanarwa ne kawai zai iya canza shi.','Send signups to'=>'Aika masu yin rajista zuwa','List ID'=>'ID na Jeri','MailPoet: the list number. Mailchimp: the audience ID. AWeber: the list name.'=>'MailPoet: lambar jeri. Mailchimp: ID ɗin masu sauraro. AWeber: sunan jeri.','Wording'=>'Kalaman bayani','Consent box'=>'Akwatin amincewa','Visitors must tick it to subscribe. Say what they will receive.'=>'Dole ne baƙi su yi alama a kai domin yin rajista. Bayyana abin da za su karɓa.','Message after signing up'=>'Sakon bayan yin rajista','Stacked'=>'An tara','Address and button on one line'=>'Adireshi da maɓalli a layi ɗaya','Newsletter signup'=>'Yin rajistar wasiƙar labarai','Choose the service and enter the list ID (and, for Mailchimp, the API key) in the block settings.'=>'Zaɓi sabis ɗin kuma shigar da ID na lissafin (sannan, don Mailchimp, maɓallin API) a cikin saitunan babban toshe.','Offer'=>'Tayi','Logo and link'=>'Tambari da hanyar haɗi','Under a heading of its own, choose the next level down.'=>'A ƙarƙashin kanun kansa, zaɓi matakin na gaba da ke ƙasa.','Age notice'=>'Sanarwar shekaru','Offer card'=>'Katin tayi','Give the offer a name in the sidebar.'=>'Sanya wa tayin suna a gefen shafi.','People'=>'Mutane','Add a person'=>'Ƙara mutum','Role'=>'Matsayi','Add a photo'=>'Ƙara hoto','Reports to'=>'Yana kai rahoto zuwa ga','Nobody (top of the chart)'=>'Ba kowa (saman taswira)','Add the first person in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara mutum na farko a cikin mashigin gefe.','Parallax image'=>'Hoton parallax','Describe the image; leave empty if it is only decoration.'=>'Bayyana hoton; bar shi a wofi idan na ado ne kawai.','Movement'=>'Motsi','Subtle'=>'Sauƙi','Strong'=>'Mai ƙarfi','Particles'=>'Ƙwayoyin halitta','How many'=>'Guda nawa','A few'=>'Kadan','Some'=>'Wasu','Many'=>'Da yawa','Join nearby dots with lines'=>'Haɗa ɗigogi na kusa da layi','The dots stop when the section is off screen, and stay still for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Digo-digon suna tsayawa lokacin da sashin baya kan allon, kuma suna kasancewa a tsaye ga maziyartan da suka buƙaci na\'urarsu ta rage motsi.','Dots'=>'Digo-digo','Dot colour (empty: the text colour)'=>'Launin digo (babu komai: launin rubutun)','PDF'=>'PDF','Replace PDF'=>'Sauya PDF','Choose a PDF'=>'Zaɓi PDF','Choose a PDF in the sidebar.'=>'Zaɓi PDF a gefen shafi.','Carousel'=>'Karusel','Buttons above the cards show one category at a time — a filterable portfolio.'=>'Maballan da ke saman katunan suna nuna rukuni ɗaya a lokaci guda — tarin ayyuka da za a iya tacewa.','More items'=>'Karin abubuwa','Page numbers'=>'Lambobin shafi','"Load more" button'=>'Maballin "Loda ƙari"','Card titles are'=>'Sunayen kati sun kasance','Post carousel'=>'Gidan juyar da rubuce-rubuce','Your latest posts as a carousel of cards.'=>'Sababbin rubuce-rubucenku a matsayin jeri mai juyawa na katuna.','Masonry posts'=>'Rubuce-rubucen masonry','Cards of different heights, packed into columns.'=>'Katinan da ke da tsayi daban-daban, an jera su a cikin ginshiƙai.','Filterable portfolio'=>'Fayil ɗin aiki mai tace-tace','Cards with category buttons that filter them.'=>'Katinan da ke da maballan rukunoni masu tace su.','Items'=>'Abubuwa','Add an item'=>'Ƙara abu','Price list'=>'Jerin farashi','Add an item in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara abu a cikin saitunan shinge.','Plans'=>'Tsarre-tsarre','Add a plan'=>'Ƙara tsari','Plan name'=>'Sunan tsari','A figure such as 19 or 19.99, or a word such as Free.'=>'Lamba kamar 19 ko 19.99, ko kalma kamar Kyauta.','After the price'=>'Bayan farashin','For example "/ month". Left empty, the billing period is used.'=>'Misali "/ wata". Idan aka bar shi babu komai, za a yi amfani da lokacin biyan kuɗi.','Yearly price'=>'Farashin shekara','Shown when the visitor switches to yearly billing.'=>'Ana nunawa a lokacin da mai ziyara ya canza zuwa biyan kuɗi na shekara-shekara.','After the yearly price'=>'Bayan farashin shekara','Add a feature'=>'Ƙara fasali','Open the link in a new tab'=>'Bude mahadar a sabon shafi','Highlight this plan'=>'Haskaka wannan tsari','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Gajeriyar lakabi a saman shirin, kamar "Mafi shahara".','Pricing table'=>'Teburin farashi','Currency symbol'=>'Alamar kuɗi','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Sauyawar kowane wata / kowace shekara','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Yana nuna maballin canzawa lokacin da aƙalla tsari ɗaya yake da farashin shekara.','Monthly button text'=>'Rubutun maɓallin kowane wata','Yearly button text'=>'Rubutun maɓallin shekara-shekara','Yearly saving'=>'Tattalin kuɗi na shekara','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Misali "Ajiye 20%".','Add a plan in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara tsari a cikin saitunan shinge.','Add to cart'=>'Ƙara a kwando','SKU and categories'=>'SKU da rukunoni','Tabs'=>'Shafuka','Related products'=>'Kayayyaki masu dangantaka','Upsells'=>'Karin tallace-tallace','Sale badge'=>'Alamar rangwame','Stock'=>'Kayan haja','The product being viewed (or the loop’s)'=>'Kayan da ake kallo a yanzu (ko na madaukin)','Which product'=>'Wane samfuri','Automatic (H1 on the product page)'=>'Na atomatik (H1 a shafin samfur)','Product element'=>'Sashen samfur','Choose a product, or use this block in a