Yi amfani da jeri na shafin kansa (rumbun ajiya, bincike)','For archive and search templates: list what the visitor is browsing.'=>'Don shafukan rumbun adana bayanai da bincike: lissafa abin da mai ziyara yake lilo.','Only with this custom field (key)'=>'Kawai tare da wannan fanni na musamman (mabudi)','Compared'=>'An kwatanta','Leave out the post being viewed'=>'Cire rubutun da ake kallo a yanzu','Hide empty ones'=>'Ɓoye marasa komai','Field plugin'=>'Fulogin filin','Each row, image or related post becomes a card. In the card, bind blocks to “Custom field” with the field plugin “This row”.'=>'Kowane layi, hoto ko rubutun da ke da alaƙa yana zama kati. A cikin katin, haɗa tubalan zuwa "Custom field" tare da manhajar fili mai suna "This row".','Field key to sort by'=>'Mabuɗin fanni don tsarawa ta hanyarsa','Order'=>'Oda','Descending'=>'Sauka','Ascending'=>'Hawa','Items per page'=>'Abubuwa a kowane shafi','Layout and pages'=>'Tsari da shafuka','One page only'=>'Shafi ɗaya kawai','Previous and next'=>'Na baya da na gaba','Message when nothing matches'=>'Saƙo idan babu abin da ya dace','Filters for visitors'=>'Matatun baƙi','Filters go'=>'Tace tafi','Above the list'=>'Sama da jerin','Beside the list'=>'Kusa da lissafin','Filter without reloading the page'=>'Tace ba tare da sake loda shafin ba','Designing the card: %d item matches on the first page.'=>'Zana katin: abu %d ya dace a shafi na farko.' . "\0" . 'Tsara katin: abubuwa %d sun yi daidai a shafi na farko.','Optional, for example “Reading time:”.'=>'Na zaɓi ne, misali “Lokacin karatu:”.','Format'=>'Tsari','5 minutes read'=>'Karatun minti 5','5 min read'=>'Karatun minti 5','Reading speed (words a minute)'=>'Saurin karatu (kalmomi a minti daya)','How long the post takes to read shows here.'=>'Tsawon lokacin da rubutun zai ɗauka kafin a karanta shi yana bayyana a nan.','Score'=>'Maki','Overall score'=>'Jimillar maki','Verdict'=>'Hukunci','Criteria'=>'Ka\'idoji','Add a criterion'=>'Ƙara ƙa\'ida','Criterion'=>'Kariyar aiki','Set the score in the sidebar.'=>'Saita maki a laben gefe.','Reviews'=>'Bita-bita','Google and Trustpilot'=>'Google da Trustpilot','Lowest rating shown'=>'Mafi ƙarancin ƙima da aka nuna','Only 5-star reviews.'=>'Sharhohi masu tauraro 5 kawai.','Reviews below this are not shown.'=>'Ba a nuna bita da ke ƙasa da wannan ba.','Newest first'=>'Mafi sabo a farko','Best first'=>'Mafi kyau da farko','Show the date'=>'Nuna kwanan wata','Show the overall rating under them'=>'Nuna jimillar kima a ƙasansu','Google and Trustpilot details (Site design › Reviews)'=>'Bayanin Google da Trustpilot (Tsarin rukunin yanar gizo › Sharhi)','A grid of cards'=>'Jadawalin katuna','A slider'=>'Wani silayida','A badge: the overall rating'=>'Lambar yabo: ƙimar gaba ɗaya','Notice'=>'Sanarwa','Help link'=>'Hanyar taimako','Show the age badge'=>'Nuna tambarin shekaru','Link the national help service'=>'Haɗa sabis ɗin taimako na ƙasa','For visitors from the UK, the US, Australia, Germany, France and Sweden, link that country’s help service. Check them against your licence, and add other countries below.'=>'Ga baƙi daga Birtaniya, US, Ostiraliya, Jamus, Faransa da Sweden, haɗa sabis ɗin taimako na ƙasar. Bincika su bisa lasisin ku, sannan ku ƙara wasu ƙasashe a ƙasa.','Responsible gambling notice'=>'Sanarwar caca mai ma\'ana','The notice shows here.'=>'Sanarwar tana bayyana a nan.','For example “Q3 2026” or “Spring”.'=>'Misali “Q3 2026” ko “Bazara”.','A board: planned, in progress, done'=>'Allon aiki: wanda aka tsara, yana kan gudana, an kammala','One list, each item with its status'=>'Jeri ɗaya, kowane abu tare da matsayinsa','Column heading level'=>'Matakin kanun ginshiƙi','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara abu na farko a cikin labarun gefe.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Masu karanta allon kwamfuta suna ci gaba da karanta alamun da aka ɓoye.','Icon instead of button text'=>'Gunkin maimakon rubutun maɓalli','Search in'=>'Bincika a','The whole website'=>'Duk gidan yanar gizon','Device share menu'=>'Menu na raba na\'ura','Share to'=>'Raba zuwa','Share bar'=>'Gurin raba abu','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Misali "Raba". Idan aka bar shi babu komai, ba za a nuna lakabi ba.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Yana yawo a gefe (manyan fuska)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Maballan za su bayyana da zarar shafin ya sami adireshi (ajiye shi a matsayin daftarin aiki).','Networks'=>'Hanyoyin sadarwa','Device share button'=>'Maɓallin raba na\'ura','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Wayoyi da wasu manhajojin bincike suna ba da taswirar raba bayanai ta kansu; maɓallin yana bayyana ne kawai a inda akwai ɗaya.','Look'=>'Duba','Show network names'=>'Nuna sunayen hanyar sadarwa','Rounded'=>'Mai kewayawa','Circle'=>'Da\'ira','Edit images (%d)'=>'Gyara hotuna (%d)','Choose images'=>'Zaɓi hotuna','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','Only these categories'=>'Wadannan rukunoni kawai','None chosen: every category.'=>'Ba a zaɓi ko ɗaya ba: kowane rukunoni.','Oldest first'=>'Tsoffi da farko','Title, A to Z'=>'Take, A zuwa Z','Recently updated'=>'Wanda aka sabunta kwanan nan','Custom order'=>'Tsari na musamman','Summary'=>'Takaitaccen bayani','Price (products)'=>'Farashi (kayayyaki)','Card'=>'Kati','Previous and next buttons'=>'Maballan baya da na gaba','Start again after the last'=>'Sake farawa bayan na ƙarshe','Play automatically'=>'Kunna da kansa','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Ba a taɓa yi wa maziyartan da suka fi son ƙarancin motsi ba; yana ɗan tsayawa yayin da aka karkata linzamin kwamfuta a kansa ko aka maida hankali a kansa, kuma yana da maɓallin Tsayawa.','Seconds per slide'=>'Daƙiƙa a kowane zamiya','Move up'=>'Matsar zuwa sama','Move down'=>'Matsar da ƙasa','Remove column %s'=>'Cire shafi %s','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Layi na farko ya ƙunshi sunayen ginshiƙai. Shigo da kaya yana maye gurbin abin da ke nan.','Remove image'=>'Cire hoton','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Zaɓi matakin da ya dace da tsarin shafin.','Replace photo'=>'Sauya hoto','Move %s up'=>'Matsar da %s sama','Move %s down'=>'Matsar da %s ƙasa','Duplicate %s'=>'Kwafi %s','Remove %s'=>'Cire %s','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Kima (0 zuwa 5)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Abubuwan da aka fi gani, ɗaya a kowace layi','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Na zaɓi ne, misali “Wanda aka fi so”.','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Sharudda (da aka nuna tare da tayin)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=>'Sharuɗɗa masu mahimmanci waɗanda lasisinku ke buƙata kusa da tayin, misali sharaɗin caca.','Replace logo'=>'Sauya tambari','Choose logo'=>'Zaɓi tambari','Remove logo'=>'Cire tambari','Give the short link a name, and the offer a full address starting with https://.'=>'Ba wa gajeren hanyar suna, kuma ba wa tayin cikakken adireshi da ke farawa da https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana gajeren hanyar haɗin ba.','Offer address'=>'Adireshin tayi','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Hanyar haɗin gwiwarku ta talla. Hanyoyin haɗi zuwa tayi ana nuna su a matsayin tallafi koyaushe domin injunan bincike.','Go through a short link'=>'Bi ta gajeriyar hanyar haɗi','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Maziyarta suna ganin gajeren adireshi a rukunin yanar gizonku, kuma ana ƙidaya kowane dannawa a cikin Gajerun hanyoyin haɗi.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Masu ziyara za su ga %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Ko ƙirƙiri sabo, mai suna','spin-palace'=>'fadar juyawa','Create short link from the address'=>'Ƙirƙiri gajeren hanyar haɗi daga adireshin','The page’s own content (block or classic cart and checkout)'=>'Abin da ke cikin shafin da kansa (akwatin sayayya da biyan kuɗi na bulo ko na asali)','Cart (classic)'=>'Kekensaye (na gargajiya)','Checkout (classic)'=>'Biyan kuɗi (na gargajiya)','Order received details'=>'Cikakkun bayanan oda da aka karɓa','Shop page'=>'Shafin kantin sayarwa','Height before the button'=>'Tsayi kafin maballin','Button text when open'=>'Rubutun maballi idan a buɗe yake','Sticky'=>'Manne','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Yana tsayawa a saman allon yayin da baƙi ke gungurawa ƙasa.','Transparent'=>'Mai haske da ake iya gani ta ciki','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Yana kwanciya a kan sashe na farko na shafin, kuma yana ɗaukar launin bango na rukunin yanar gizon da zarar an gungura shafin. Ba wa sashe na farko isasshen fili a sama.','Slides come from'=>'Silaidon suna fitowa daga','Blocks I add'=>'Bulogin da na ƙara','Posts'=>'Rubuce-rubuce','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Kayan Sayarwa (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Zamewa','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (zuƙowa a hankali, hotuna)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Faifan da ke bayyane: na\'urar tebur','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Slaidi a gani: tablet','Slides in view: phone'=>'Slayid a gani: waya','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Abin da faifan nunin suke, misali "Labaran abokan ciniki".','Image slider'=>'Gidan zame hotuna','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Hotuna daga dakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai, daya bayan daya.','Post slider'=>'Gidan zamiya na rubuce-rubuce','Product slider'=>'Gidan zamiya na kaya','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Kayayyakin WooCommerce a matsayin carousel.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Nunin faifan Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Cikakkun hotuna masu faɗi tare da matsawa a hankali, suna dusashewa daga ɗaya zuwa na gaba.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Sanarwar tallace-tallace na baya-bayan nan — misali, wanda aka nuna kawai a cikin edita','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Sunan farko daga Gari ya sayi Samfur','2 hours ago'=>'Awoyi 2 da suka wuce','Orders'=>'Odo-odo','Orders from'=>'Odo-odo daga','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce da Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Sauƙaƙan Saukewar Dijital','Most recent orders to show'=>'Odayen kwanan nan da za a nuna','Oldest order (days)'=>'Oda mafi dadewa (kwanaki)','Name the product'=>'Sanya wa samfurin suna','Say how long ago'=>'Faɗi lokacin da ya wuce','Timing and place'=>'Lokaci da wuri','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Kowace sanarwa tana nunawa na tsawon (dakiku)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Dakatawa tsakanin sanarwa (sakanni)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Kasa, farkon karantawa','Bottom, reading end'=>'Kasa, ƙarshen karantawa','Where the notices come from'=>'Inda sanarwoyin suka fito','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'Odayan na gaske kuma aka biya kawai ake nunawa, kuma sai idan mai siye ya yi alamar amincewa a akwatin wurin biya wanda ke ba wannan rukunin yanar gizo damar nuna sunansa na farko da garinsa. Da zarar an ajiye wannan shafi, shafin biya zai bayar da wannan akwati. Har sai oda mai ɗauke da wannan ta zo, baƙi ba za su ga komai ba.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Nemo daidaitattun lambobin wuri daga adireshin','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'An samo. Duba alamar da ke kan taswira a shafin.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Ba a sami abin da ya dace ba. Gwada sunan titi, gari da lambar gidan waya, ko kuma ka rubuta lambobin daidaitawa.',