fosta','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara bidiyoyi a labarun gefe.','Name of the list'=>'Sunan jeri','Web address or text'=>'Adireshin yanar gizo ko rubutu','QR code'=>'Lambar QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Bayanin masu karanta allo','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'Bar shi a wofi don amfani da "Lambar QR don" da kuma rubutun.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Rubuta adireshin yanar gizo, hanyar haɗin waya (tel:) ko kowane rubutu.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Wannan ya yi tsayi da yawa ga lambar QR. Ka rage tsawonsa.','Add a caption'=>'Ƙara bayanin hoto','Reading progress bar'=>'Gmashin ci gaban karantawa','Edge of the window'=>'Bakin taga','Top'=>'Sama','Bottom'=>'Kasa','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Ana nunawa a ƙasan taga yayin da maziyarta ke lilo.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Ana nunawa a saman taga yayin da maziyarta ke lilo.','Related by'=>'Mai alaƙa ta hanyar','Categories or tags'=>'Rukunoni ko alamomin shafi','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Idan babu wani abu mai alaƙa, nuna na baya-bayan nan maimakon haka','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'Bar shi a wofi don "Labarai masu alaƙa".','Show the featured image'=>'Nuna hoton da aka fito da shi','Show a summary'=>'Nuna taƙaitaccen bayani','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Babu wasu rubututtuka da ke raba rukunoni ko alamomin wannan rubutu a yanzu. Lokacin da wasu suka yi, za su bayyana a nan.','Modal'=>'Tagar mai tashi','Off-canvas panel'=>'Fannin wajen allo','Slides in from'=>'Yana shigowa daga','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Farko shine ɓangaren da ake fara karatu: hagu a Turanci, dama a Larabci.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Rufe lokacin da aka danna shafin da ke baya','Title of the window'=>'Taken taga','Check mark'=>'Alamar duba','Cross'=>