Haskaka sashin da ake karantawa','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'Na zaɓi. Yana bayyana abin da shafukan shafin ke nufi, misali "Shirye-shirye".','Open on page load'=>'Bude yayin da shafi ke lodawa','Tabs down the side'=>'Shafuka a gefe','Add a tab'=>'Ƙara shafin','Testimonial'=>'Shaida','Choose photo'=>'Zaɓi hoto','Remove photo'=>'Cire hoto','Photo description'=>'Bayanin hoto','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Bar shi a wofi idan hoton kawai yana nuna mutumin da aka ambaci sunansa kusa da shi.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Kimanin tauraro (0 = babu)','Name under the quote'=>'Suna a ƙarƙashin ƙaulin','Photo beside the quote'=>'Hoto kusa da maganar','What the customer said…'=>'Abin da abokin ciniki ya ce…','Role or company'=>'Matsayi ko kamfani','Tooltip'=>'Bayanin taimako','Tooltip text'=>'Rubutun bayanin taimako','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Takaita shi: jimla ɗaya ko biyu. Masu karanta allon na\'ura suna karanta shi tare da kalmar da yake bayyanawa.','Show it'=>'Nuna shi','Above'=>'Sama','Below'=>'A ƙasa','Word or phrase'=>'Kalma ko jimla','Profile'=>'Bayanin martaba','Whose profile'=>'Bayanin martaba na wa','The post’s author'=>'Marubucin rubutun','Show the profile picture'=>'Nuna hoton martaba','Show the biography'=>'Nuna tarihin rayuwa','Show links to posts and website'=>'Nuna hanyoyin haɗi zuwa rubuce-rubuce da gidan yanar gizo','Author profile'=>'Bayanin marubuci','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Zaɓi bayanin martaba na wanda kake son nunawa.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Lambar WhatsApp, tare da lambar ƙasa','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Misali +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Saƙon da za a fara da shi (na zaɓi)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Nuna rubutun kusa da gunkin','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Karshen ƙasa (dama a Turanci)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Farkon ƙasa (hagu a Turanci)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Ƙara lambar WhatsApp ɗinku a cikin gefen shafi. Har sai lokacin ba za a nuna maɓallin a shafin ba.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'A shafin, wannan maballin yana yawo a wani lungu na ƙasan allon.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'An ajiye a dakin karatu na gajimare naku.','Save to cloud library'=>'Ajiye a dakin karatu na gajimare','Save to'=>'Ajiye a','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Ana sauya girman hotuna, a adana su sau ɗaya sannan a dawo da su cikin ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai na kowane shafi da ya saka wannan ƙira.','%s style'=>'Salon %s','Save style to cloud library'=>'Ajiye salo a dakin karatu na gajimare','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Zaɓi wani shinge da farko, sannan ka yi amfani da salon.','Library'=>'Dakin karatu','Save this page to the library'=>'Ajiye wannan shafi a dakin karatu','Insert'=>'Saka','Shortcode tag'=>'Tag ɗin shortcode','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Yi amfani da haruffa, lambobi, layuka da kuma alamomin ƙasa (underscores) kawai.','Attribute name'=>'Sunan sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ƙara sifa','Shortcode'=>'Gajeren kodi','Other attributes'=>'Sauran halaye','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Zaɓi alamar shortcode a cikin saitunan boko.','Image size'=>'Girmar hoto','Thumbnail'=>'Hoton samfoti','Full size'=>'Cikakken girma','Link to'=>'Haɗa zuwa','Attachment page'=>'Shafin abin da aka makala','Media file'=>'Fayil ɗin midiya','Audio'=>'Sauti','Video'=>'Bidiyo','File address'=>'Adireshin fayil','Poster image'=>'Hoton fosta','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'ID na kafofin watsa labarai, an raba su da waƙafi','Show the track list'=>'Nuna jerin waƙoƙi','Embed'=>'Saka','Address to embed'=>'Adireshin da za a saka','Maximum width'=>'Matsakaicin faɗi','Image and caption HTML'=>'HTML na hoto da bayanin hoto','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Shawara: Rukunin Form ɗin yana nuna wannan fom ɗin an tsara shi domin ya dace da rukunin yanar gizonku.','Show the form title'=>'Nuna taken fom','Show the form description'=>'Nuna bayanin fom ɗin','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Aika ba tare da sake loda shafin ba','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Sarrafa "%s" daga tsohon edita ba ya samuwa a cikin editan bulo. Shigar da ƙimar a matsayin rubutu.','Choose file'=>'Zaɓi fayil','— Default —'=>'— Na asali —','Advanced styling'=>'Tsarin salo na ci gaba','Inline CSS'=>'CSS na Ciki','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Bayanin sanarwa na CSS, misali: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Tasirin (tsofaffin aji)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Sunayen tasiri da aka raba da tazara waɗanda aka ɗauko daga tsofaffin juzu\'ai, misali: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Cikakken faɗi, an ajiye abun ciki a tsakiya','Link relationship'=>'Dangantakar mahada','Left'=>'Hagu','Right'=>'Dama','Add text…'=>'Ƙara rubutu…','Placement'=>'Wuri','On its own line'=>'A layin kansa','In the line, beside other content'=>'A cikin layin, kusa da sauran abun ciki','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Na atomatik (layin kansa a babban matakin shafin)','Accessible label'=>'Alamar mai sauƙin amfani','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Bar shi a wofi domin gunkin ado.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Zaɓi wani gunkin a cikin saitunan babban shingen.','New setting name'=>'Sabuwar sunan saiti','For example: title or text'=>'Misali: take ko rubutu','Add setting'=>'Ƙara saiti','Widget'=>'Wurin aiki','Choose a widget'=>'Zabi wani widget','Widget area'=>'Yankin widget','Choose a widget area'=>'Zaɓi yankin wijet','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Wannan hoton ba shi da faɗi da tsawo, don haka shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da yake lodi. Zaɓe shi daga Laburaren Kafofin Watsa Labarai, ko saita faɗinsa da tsawonsa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Wannan bidiyon ba daga Laburaren Kafofin Watsa Labarai yake ba, don haka ba a san girmansa ba kuma shafin zai yi tsalle yayin da yake lodawa. Maimakon haka, ɗora shi zuwa Laburaren Kafofin Watsa Labarai.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Wani hoto, bidiyo ko firam a cikin wannan HTML bashi da faɗi da tsawo, don haka shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da yake lodi. Ƙara siffofin faɗi da tsawo (width da height) a ciki.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Wannan abin da aka saka yana canza girmansa bayan ya gama lodi, wanda hakan ke matsar da abubuwan da ke ƙasa da shi. Ba shi sarari ko kuma ka sanya shi ƙasa-ƙasa a shafin.','Layout shift'=>'Sauyawar tsari','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Wannan widget ba ta bayyana saitunan ta ba, don haka ana gyara su a matsayin sunaye da kimomi a biye.','Problem'=>'Matsala','Check'=>'Duba','Show block'=>'Nuna shingen','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Yi amfani da kalar jigo mai sauƙin karantawa','Make it H%d'=>'Mayar da shi H%d','Alt text'=>'Bayanin hoto','Save alt text'=>'Ajiye rubutun madadin','This image is decorative'=>'Wannan hoton na ado ne','Checking…'=>'Ana dubawa…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Ba a sami matsalolin sauƙin amfani ba a wannan shafin.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'matsala %d' . "\0" . 'Matsaloli %d','%d thing to check'=>'Abin dubawa guda %d' . "\0" . 'Abubuwa %d da za a duba','Check again'=>'Sake dubawa','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Binciken atomatik yana gano matsaloli da yawa amma ba duka ba. Haka kuma ku gwada shafin da maballin rubutu kawai da kuma mai karanta allon.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Bambancin launi na rubutu shine %1$s:1; yana buƙatar aƙalla %2$s:1 don a iya karanta shi.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'danna nan,nan,karanta ƙari,ƙari,hanya,wannan hanyar,ƙara koyo,tafi','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Wata mahada ba ta da rubutu, don haka mai karanta allon yana cewa kawai "mahada". Ƙara rubutu ko alama.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Bayanin mahadar "%s" bai bayyana inda yake kaiwa ba. Maimakon haka, bayyana inda za a je.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Wani abu yana da tabbataccen tabindex, wanda ke canza tsarin madannai daga tsarin karantawa. Yi amfani da 0 ko cire shi.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Wani abu da za a iya dannawa ba za a iya isa gare shi da madannai ba. Yi amfani da maɓalli ko mahaɗi na ainihi.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Wani firam ɗin da aka saka ba shi da take, don haka mai karanta allon ba zai iya faɗin abin da yake ba.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Wani filin fom ba shi da lakabi, don haka ba a sanar da manufarsa ba.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Wannan kanun labarin ba kowa a ciki. Masu amfani da mai karanta allo suna kewaya ne ta hanyar kanun labarai; cire shi ko ƙara rubutu.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Taken shafin ya riga ya zama H1; yi amfani da H2 don babban matakin abun ciki.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'Wannan H%1$d ya tsallake mataki guda; wanda ke gabansa shine H%2$d. Mayar da shi H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Wannan hoton ba shi da rubutun alt. Bayyana shi, ko kuma ku nuna shi a matsayin na ado idan bai ƙara komai ba.','Close panel'=>'Rufe shafi','Desktop'=>'Kwamfuta ta tebur','Default'=>'Na asali','Every track'=>'Kowane waƙa','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Girman hanyoyi, misali: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Girmann tracks na musamman','Equal tracks'=>'Hanyoyi daidai','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Layi guda ɗaya mai alamar ƙauli a kowane layi, misali: "head head" "side main". Sanya wa yankin suna a kowane ɓangaren ɗa.','Automatic'=>'Na atomatik','Square (1:1)'=>'Murabba\'i (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Daidaitacce (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Na gargajiya (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Faɗi (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinima (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Dogo (9:16)','Custom'=>'Na musamman','Width / height'=>'Faɗi / tsawo','Background image'=>'Hoton bango','Inherited image — replace'=>'Hoton da aka gāda — musanya','Cover'=>'Murfi','Contain'=>'Ƙunsa','Original size'=>'Girmar asali','Repeat'=>'Maimaita','No repeat'=>'Babu maimaitawa','Tile'=>'Falele','Tile across'=>'Jeranta a kwance','Tile down'=>'Kasa a jere','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Kafaffen lokacin lilo','Solid'=>'Kwakwƙwara','Dashed'=>'Mai daddatsa','Dotted'=>'Mai ɗigo-ɗigo','Double'=>'Biyu','Each side separately'=>'Kowane ɓangare daban','Side'=>'Gefe','Add a shadow'=>'Ƙara inuwa','Horizontal'=>'A kwance','Vertical'=>'Tsaye','Blur'=>'Dushewa','Spread'=>'Yaɗa','Inside'=>'Ciki','Re