ika duk saiti','%d icons'=>'Gumaka %d','Loading icon sets…'=>'Ana loda rukunonin tambari…','%s icons'=>'Gumakan %s','All sets'=>'Duk saituna','This file is not a valid SVG image.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba ingantaccen hoton SVG ba ne.','The icon could not be uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda gunkin ba.','Upload SVG'=>'Loda SVG','Delete selected upload'=>'Goge abin da aka loda da aka zaɓa','Scripts, links and external references are removed from uploaded SVG files before they are saved.'=>'Ana cire rubutun tsare-tsare (scripts), mahada da kuma bayanan waje daga fayilolin SVG da aka loda kafin a ajiye su.','My uploads'=>'Abubuwan da na loda','Align items'=>'Daidaita abubuwa','Stretch'=>'Miƙa','Baseline'=>'Tushe','Align self'=>'Daidaita kanta','Auto'=>'Na atomatik','Aspect ratio'=>'Matsakaicin girma','Background colour'=>'Launin bango','Box shadow'=>'Inuwar akwati','Column span'=>'Faɗin shafi','Text colour'=>'Launin rubutu','Cursor'=>'Gursur','Pointer'=>'Manuni','Move'=>'Matsar','Grab'=>'Kama','Not allowed'=>'Ba a yarda ba','Crosshair'=>'Alamar Manuniya','Zoom in'=>'Faɗaɗa','Block'=>'Toshe','Inline'=>'Cikin layi','Inline block'=>'Kulle na layi','Inline flexbox'=>'Flexbox na layi','Inline grid'=>'Gidan ciki','Contents only'=>'Abubuwan ciki kawai','Hidden'=>'Boyayye','Basis'=>'Tushe','Row reversed'=>'An juya jeri','Column'=>'Rafi','Column reversed'=>'An juya jeri','Grow'=>'Haɓaka','Shrink'=>'Kankance','Wrap'=>'Nannade','No wrap'=>'Kada a nannade','Wrap reversed'=>'Nannade ta akasin','Font'=>'Nau\'in rubutu','Italic'=>'Karkatacce','Weight'=>'Nauyi','Thin (100)'=>'Siriri (100)','Extra light (200)'=>'Mai sauƙi sosai (200)','Light (300)'=>'Mai sauƙi (300)','Regular (400)'=>'Na Yau da Kullum (400)','Medium (500)'=>'Matsakaici (500)','Semi bold (600)'=>'Kauri matsakaici (600)','Bold (700)'=>'Kauri (700)','Extra bold (800)'=>'Kauri sosai (800)','Black (900)'=>'Baƙi (900)','Gap'=>'Tazara','Area name'=>'Sunan yanki','Named areas'=>'Yankunan da aka sanyawa suna','Offsets'=>'Tsare-tsaren nisa