n','Heart'=>'Zuciya','Arch'=>'Tsari','Brush stroke'=>'Shafe-shafen buroshi','Mask shape'=>'Siffar rufe fuska','Custom image'=>'Hoton da aka keɓance','Replace mask image'=>'Sauya hoton lulluɓi','Choose mask image'=>'Zaɓi hoton rufe fuska','Fit'=>'Dace','Repeat across'=>'Maimaita a fadin','Repeat down'=>'Maimaita ƙasa','Space out'=>'Bada tazarra','Stretch to fit'=>'Miƙe don ya dace','Multiply'=>'Riba','Screen'=>'Allon allo','Overlay'=>'Rufi','Darken'=>'Duhunta','Lighten'=>'Haskaka','Colour dodge'=>'Haskaka launi','Colour burn'=>'Kone launi','Hard light'=>'Haske mai ƙarfi','Soft light'=>'Haske mai laushi','Difference'=>'Bambanci','Exclusion'=>'Kawarwa','Hue'=>'Launi','Saturation'=>'Gamsuwa','Luminosity'=>'Haske','Blend mode'=>'Yanayin haɗawa','Blur (px)'=>'Dishewa (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Haske (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Bambancin launi (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Kalar toka-toka (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Juyawar launi (digiri)','Saturation (%)'=>'Gamsuwa (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Inuwar faduwa','Across (px)'=>'A kwance (px)','Down (px)'=>'Kasa (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Taushi (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Kalar inuwa','Remove drop shadow'=>'Cire inuwa','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Yana aiki a kowane girman allon allo.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Yana aiki ne ga girman allon da aka zaɓa a cikin ɓangaren zane.','Background gradient'=>'Gradiyent ɗin bango','Add gradient'=>'Ƙara launi mai canzawa','Glass'=>'Gilashi','Mask'=>'Rufe','Filters'=>'Matata','Wave'=>'Kalaman Kalaman','Waves'=>'Kalaman ruwa','Curve'=>'Lankwasa','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Lankwasa (ba daidai ba)','Arc'=>'Baka','Tilt'=>'Karkatar','Tilt (layered)'=>'Karkata (mai matakai)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Alwatika (marar daidaito)','Split'=>'Raba','Zigzag'=>'Karkatacce','Mountains'=>'Duwatsu','Clouds'=>'Gajimare','Drops'=>'Saukarwa','Pyramids'=>'Dala-dala','Book'=>'Yi Ajiyar Wuri','Stairs'=>'Matakala','Fan'=>'Fanka','Height (px)'=>'Tsawo (px)','Mirror'=>'Madubi','Invert'=>'Juya','In front of the content'=>'A gaban abun ciki','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Fayil ɗin bidiyo (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Zaɓi bidiyon MP4 ko WebM','MP4 address'=>'Adireshin MP4','WebM address'=>'Adireshi na WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'ID na bidiyon YouTube (haruffa 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Lambar bidiyon Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Masu ziyara suna tuntuɓar sabis ɗin bidiyo ne kawai lokacin da suka gungura zuwa wannan ɓangaren, kuma ba za su taɓa yi ba idan na\'urarsu ta nemi a rage motsi. Har sai lokacin za su ga hoton fosta.','Replace poster image'=>'Sauya hoton fosta','Choose poster image'=>'Zaɓi hoton fosta','Background slideshow'=>'Ganin faifai na baya','Change images'=>'Sauya hotuna','Choose at least two images.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla hotuna biyu.','Seconds per image'=>'Daƙiƙa a kowane hoto','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Zuƙowa a hankali (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Cire nunin faifai','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Maziyarta da suka buƙaci na\'urarsu ta rage motsi za su ga hoton farko kawai.','Section effects'=>'Tasirin sashe','Top divider'=>'Mai raba sama','Bottom divider'=>'Mai raba kasa','Choose the logo'=>'Zaɓi tambarin','Not set'=>'Ba a saita ba','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Duba launukan alama: kowanne yana buƙatar suna na musamman da ingantaccen launi.','Brand name'=>'Sunan alama','A logo is chosen.'=>'An zaɓi tambari.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Zaɓi tambarin daga shafin Tsarin shafi.','Brand colours'=>'Launukan alama','Brand %d'=>'Alama %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ƙara launin alama','Heading font'=>'Font ɗin kan magana','Body font'=>'Font ɗin jiki','Tone of voice'=>'Sautin murya','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Yadda alamar kasuwancinku ke rubutu, misali "Mai abokantaka da sauƙi, gajerun jimloli, babu kalmomin ƙwarewa." AI tana bin sa a duk lokacin da take rubutu don wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Brand kit saved.'=>'An ajiye kayan alama.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'An yi amfani da alamar: launukanta, rubutunta da tambarinta yanzu sun zama na rukunin yanar gizon.','Apply to site'=>'Aiwatar a shafi','All classes'=>'Duk azuzuwa','Class name on the page'=>'Sunan aji a shafin','Printed as %s.'=>'An buga a matsayin %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Fara da harafi; ƙananan haruffa, lambobi da alamomin ɗebe kaɗai.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Kula-kula da salo ba su loda ba. Sake loda shafin; idan wannan ya ci gaba, sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'An ajiye aji. Kowane kashi da ke amfani da shi yana da sabon salon.','Save class'=>'Ajiye aji','Class created.'=>'An ƙirƙiri aji.','New class'=>'Sabuwar aji','e.g. Card'=>'msl. Katin kuɗi','Create'=>'Ƙirƙira','Search classes'=>'Bincika azuzuwa','No class matches.'=>'Babu aji da ya dace.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Babu aji tukunna. Ƙirƙiri ɗaya, tsara shi, sannan ku ƙara shi a kowane sashe daga saitunansa.','Edit %s'=>'Gyara %s','Class duplicated.'=>'An kwafi aji.','Delete %s'=>'Goge %s','Class deleted.'=>'An share aji.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'A goge aji "%s"? Abubuwan da ke amfani da shi za su riƙe abubuwan da ke ciki kuma su rasa salon sa.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Masu amfani waɗanda za su iya ƙara HTML wanda ba a tace ba ne kawai za su iya sauya CSS na musamman.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Ba za a yi amfani da wasu daga cikin wannan CSS ba: ana cire @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" da kuma maƙallan da ba su daidaita ba domin tsaro.','Upload a font'=>'Loda rubutu','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Loda rubutu yana buƙatar WordPress 6.5 ko kuma na gaba.','Font name'=>'Sunan rubutu','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'misali Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'An ɗora %s kuma a shirye yake don amfani.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin rubutu (%s)','Font library'=>'Dakin karatu na rubutu','%d files'=>'fayiloli %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'An kashe salon rubutu don rukunin yanar gizon.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'An kunna rubutun don rukunin yanar gizon.','Switch off'=>'Kashe','Switch on'=>'Kunna','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Manna kit id na aikin yanar gizo na Adobe Fonts ɗinku. Daga nan za a loda rukunin haruffansa daga Adobe a kan shafukanku.','Your web projects'=>'Ayyukan yanar gizonku','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts ya haɗu.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'An cire haɗin Adobe Fonts.','Kit id'=>'ID ɗin kit','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Duhun ƙimar "%s" ba launi ba ne mai inganci.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Idan mai ziyara bai zaɓa ba','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Bi na\'urar mai ziyara','Dark colours'=>'Launuka masu duhu','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Ba kowane launi sigarsa mai duhu. Launukan da aka bari babu komai za su kasance iri ɗaya a duka tsare-tsaren biyu. Yanayin duhu yana aiki da zarar launi ɗaya yana da ƙimar duhu.','Dark version of %s'=>'Bambancin duhu na %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'An ajiye yanayin duhu.','Page CSS'=>'CSS na Shafi','Global classes'=>'Ajujuwan duniya','Classes'=>'Azuzuwa','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ƙirƙiri azuzuwa a Tsarin shafi, sannan ka ƙara su a nan.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS na Musamman','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Rubuta ƙa\'idoji don wannan ɓangaren. "selector" yana nufin wannan ɓangaren, misali selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — bayyanannun furucin suna aiki ne a kan ainihin ɓangaren kansa.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Fayilolin rubutu dole ne su zama %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin rubutun ba komai a ciki ko kuma ya fi 10 MB girma.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Kintsawa sau ɗaya, sake amfani a ko\'ina, sauyawa a wuri guda.','Variables'=>'Masu canzawa','Named values any element can use.'=>'Kimanoni masu suna waɗanda kowane abu zai iya amfani da su.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Tazara, kewayen kusurwa da inuwowi','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Sikulan da kowane mai ɗaukar tazarar sarari, kusurwa da inuwa ke bayarwa.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Wani nau\'i mai duhu na launukanku, don baƙin da suke so.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Tambari, launuka, rubutu da salon magana, waɗanda basirar wucin gadi da samfura ke amfani da su.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Loda rubutun ku na kanku ko kuma ku haɗa Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS na wannan shafi kawai.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS na wannan shafi','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Ana lodawa ne kawai a wannan shafin, bayan salon shafin yanar gizon. An adana tare da shafin.','Short name'=>'Gajeren suna','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Gajeren sunan "%s" an yi amfani da shi sau biyu.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": gajerun sunaye suna amfani da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi da alamomin ɗora.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Darajar "%s" ba ɗaya daga cikin waɗanda wannan saitin yake karɓa ba ne.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Ƙara mataki','Scales saved.'=>'An ajiye ma\'aunai.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Ma\'aunan sun koma na asali.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Sake saita zuwa ma\'auni na asali','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Babu masu canji tukuna. Mai canji yana ɗaukar ƙima ɗaya — faɗi, haɗin launi, girman rubutu — wanda abubuwa da yawa ke rabawa tare.','Add variable'=>'Ƙara canjin ma\'auni','Variables saved.'=>'An ajiye sauye-sauyen.','Entrance animation'=>'Motsin shigowa','Fade in'=>'Bayyana a hankali','Fade in, rising'=>'Bayyana a hankali, yana tashi','Fade in, dropping'=>'Bayyana a hankali, yana faɗuwa','Fade in from the start side'=>'Bayyana a hankali daga gefen farawa','Fade in from the end side'=>'Dushewa a hankali daga ƙarshen gefe','Zoom out'=>'Rage girma','Flip up'=>'Karkata sama','Animation length (ms)'=>'Tsayin motsi (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Jinkirin motsi (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Yayin lilo','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Bayyana a hankali yayin da yake shigowa cikin gani','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Tashi yayin da yake shiga cikin gani','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Girma yayin da yake shiga cikin gani','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Miƙe yayin da yake bayyana yayin lilo','On hover'=>'Yayin shawagi','Lift'=>'Ɗaga','Glow'=>'Haske','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Tsaya a bayyane (px daga sama)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Gudun parallax (-10 zuwa 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Bi mai nuni (ƙarfi)','Place ID'=>'ID na Wuri','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Nemo shi tare da Place ID finder na Google: bincika kasuwancin ku kuma ku kwafi ID ɗin.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Maɓallin API daga aikin Google Cloud ɗinku tare da kunna Places API (New). Takaita shi zuwa wancan API ɗin.','Business unit ID'=>'ID na rukunin kasuwanci','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'ID mai haruffa 24 na kasuwancinku a Trustpilot, daga asusunku na Trustpilot Business (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Makullin API na asusun kasuwancinku na Trustpilot.','Not set up.'=>'Ba a saita ba.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallan tsaro na rukunin yanar gizon). Sake shigar da shi.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Yana buƙatar duka ID da maɓallin API.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Saitawa. Ana ɗora bitocin Google kai tsaye a duk lokacin da aka duba shafi mai ɓangaren Bitoci: buƙatar Place Details guda ɗaya a kowane kallo ta amfani da maɓallinku na kanku, ba a taɓa adana su ba (sharuddan Google ba su ba da damar ajiye su ba).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Sabuntawar farko ta gaza: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Ana jiran sabuntawa na farko (cikin minti ɗaya ko biyu).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'An sabunta %1$s: an ajiye bita %2$d, an ba da kima da kashi %3$s daga %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Ƙoƙari na ƙarshe, %1$s, ya gaza kuma an riƙe bitoci da ke sama: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'An ajiye. Ana ɗauko bitocin Trustpilot a bango cikin minti ɗaya ko biyu; bitocin Google suna ɗora kai tsaye a shafin.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Ana samo bitocin Trustpilot sau ɗaya a rana a ɓoye kuma a adana su a rukunin yanar gizonku, don haka shafi mai yawan ziyara ba zai jawo ƙarin kuɗi a asusunku na Trustpilot ba; idan sabuntawa ta gaza, bitocin na ƙarshe za su ci gaba da zama. Google ba ya ba da damar adana bitocinsa, don haka ana loda su kai tsaye lokacin da mai ziyara ya duba shafin: kowace kallo buƙata ɗaya ce a kan maɓallin Google ɗinku, wanda Google ke caji.','Where to find it'=>'Inda za a same shi','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'An ajiye (…%s). Buga sabo domin maye gurbinsa.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Cire bayanan %s da kuma bitocinsa','Refreshed.'=>'An sabunta.','Refresh now'=>'Sabunta yanzu','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Sabuntawa ta yau da kullun ta gaba: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Bayananku na Google da Trustpilot, domin ɓangaren Reviews.','No colours yet.'=>'Babu laubuka tukunna.','Colour %d'=>'Launi %d','Add colour'=>'Ƙara launi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Launuka biyu suna da suna iri ɗaya. Sake sa wa ɗaya suna.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" ba ingantaccen launi ba ne.','Theme colours'=>'Launukan jigo','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Kayan launuka na jigonku. Canjin da aka yi a nan ana adana shi a matsayin sigar launi na rukunin yanar gizonku, kamar yadda Editan Rukunin Yanar Gizo ke adana shi, kuma yana aiki a duk inda ake amfani da launin.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Launukan jigo sun koma kan ainihin ƙimomin jigon.','Reset theme colours'=>'Sake saita launukan jigo','Your colours'=>'Launukanku','Colours saved.'=>'An ajiye launuka.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Zaɓi launi don %s','Clear'=>'Share','The change could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya ajiye canjin ba.','Theme default'=>'Gabaɗayan jigo','Theme fonts'=>'Haruffan jigo','Your fonts'=>'Haruffanku','Font stack'=>'Tarin rubutu','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Haruffan da aka ɗora: fayilolinsa sun fito ne daga ɗakin karatun haruffa.','System sans-serif'=>'Sans-serif na tsarin','Add font stack'=>'Ƙara rukunin rubutu','Fonts saved.'=>'An ajiye rukunin rubutu.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'An raba shi tare da jigonku da kuma Editan Shafin.','Fonts'=>'Haruffa','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Nau\'o\'in rubutun kanun labarai da na jiki don dukkan rukunin yanar gizon.','Back to Site design'=>'Koma zuwa Tsarin shafi','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Ajujuwa, alamomi, yanayin duhu, kayan aikin tambari da haruffan da aka keɓance suna zuwa tare da Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Bude salon Editan Yanar Gizo','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani kanun labari mai ƙarancin tsayin layi, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Sakin layi na rubutu, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Hoton da ke da kusurwoyi masu karkata, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Bidiyo daga Dakin Karatun Midiyo, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','Spacer'=>'Mai bada sarari','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Wurin da ba kowa a tsakanin tubalan; saita tsayi daban-daban dangane da girman allon a shafin Salo.','Divider'=>'Mai raba','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Layi a kwance tsakanin bangarori, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Abubuwan da ke cikin wani shafin (bidiyo, rubutu, taswira) ta hanyar liƙa adireshinsa.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Hotuna da yawa a cikin layuka, an tsara su da shafin Salo.','Plain'=>'Gari-gari','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Babu yarukan da za a canza tsakaninsu. Mai sauya yare zai bayyana lokacin da manhajar fassara ta lissafa yare biyu ko fiye.','Switcher'=>'Mai sauyawa','Show the current language'=>'Nuna yaren na yanzu','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Sanya Tranzly kuma jera harsuna biyu ko fiye, sai mai canza harshe zai bayyana a nan.','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Dropdown'=>'Zaɓe mai faɗo ƙasa','Language codes'=>'Lambobin harshe','Show each language as'=>'Nuna kowane harshe a matsayin','Language name'=>'Sunan harshe','Language code'=>'Lambar yare','Name and code'=>'Suna da lamba','Flags'=>'Tulluka','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe ta tsohuwar tsari: tuta ƙasa ce, ba yare ba.','Include the current language'=>'Haɗa da yaren yanzu','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ɓoye harsunan da ba a fassara wannan shafi zuwa gare su ba','Stack vertically'=>'Jera a tsaye','Current language text'=>'Rubutun yaren yanzu','Current language background'=>'Bayan fagen harshen yanzu','Size and spacing'=>'Girma da tazarar shafi','Space between languages'=>'Tazara tsakanin harsuna','Text size'=>'Girmar rubutu','Connected (key %s).'=>'An haɗa (mabuɗi %s).','API URL'=>'URL na API','Replace the API key'=>'Sauya maɓallin API','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Inda za a sami maɓallin API na %s ɗinku','Check and save'=>'Duba kuma adana','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Haɗa sabis ɗin lissafin aika saƙo sau ɗaya; sannan kowane fom zai iya ƙara mutanen da suka cika shi zuwa ɗaya daga cikin jerin sunayenku (saitunan toshewar fom → Bayan aikawa). Ana bincika makullan tare da sabis ɗin, a adana su a ɓoye a wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma ba za a sake nuna su ba.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'Aika bayanan fom da dannawar madanni zuwa nazarin bayananku ba tare da rubuta lamba ba. Bar ID a sarari don tsallake waccan sabis ɗin. Madannai suna samun filin "Conversion event" a sashinsu na Advanced. Tare da kunna allon kuki, babu abin da zai loda har sai maziyari ya amince.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'ID ɗin auna Google Analytics 4','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'ID ɗin akwati na Google Tag Manager','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'ID na Meta Pixel (lambar da aka nuna a Meta Events Manager)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Loda waɗannan alamomi a shafina','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Kashe idan jigarku ko wani plugin ya riga ya ƙara su; ana ci gaba da aika al\'amuran.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Sunan aukuwa don ƙaddamar da fom','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Banner ɗin wani popup ne da kuke tsarawa ta hanyar amfani da tubalan ginawa (blocks). Maballan sa suna haɗawa da #consent-accept, #consent-reject da #consent-save (tare da akwatunan zaɓe masu suna analytics da marketing don "save"); hanyar haɗi zuwa #consent-open a kowane wuri tana sake nuna shi. Har sai maziyarci ya yarda, alamun bibiya ba sa lodi, Yanayin Yarda na Google (Google Consent Mode) yana kasancewa a matsayin "denied", kuma rubutun da kuka lissafa suna kasancewa a kashe.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Ƙirƙiri tutar da aka riga aka shirya','Show a cookie banner'=>'Nuna sanarwar kuki','Banner'=>'Bana','Choose a popup…'=>'Zaɓi wani popup…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (tsari)','Edit the banner'=>'Gyara banner','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Ka tuna da zaɓin na tsawon (kwanaki)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'A wajen Tarayyar Turai, EEA da Birtaniya: loda bin sawu har sai mai ziyara ya ce a\'a','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Kashe: dole ne kowane mai ziyara ya fara yarda (dokar da ta fi tsauri, kuma ita ce ta asali). Kunna: kawai lokacin da mai masaukin ku ko CDN ya ba da rahoton ƙasar mai ziyara (misali Cloudflare ta CF-IPCountry header) kuma tana wajen EU, EEA, UK da Switzerland. Har yanzu ana nuna allon sanarwar, kuma ana ɗaukar ƙasar da ba a sani ba a matsayin tana cikin EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Sauran rubutun da za a riƙe har sai an sami yarda (handle:analytics ko handle:marketing, an raba da waƙafi)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Tagogi masu tashi, masu zamewa da kuma sanduna','A/B test results'=>'Sakamakon gwajin A/B','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Jagorori: fom-fom, fafutoci, motsi, bibiya, gwaje-gwajen A/B da kuma allon sanarwar kuki','Mailing-list connections'=>'Haɗin jerin aika saƙonni','Popup settings'=>'Saitunan faɗakarwa mai fita','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Tagar mai tashi (a tsakiya, shafi ya disashe)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Zamewa ciki (a kusurwa)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Sanda (sama ko ƙasa)','Bottom, end side'=>'Kasa, gefen ƙarshe','Bottom, start side'=>'Kasa, gefen farawa','When the page loads'=>'Lokacin da shafi ya buɗe','After a delay'=>'Bayan ɗan lokaci','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Bayan an gungura wani yanki na shafin','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Lokacin da mai ziyara ke gab da fita','When something is clicked'=>'Idan an danna wani abu','Percent of the page'=>'Kason shafi','CSS selector of the element'=>'Zaɓin CSS na abin','How often'=>'Sau nawa','Every page view'=>'Kowane duba shafi','Once per visit'=>'Sau ɗaya a kowace ziyara','Once every few days'=>'Sau ɗaya a kowace \'yan kwanaki','Until the visitor converts'=>'Har sai mai ziyara ya sauya','Every page'=>'Kowace shafi','The front page'=>'Shafin gaba','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Shafukan da aka zaɓa (ID-IDs)','Chosen content types'=>'Nau\'o\'in abun ciki da aka zaɓa','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'ID-din shafuka, an raba da waƙafi','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Nau\'o\'in abun ciki, an raba su da waƙafi (post, page, product)','Devices'=>'Na\'urori','Desktop only'=>'Kwamfuta kaɗai','Mobile only'=>'Wayar hannu kawai','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Rufe lokacin da aka danna shafin da aka dusashe','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'Haɗa maɓalli zuwa #popup-close don rufe fafutikar, ko zuwa #popup-convert don ƙidaya juyi.','Conversion event'=>'Abin da ya faru na sauyawa','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'Ana aikawa da nazarinku idan aka danna wannan (misali sign_up). Saita ayyukan a ƙarƙashin Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'An ba wakilan AI izini. Sake loda wannan shafi domin ganin kayan aikin.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'An kashe wakilan AI. Adireshin haɗin su ba ya sake amsawa.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s yana gyara wannan shafi kuma. Yin ajiya na iya shafe sauye-sauyen da ya yi.','Block library'=>'Dakin kundayen tubali','Layers'=>'Kashin-kashi','Page canvas'=>'Fannin shafi','Revisions'=>'Sauye-sauye','Block settings'=>'Saitunan shinge','Add block: %s'=>'Ƙara block: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Bude a Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Soke','Redo'=>'Sake yi','Show or hide layers'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye yadudduka','Show or hide the block library'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye ɗakin karatu na shinge','Show revisions'=>'Nuna sauye-sauye','Open the normal editor'=>'Bude edita na yau da kullun','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gajerun hanyoyin maballin rubutu','Preview: desktop'=>'Rigakafin gani: na\'urar tebur','Preview: tablet'=>'Rigakafin gani: kwamfutar hannu','Preview: mobile'=>'Samfoti: wayar hannu','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Kofi salon shingen da aka zaɓa','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Manna salo a kan shingen da aka zaɓa','Copy the selected section'=>'Kwafi ɓangaren da aka zaɓa','Paste a copied section'=>'Manna sashin da aka kwafa','Turn off safe mode'=>'Kashe yanayin aminci','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Kunna yanayin kariya (sauran manhajoji a kashe, don ku kawai, a Studio kadai)','Scheduled'=>'An tsara','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran dubawa','Private'=>'Keɓaɓɓe','Draft'=>'Daftarce','All changes saved'=>'An ajiye duk canje-canje','Saving…'=>'Ana adanawa…','Autosaving…'=>'Ana adanawa da kanta…','Unsaved changes'=>'Canje-canjen da ba a ajiye ba','autosaved'=>'an adana ta atomatik','Desktop preview'=>'Rigakafin tebur','Tablet preview'=>'Samfoti na kwamfutar hannu','Mobile preview'=>'Samfoti a wayar hannu','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'Rigakafin %1$s (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Kayan aikin situdiyo','Back to the normal editor'=>'Koma zuwa edita na al\'ada','Page title'=>'Taken shafi','Preview width'=>'Faɗin samfoti','Command palette'=>'Allon umarni','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Duba shafi (yana buɗewa a sabon shafin)','Save draft'=>'Ajiye daftarin aiki','Publish'=>'Buga','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'A maido da canje-canjen da ba a ajiye ba?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da sauye-sauyen da ba a taɓa ajiyewa ba. An ajiye su a cikin wannan burawzar:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da sabon adana-kai-tsaye fiye da sigar da aka adana:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mayar da sauye-sauyen da ba a ajiye ba','Discard'=>'Watsar','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda bita-bita ba.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'An maido da bita. Ajiye don riƙe shi, ko soke don komawa baya.','Close revisions'=>'Rufe gyare-gyare','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Babu gyare-gyare tukuna. Kowane ajiya yana yin ɗaya.','Revision from %s'=>'Bita daga %s','Restore this revision'=>'Mayar da wannan bita','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Ba a iya canza yanayin tsaro ba.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Yanayin kariya yana kunne.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'An kashe wani ƙarin plugin guda %d, don kai da kuma a cikin Sandwich Studio kawai. Wannan ba zai shafi rukunin yanar gizo na gaske da sauran masu amfani ba.' . "\0" . 'An kashe wasu manhajoji na daban guda %d, don ku kaɗai kuma a cikin Sandwich Studio kaɗai. Wannan bai shafi rukunin yanar gizo mai aiki kai tsaye da sauran masu amfani ba.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Yanayin aminci: kashe sauran manhajoji a cikin Studio, domin ku kaɗai','Save as pattern'=>'Ajiye a matsayin samfuri','Synced'=>'An daidaita','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Gyara samfurin nan gaba zai canza shi a duk inda ake amfani da shi.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Kowanne kwafi ana iya gyara shi daban.','Save your changes.'=>'Ajiye canje-canjenku.','Undo your last change.'=>'Soke canjin ku na ƙarshe.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Sake yin abin da ka soke na ƙarshe.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye allon yadudduka.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Nuna waɗannan gajerun hanyoyin madannai.','Select a block first.'=>'Fara zaɓar wani bange tukuna.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi salo. Liƙa shi a kan kowane shinge, a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ko wani daban.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Burawuza ta ki kwafawa.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi sashen. Manna shi a kowane shafi, a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ko wani daban.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Allon kwafi ba ya ɗauke da salon da aka kwofo daga Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'An manna salo a kan bulogi %d.' . "\0" . 'An liƙa salo a kan tubalan %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Wannan salon bai dace da toshe da aka zaɓa ba.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Allon kwafi ba ya ɗauke da wani sashe da aka kwafa.','Section pasted.'=>'An manna ɓangare.','Paste style'=>'Manna salo','Paste section'=>'Manna sashe','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Danna Ctrl+V (ko Cmd+V a Mac) a nan don liƙawa','Copy style'=>'Kofi salo','Copy section'=>'Kwafi sashin','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara a Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Ajiye ya faskara. Bincika haɗin intanet ɗinka kuma sake gwadawa; an ajiye canje-canjenka a cikin wannan burawzar.','Published.'=>'An buga.','Post types (none = any)'=>'Nau\'o\'in rubutu (babu ko ɗaya = kowane)','Posts or pages (type to search)'=>'Rubuce-rubuce ko shafuka (rubuta domin bincika)','Terms (type to search)'=>'Sharuɗɗa (rubuta don bincika)','Blog page'=>'Shafin blog','Author archives'=>'Rumbun adana bayanan marubuci','Date archives'=>'Rumbunan bayanai na kwanan wata','%s archives'=>'Rumbunan adana bayanai na %s','%s archive'=>'Rumbun ajiya na %s','Archives (none = any)'=>'Tarihanta (babu kowa = kowane)','Visitors who are'=>'Baƙin da suke','Logged in'=>'An shiga','Logged out'=>'An fita','Roles'=>'Matsayi','Until'=>'Har zuwa','Sun'=>'Lah','Mon'=>'Lit','Tue'=>'Tal','Wed'=>'Lar','Thu'=>'Alh','Fri'=>'Jum','Sat'=>'Asb','Parameter'=>'Siffa','Value (empty = any)'=>'Ƙima (fili = kowane)','Came from an address containing (empty = typed in directly)'=>'Ya fito daga adireshin da ke ɗauke da (babu komai = an shigar da shi kai tsaye)','The cart'=>'Kekensiyayya','Has items'=>'Yana da abubuwa','Is empty'=>'Babu komai','Contains a product'=>'Yana ɗauke da samfuri','Contains a product from a category'=>'Ya ƙunshi samfur daga wani rukuni','Subtotal is at least'=>'Jimillar kuɗi ta kai aƙalla','IDs, separated by commas'=>'ID-odi, an raba su da waƙafi','Add a condition'=>'Ƙara sharaɗi','Add'=>'Ƙara','This row (inside a field loop)'=>'Wannan layin (a cikin madaukin fili)','Fill “%s” from'=>'Cika "%s" daga','Nothing (typed in)'=>'Babu komai (an rubuta)','Use it as a link or image address'=>'Yi amfani da shi azaman mahada ko adireshin hoto','Dynamic content'=>'Abun ciki mai canzawa','Fill this block from the post, its author, the site or a custom field. Inside a query loop, each card shows its own item.'=>'Cika wannan bulogin daga rubutun, marubucinsa, rukunin yanar gizon ko kuma fili na musamman. A cikin madubin tambaya, kowane kati yana nuna abinsa.','Template'=>'Samfuri','This template is a'=>'Wannan samfuri ne','Start from a ready-made design'=>'Fara daga tsari da aka shirya','Show it on'=>'Nuna shi a','No conditions: everywhere this type of template applies.'=>'Babu sharuɗɗa: a duk inda wannan nau\'in samfurin ya shafi.','But not on'=>'Amma ba a kan','Add exception'=>'Ƙara keɓancewa','Priority'=>'Fifikon Aiki','When two templates match the same page, the higher priority wins.'=>'Idan samfura biyu sun dace da shafi guda, wanda ya fi fifiko ne zai yi aiki.','Show this block when'=>'Nuna wannan bulogin lokacin da','All conditions are met'=>'Dukkan sharuɗɗa sun cika','Any condition is met'=>'Kowane sharadi ya cika','This block always shows. Add a condition to show it only to some visitors, on some pages or at some times.'=>'Wannan block ɗin yana nunawa a ko da yaushe. Ƙara sharaɗi domin nuna shi kawai ga wasu maziyartan, a wasu shafukan ko kuma a wasu lokuta.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Yanayin gyare-gyare da na kafin ƙaddamarwa','What visitors see'=>'Abin da masu ziyara suke gani','The site, as normal'=>'Shafin, kamar yadda yake a saba','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Gyara: sanarwa, kuma ana gaya wa injunan bincike su dawo daga baya','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Kafin ƙaddamarwa: sanarwa, kuma an umurci injunan bincike da kada su bibiyi rukunin yanar gizon','Page to show instead'=>'Shafin da za a nuna a maimakon haka','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Tsara kowane shafi tare da magini sannan ka zaɓe shi a nan. Idan babu ɗaya, baƙi za su ga ɗan gajeren sanarwa mai ɗauke da sunan rukunin yanar gizon.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Waye har yanzu yake ganin ainihin rukunin yanar gizon (masu gudanarwa koyaushe suna gani):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Bude rukunin yanar gizon a cikin taga na sirri don ganin abin da maziyarta ke gani.','Network settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saitunan hanyar sadarwa.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna aiki ne a kan rukunin yanar gizo na %d a cikin wannan hanyar sadarwa.' . "\0" . 'Wadannan saitunan suna aiki ne a kan rukunin yanar gizo guda %d a cikin wannan hanyar sadarwa.','Shared templates'=>'Samfuran da aka raba','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Samfuran da aka ajiye a babban shafin da aka yi wa alama a nan suna bayyana a kowane shafi, a ƙarƙashin "Samfuran hanyar sadarwa". Kowane shafi yana sanya kwafin kansa.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Babban shafin ba shi da wasu tsare-tsare da aka ajiye tukunna.','White label for every site'=>'Alamar sirri (White label) ga kowane shafi','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Ana amfani da shi ta kowane shafi wanda bai ajiye saitunan lakabin kansa (white-label) ba.','Turn white label on'=>'Kuna alamar farar fata','Builder name'=>'Sunan magina','Visual editor name'=>'Sunan editan na gani','Author website'=>'Gidan yanar gizon marubuci','Menu icon'=>'Gunkin mazaɓa','Role defaults for every site'=>'Gidajen matsayi na asali ga kowane shafi','Save network settings'=>'Ajiye saitunan hanyar sadarwa','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Ana bincike… abubuwa %d aka duba zuwa yanzu.' . "\0" . 'Ana bincike… abubuwa %d aka duba zuwa yanzu.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Babu wanda ya dace a cikin abubuwa %d. Babu abin da za a canza.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'An sami daidaito %1$d a shafuka %2$d (an bincika abubuwa %3$d). Babu abin da ya canza tukuna.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Ana maye gurbi… Shafuka %1$d cikin %2$d an kammala.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'An kammala: shafi %d ya sauya. Za ku iya soke wannan.' . "\0" . 'An kammala: shafuka %d sun canza. Za ku iya soke wannan.','Undoing…'=>'Ana soke aiki…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'An soke: An maido da shafuka %1$d. An gyara shafuka %2$d bayan sauyawar kuma an bar su yadda suke.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'An soke: an maido da shafi %d.' . "\0" . 'An soke: an maido da shafuka %d.','Replace'=>'Sauya','Find'=>'Nemo','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Launin hex kamar #1a73e8. Gajerun sifofi (#fff) ma sun dace.','Replace with'=>'Sauya da','Match upper and lower case'=>'Daidaita manya da ƙananan haruffa','Find matches'=>'Nemo daidai','Matches'=>'Masu dacewa','Replace on %d page'=>'Sauya a kan shafi %d' . "\0" . 'Sauya a kan shafuka %d','Undo this replacement'=>'Soke wannan sauyawar','Review comments'=>'Duba sharhi','Add a comment'=>'Ƙara sharhi','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Sharhi na %1$d daga %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Sharhi %d akan wannan shafi.','Your comment'=>'Sharhinku','Send comment'=>'Aika sharhi','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Na gode, an aika da sharhinku.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Danna sashin shafin da sharhinku ya shafa.','Client review'=>'Binciken abokin ciniki','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'Ba a iya samun wannan sashin shafin ba: yana iya yiwuwa an canza shi ko kuma an cire shi tun bayan da aka yi tsokacin.','Review link'=>'Duba hanyar haɗi','Let a client comment on this page'=>'Bada damar abokin ciniki ya yi tsokaci a wannan shafi','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'Duk wanda ke da hanyar haɗin zai iya ganin wannan shafi, koda kafin a buga shi, kuma ya bar sharhi. Ba a buƙatar asusu.','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon mahada (tsohon zai daina aiki)','Comments (%d open)'=>'Sharhohi (%d a buɗe)' . "\0" . 'Sharhohi